		["{npc:1872} works the forge west of the distillery.\nThen go in: {npc:6806}, the innkeeper, {npc:1226} and {npc:1267}. {npc:1699}'s {skill:185} lesson waits for the return with the ribs, when the copper is there for it."] = "{npc:1872}在釀酒廠西邊的鐵匠鋪幹活。\n然後進去：旅店老闆{npc:6806}、{npc:1226}和{npc:1267}。{npc:1699}的{skill:185}課程要等你帶著肋排回來才教，那時銅幣也夠了。",
