		["{npc:11065} gives it and takes it back once your {skill:333} skill is 20: gather or craft until then, the guide carries on meanwhile."] = "{npc:11065}給出任務，並在你的{skill:333}技能達到20時收回：在此之前採集或製作，指南同時繼續進行。",
