t.guides["forever/collectibles/mounts/alliance/winterspring-frostsaber"] = (function() return {
		["The Forever client lists it at 200g and level 60. It runs at full speed yet needs no riding training at all, only Honored with the {faction:589}, so you can skip the 1,000g Journeyman Riding if this is your fast mount."] = "Forever客戶端把它標為200金、60級。它以全速奔跑，卻完全不需要騎術訓練，只要對{faction:589}達到尊敬，所以如果這就是你的快速坐騎，你可以省下1000金的初級騎術。",
		["{npc:10618} stands on top of {area:2241} in the far north of {zone:1452}. Only the Alliance can earn the {faction:589}' favour, from level 58: three repeatable quests worth 50 each, about 840 turn-ins from Neutral to Exalted. Frostsaber Provisions is open from the start, Winterfall Intrusion from halfway through Neutral and Rampaging Giants from Honored. The Wintersaber Trainers Reputation guide takes you through it."] = "{npc:10618}站在{zone:1452}最北端的{area:2241}頂上。只有聯盟能獲得{faction:589}的好感，從58級開始：三個可重複任務，每個50點聲望，從中立到崇拜大約要交840次。霜刃豹補給從一開始就能做，冬泉入侵從中立過半開始，狂暴巨人從尊敬開始。冬刃豹訓練師聲望攻略會帶你走完。",
		["{npc:10618}, 200g"] = "{npc:10618}，200金",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/collectibles/mounts/horde/black-war-mounts"] = (function() return {
		["Black War Mounts"] = "黑色戰鬥坐騎",
		["PvP rank 11"] = "PvP軍階11",
		["{item:18247}, {spell:18995}, 100g"] = "{item:18247}，{spell:18995}，100金",
		["{item:18248}, {spell:10906}, 100g"] = "{item:18248}，{spell:10906}，100金",
		["{npc:12796} sells the mounts by the {area:2917} in {zone:1454}'s {object:172958}, beside the other honor quartermasters. The Forever client lists each at 100g. Each one also needs its kind's riding: Orcs ride the wolf, Trolls the raptor, Tauren the kodo, Undead the skeletal warhorse. A Skyborne, or anyone choosing another race's mount, first needs that riding from its trainer (Exalted with the race's city)."] = "{npc:12796}在{zone:1454}的{object:172958}中{area:2917}旁出售坐騎，和其他榮譽軍需官在一起。Forever 客戶端標價每匹100金。每種坐騎還需要對應種族的騎術：獸人騎狼，食人妖騎迅猛龍，牛頭人騎科多獸，不死族騎骷髏戰馬。天裔或選擇其他種族坐騎的人，須先從對應訓練師處學會該騎術（與那種族的城市達到崇拜）。",
		["{npc:14329}, {spell:825}, 100g"] = "{npc:14329}，{spell:825}，100金",
		["{npc:14330}, {spell:10861}, 100g"] = "{npc:14330}，{spell:10861}，100金",
		["{spell:1299382} come from battlegrounds, PvP quests and the season's weekly tasks, with a weekly cap; {spell:436438} (rank 11) unlocks the Black War mounts. The Player vs. Player tab of your character pane shows your rank and what you may buy. {skill:762} one at full speed needs Journeyman {skill:762} (level 60). Polestar cannot read your rank, so this step waits for level 60 and Journeyman {skill:762}."] = "{spell:1299382}來自戰場、PvP任務和當季的每週任務，有每週上限；{spell:436438}（11級軍銜）解鎖黑色戰爭坐騎。角色面板的“玩家對戰”標籤頁會顯示你的軍銜和可購買內容。要讓{skill:762}達到全速需要中級{skill:762}（60級）。Polestar 無法讀取你的軍銜，因此這一步要等到60級和中級{skill:762}。",
} end)()
