		["Flight paths here: {area:35} (Gringer), {object:3202} (Thysta)."] = "此處飛行路線：{area:35}（格林戈）、{object:3202}（塞斯塔）。",
		["Fly to {area:271} in {zone:1424} and walk north into the {zone:1416}."] = "飛往{zone:1424}的{area:271}，向北走進{zone:1416}。",
		["Fly to {area:272} in {zone:1424} and walk north into the {zone:1416}."] = "飛往{zone:1424}的{area:272}，向北走進{zone:1416}。",
		["From the south of the {zone:1418}, past {area:345}, a way leads down into the {zone:2548} by {area:16685}. (The {zone:2548} also open off northern Redridge through {area:2417}, and a ship runs from {area:977} in {zone:1446} to {area:16727}, the neutral goblin port on its coast.) {area:17780} is an ogre clan's outdoor dungeon."] = "從{zone:1418}南部經過{area:345}，有一條路向下通往{area:16685}旁的{zone:2548}。（{zone:2548}也可從赤脊山北部經{area:2417}進入，還有一艘船從{zone:1446}的{area:977}開往其海岸上的中立哥布林港口{area:16727}。）{area:17780}是一個食人魔氏族的野外地城。",
		["Horde town: Alliance characters only need to touch its edge (guards)"] = "部落城鎮：聯盟角色只需碰到邊緣即可（有守衛）",
		["Or take the zeppelin from {zone:1454} or the {zone:1458} to {area:117}."] = "或從{zone:1454}或{zone:1458}搭飛艇前往{area:117}。",
		["Ride west out of the {zone:1435} through {zone:1430} (level 50+ creatures off the road) into {zone:1431} and take the road south into northern {zone:1434}."] = "從{zone:1435}向西騎出，穿過{zone:1430}（路外有50級以上的怪物），進入{zone:1431}，再沿路向南進入{zone:1434}北部。",
		["Starts in the {zone:1416}, north of {zone:1424}, and ends in {zone:1434}. 15 areas to discover here, levels 27-39."] = "從{zone:1424}以北的{zone:1416}開始，到{zone:1434}結束。本段有15個區域可探索，等級27-39。",
		["The {zone:1417} lie east of the {zone:1416} and {zone:1424}."] = "{zone:1417}位於{zone:1416}和{zone:1424}的東邊。",
		["The {zone:1435} lies south of the {zone:2548}: swim south from {area:16725}, or walk through Redridge Pass, south of the {area:16737}."] = "{zone:1435}位於{zone:2548}以南：從{area:16725}向南游過去，或走{area:16737}以南的赤脊山隘口。",
		["any one of these names counts"] = "這些名稱中任何一個都算數",
		["elite Syndicate and ogres inside the walls: the discovery triggers at the gate"] = "城牆內有精英辛迪加和巨魔：在大門處就會觸發發現",
		["elite ogres: discover it from the edge"] = "精英巨魔：從邊緣發現它",
		["free-for-all PvP inside the arena ring"] = "競技場圈內為自由PvP",
		["level 50 area, well above this guide's range"] = "50級區域，遠高於本指南的等級範圍",
		["{area:320} in the middle is the Alliance town; {area:321} in the east is Horde."] = "中部的{area:320}是聯盟城鎮；東部的{area:321}是部落城鎮。",
		["{area:321} in the east is the Horde town; {area:320} in the middle is Alliance."] = "東部的{area:321}是部落城鎮；中部的{area:320}是聯盟城鎮。",
		["{area:340} in the west is the Horde town."] = "西部的{area:340}是部落城鎮。",
