		["level 63 area, well above this guide's range"] = "63級區域，遠高於本指南的等級範圍",
		["{zone:1423} lie east of {zone:1422}, across the {area:2619}. {area:2268} in the east has flight masters for both factions."] = "{zone:1423}位於{zone:1422}東邊，隔著{area:2619}。東邊的{area:2268}有雙方陣營的飛行管理員。",
