		["21 {item:11137} for {item:11145} and {spell:13746}: {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 31-40."] = "準備21個{item:11137}製作{item:11145}和{spell:13746}：{skill:333}：分解物品等級31-40的綠色物品。",
		["34 {item:8831} for {item:20747}: {skill:182}: {item:8831} (skill 210) in {zone:1425} (40-50), {zone:1444} (40-50) and {zone:1447} (45-55). The densest patch of {item:8831} in {zone:1425} is marked."] = "為{item:20747}準備34個{item:8831}：透過{skill:182}在{zone:1425}（40-50級）、{zone:1444}（40-50級）和{zone:1447}（45-55級）採集{item:8831}（需要技能210）。已標記{zone:1425}中{item:8831}最密集的區域。",
		["34 {item:8831} for {item:20747}: {skill:182}: {item:8831} (skill 210) in {zone:1425} (40-50), {zone:1444} (40-50) and {zone:1447} (45-55). The densest patch of {item:8831} in {zone:1444} is marked."] = "準備34個{item:8831}製作{item:20747}：{skill:182}：在{zone:1425}（40-50級）、{zone:1444}（40-50級）和{zone:1447}（45-55級）採集{item:8831}（技能210）。已標記{zone:1444}中{item:8831}最密集的位置。",
		["39 {item:11137} for {spell:13815}: {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 31-40."] = "準備39個{item:11137}製作{spell:13815}：{skill:333}：分解物品等級31-40的綠色物品。",
		["51 {item:10940} for {spell:7420}: {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 5-20."] = "準備51個{item:10940}製作{spell:7420}：{skill:333}：分解物品等級5-20的綠色物品。",
		["71 {item:11083} for {item:11130}, {spell:13501} and {spell:13637}: {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 21-30."] = "準備71個{item:11083}製作{item:11130}、{spell:13501}和{spell:13637}：{skill:333}：分解物品等級21-30的綠色物品。",
		["Apprentice {skill:333} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Not every {skill:333} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:3606} ({zone:1438}), {npc:11068} ({zone:1453}), {npc:257004} (Zephras Isle), {npc:11070} ({zone:1457}), {npc:257020} (Zephras Isle) and {npc:11065} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:257004} (Zephras Isle), {npc:11066} ({zone:1454}), {npc:11067} ({zone:1458}), {npc:11071} ({zone:1456}), {npc:257020} (Zephras Isle), {npc:266881} ({zone:1411}) and {npc:5695} ({zone:1420}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Buy a {item:6217} and {item:247786} from an enchanting supplies vendor (in the capitals and on Zephras Isle; the starting-area trainers have none beside them, and the next step's arrow picks the nearest). From now on, disenchant every green you do not wear: that is where the dust and essences come from. Two starter quests teach Disenchant on a quest item: An Enchanting Lesson from {npc:11072} ({area:91}, {zone:1429}) and A Pain in the Neck from {npc:266881} ({area:367}, {zone:1411}). 1-75 takes about 50c of recipes and 4s 44c of vendor goods, plus 51 {item:10940} to gather or buy."] = "初級{skill:333}可讓你把技能練到75，學費10銅，不限角色等級。並非每位{skill:333}訓練師都會教：聯盟有{npc:3606}（{zone:1438}）、{npc:11068}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:257004}（微風島）、{npc:11070}（{zone:1457}）、{npc:257020}（微風島）和{npc:11065}（{zone:1455}）；部落有{npc:257004}（微風島）、{npc:11066}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:11067}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:11071}（{zone:1456}）、{npc:257020}（微風島）、{npc:266881}（{zone:1411}）和{npc:5695}（{zone:1420}）。箭頭會選擇你陣營最近的一位。向附魔材料商人購買一個{item:6217}和一個{item:247786}（各主城和微風島都有；起始地區的訓練師旁邊沒有，下一步的箭頭會指向最近的一位）。從現在起，分解所有你不穿的綠色裝備：粉末和精華就是從這裡來的。兩個入門任務會教你對任務物品使用分解：{npc:11072}（{zone:1429}的{area:91}）的附魔入門任務，以及{npc:266881}（{zone:1411}的{area:367}）的「頸上麻煩」。1-75約需50銅的配方和4銀44銅的商人材料，另需採集或購買51個{item:10940}。",
		["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:333} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. {npc:11073} teaches Artisan {skill:333} inside the {area:1517} dungeon ({zone:1418}); bring a group. Learn now: {spell:13815} (from 210). 225-300 takes about 2g 20s of recipes and 1g 70s of vendor goods, plus 34 {item:8831}, 39 {item:11137} and 208 {item:11176} to gather or buy."] = "大師級把上限從225提高到300，收費5金（經典舊世的價格；Forever的價格不在資料中）；它需要{skill:333} 200和角色35級，所以從200起任何一次造訪都能學。{npc:11073}在{area:1517}地城（{zone:1418}）內教授大師級{skill:333}；要帶隊伍。現在學：{spell:13815}（210起）。225-300大約花2金20銀的配方錢和1金70銀的商人貨物，外加34個{item:8831}、39個{item:11137}和208個{item:11176}，需自行採集或購買。",
		["Artisan {skill:333}"] = "專家級{skill:333}",
		["Back to an {skill:333} trainer: {spell:7420} (from 15, 50c). Also learn {spell:1230643} (1s): Forever's {skill:333} camp item, 1 {item:4470} and 1 {item:10940}, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: {skill:333} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an enchanting trainer who teaches it free."] = "回去找 {skill:333} 訓練師：學習 {spell:7420}（15點起可學，50銅幣）。同時學習 {spell:1230643}（1銀幣）：這是無限服的 {skill:333} 露營物品，需要1根 {item:4470} 和1份 {item:10940}，放在營地的營火旁可獲得增益效果。起始地區的露營嚮導在“廣闊天地”之後提供的“露營基礎：{skill:333}”任務，會指引你找附魔訓練師免費學習它。",
		["Back to an {skill:333} trainer: {spell:7795} (from 100) and {spell:13501} (from 130)."] = "回到{skill:333}訓練師那裡：{spell:7795}（100點起）和{spell:13501}（130點起）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 1 {item:6217} (1s 24c) and 32 {item:247786} (3s 20c); about 4s 44c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286} and {npc:1318}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3346} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次買齊這一段所需的全部：1個{item:6217}（1銀24銅）和32個{item:247786}（3銀20銅）；總共約4銀44銅。箭頭會指向本陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}和{npc:1318}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3346}和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 34 {item:8925} (1g 70s); about 1g 70s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286}, Eldraeith and {npc:1325}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3348} and {npc:3334})."] = "一次買齊這一段所需的全部：34個{item:8925}（1金70銀）；總共約1金70銀。箭頭會指向本陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}、Eldraeith和{npc:1325}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3348}和{npc:3334}）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 4 {item:10938} (32s). The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction. {item:10938}: no vendor of the other faction sells it; that side gathers or buys it at the Auction House (next steps)."] = "一次買齊這個階段的用量：4個{item:10938}（32銀）。箭頭會指向你陣營最近的賣家。{item:10938}：另一陣營沒有商人販售；那一方要自己採集或在拍賣場購買（接下來的步驟）。",
		["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:333} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11072} ({zone:1429}); Horde {npc:11074} ({zone:1442}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:13628} (from 150). 150-225 takes 1 {item:5500}, 1 {item:7971}, 1 {item:11082}, 71 {item:11083}, 1 {item:11128}, 1 {item:11135}, 21 {item:11137} and 1 {item:11144} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {spell:13637} (from 160), {item:11145} (from 200) and {spell:13746} (from 205), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3."] = "高階可將技能上限從150提高到225，費用50銀幣（經典舊世價格；資料中沒有無限價格）；需要{skill:333}125和角色20級，因此技能125後任何一次經過時都可學習。只有少數訓練師能教：聯盟{npc:11072}（{zone:1429}）；部落{npc:11074}（{zone:1442}）。箭頭指向本陣營最近的一位。現在學習：{spell:13628}（需要技能150）。150-225需收集或購買1個{item:5500}、1個{item:7971}、1個{item:11082}、71個{item:11083}、1個{item:11128}、1個{item:11135}、21個{item:11137}和1個{item:11144}。帶齊材料再來（按上方步驟準備，其餘從拍賣行購買）：這些訓練師還教授{spell:13637}（需要160）、{item:11145}（需要200）及{spell:13746}（需要205），而製作無需工作臺，所以可就在這裡製作，技能達標就學習對應配方。這樣只需跑1趟，不用3趟。",
		["Expert {skill:333}"] = "高級{skill:333}",
		["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:333} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:333} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:5157} ({zone:1455}), {npc:1317} ({zone:1453}), {npc:4213} ({zone:1457}) and {npc:7949} ({zone:1444}); Horde {npc:3345} ({zone:1454}), {npc:4616} ({zone:1458}) and {npc:3011} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:7771} (from 70, 2s). 75-150 takes about 2s of recipes, plus 1 {item:1210}, 1 {item:6338}, 4 {item:10938}, 121 {item:10940} and 20 {item:11083} to gather or buy."] = "中級將上限從75提高到150，費用5銀（經典版的價格；資料中沒有Forever的價格）；需要{skill:333} 50和角色等級10，所以技能達到50後，任何一次經過都可以學。並非每位{skill:333}訓練師都會教：聯盟有{npc:5157}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:1317}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:4213}（{zone:1457}）和{npc:7949}（{zone:1444}）；部落有{npc:3345}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:4616}（{zone:1458}）和{npc:3011}（{zone:1456}）。箭頭會選擇你陣營最近的一位。現在學習：{spell:7771}（技能70起，2銀）。75-150約需2銀的配方，另需採集或購買1個{item:1210}、1個{item:6338}、4個{item:10938}、121個{item:10940}和20個{item:11083}。",
		["Journeyman {skill:333}"] = "中級{skill:333}",
		["Learn {skill:333}"] = "學習{skill:333}",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:13637} (from 160)."] = "仍在高級訓練師那裡：{spell:13637}（160點起）。",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:13702} (from 200) and {spell:13746} (from 205)."] = "仍在高階訓練師處：{spell:13702}（200起）和{spell:13746}（205起）。",
		["What 1-75 takes that the Auction House sells: 51 {item:10940}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "1-75階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：51個{item:10940}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What 150-225 takes that the Auction House sells: 1 {item:5500}, 1 {item:7971}, 1 {item:11082}, 71 {item:11083}, 1 {item:11128}, 1 {item:11135}, 21 {item:11137} and 1 {item:11144}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "150-225階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：1個{item:5500}、1個{item:7971}、1個{item:11082}、71個{item:11083}、1個{item:11128}、1個{item:11135}、21個{item:11137}和1個{item:11144}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What 225-300 takes that the Auction House sells: 34 {item:8831}, 39 {item:11137} and 208 {item:11176}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "225-300階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：34個{item:8831}、39個{item:11137}和208個{item:11176}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What 75-150 takes that the Auction House sells: 1 {item:1210}, 1 {item:6338}, 4 {item:10938}, 121 {item:10940} and 20 {item:11083}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "75-150階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：1個{item:1210}、1個{item:6338}、4個{item:10938}、121個{item:10940}和20個{item:11083}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["a tool: keep it in your bags"] = "工具：放在背包裡",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包裡的配方",
		["{item:16217} teaches {spell:20017} ({skill:333} 265) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:4229} ({zone:1457}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:4561} ({zone:1458}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:16217}教{spell:20017}（{skill:333} 265），售價1金20銀。出售者：聯盟{npc:4229}（{zone:1457}），限量；部落{npc:4561}（{zone:1458}），限量。賣家每次只備一兩個，售出後過段時間補貨；它拾取即繫結，所以拍賣行永遠沒有。",
		["{item:20747} is orange at 253 (yellow 260, green 270, grey 280): about 34 crafts to 275. Each takes 1 {item:11176}, 1 {item:8831} and 1 {item:8925}. One {item:11176} (level 41-50 greens) and one {item:8831} (herbalists) a craft; the oil sells well. {npc:15419} sells the formula at the inn of {area:3425} ({zone:1451}): fly there, the mobs around it are level 55 and up."] = "{item:20747}在技能253時為橙色（260變黃，270變綠，280變灰）：約製作34次可到275。每次需要1個{item:11176}、1個{item:8831}和1個{item:8925}。也就是每次1個{item:11176}（來自41-50級綠色物品）及1個{item:8831}（草藥師採集）；這種油很好賣。{npc:15419}在{area:3425}（{zone:1451}）的旅店出售公式：飛過去，周圍怪物為55級及以上。",
		["{item:20747} to 275"] = "{item:20747} 到275",
		["{item:20754} teaches {item:20747} ({skill:333} 250) for 1g. Sold by {npc:15419} ({zone:1451})."] = "{item:20754}教{item:20747}（{skill:333} 250），售價1金。出售者{npc:15419}（{zone:1451}）。",
		["{item:5500} (Alliance)"] = "{item:5500}（聯盟）",
		["{item:5500} (Horde)"] = "{item:5500}（部落）",
		["{item:8831} (Alliance)"] = "{item:8831}（聯盟）",
		["{item:8831} (Horde)"] = "{item:8831}（部落）",
		["{skill:333} 1-75: Auction House"] = "{skill:333} 1-75：拍賣場",
		["{skill:333} 1-75: vendor goods"] = "{skill:333} 1-75：商人貨物",
		["{skill:333} 150-225: Auction House"] = "{skill:333} 150-225：拍賣場",
		["{skill:333} 225-300: Auction House"] = "{skill:333} 225-300：拍賣場",
		["{skill:333} 225-300: vendor goods"] = "{skill:333} 225-300：商人貨物",
		["{skill:333} 75-150: Auction House"] = "{skill:333} 75-150：拍賣場",
		["{skill:333} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:333} 75-150：商人材料",
		["{skill:333} recipes at 130"] = "{skill:333}130點的配方",
		["{skill:333} recipes at 160"] = "{skill:333}160點的配方",
		["{skill:333} recipes at 205"] = "{skill:333}205點的配方",
		["{skill:333} recipes at 25"] = "{skill:333}25點的配方",
		["{spell:13501} is orange at 130 (yellow 155, green 175, grey 195): about 20 crafts to 150, a point every craft. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. One {item:11083} a craft (level 21-30 greens). Make the {item:6339} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. {item:10938} (4 for 75-150): Alliance: {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 5-15; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. {skill:333} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:13501}在技能130時為橙色（155變黃、175變綠、195變灰）：約製作20次可到150，每次都加1點。每次需要1個{item:11083}。每次一個{item:11083}（21-30級的綠色物品）。先做好{item:6339}：配方需要它放在背包裡，所以一直帶著。{item:10938}（75-150需要4個）：聯盟：{skill:333}：分解物品等級5-15的綠色物品；或在拍賣場購買。對背包中任何該部位的物品附魔都可以，灰色物品也行。{skill:333}達到150是傳承系統的一個里程碑。",
		["{spell:13501} is orange at 150 (yellow 155, green 175, grey 195): about 11 crafts to 160. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. One {item:11083} a craft (level 21-30 greens). Make the {item:11130} now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. If you got here without learning {spell:13501}, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it."] = "{spell:13501}在150時為橙色（黃色155，綠色175，灰色195）：大約製作11次到160。每次需要1個{item:11083}。每次一個{item:11083}（21-30級綠色物品）。現在就做{item:11130}，趁它還能加點：後面的配方需要它在你的背包裡，所以留著。給背包裡該部位的任何物品附魔，灰色的也行。如果你到這裡還沒學會{spell:13501}，現在就學：之前的步驟會教。",
		["{spell:13501} to 150"] = "{spell:13501}練到150",
		["{spell:13501} to 160"] = "{spell:13501} 到160",
		["{spell:13637} is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 59 crafts to 205. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. {item:11083} again. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:13637}在160時為橙色（180黃、200綠、220灰）：大約59次製作可到205。每次需要1個{item:11083}。又是{item:11083}。給包中該部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["{spell:13637} to 205"] = "{spell:13637}練到205",
		["{spell:13746} is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 245, grey 265): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 1 {item:11137}. One {item:11137} a craft (level 31-40 greens). Make the {item:11145} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. {item:7971} (1 for 150-225): {item:7971} is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. {skill:333} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:13746}在技能205時為橙色（225變黃，245變綠，265變灰）：約製作20次可到225，每次漲一點。每次需要1個{item:11137}。也就是每次1個{item:11137}（來自31-40級綠色物品）。先製作{item:11145}：使用此配方時需將它保留在揹包中。{item:7971}（150-225需1個）：{item:7971}掉落稀有（沒有怪物的掉率達到五十分之一），可從拍賣行購買，或保留途中找到的。揹包中對應裝備欄位的任意物品均可用於附魔，灰色物品也行。{skill:333}225是傳承系統的一個里程碑。",
		["{spell:13746} to 225"] = "{spell:13746}練到225",
		["{spell:13815} is orange at 225 (yellow 230, green 250, grey 270): about 39 crafts to 253. Each takes 1 {item:11137}. {npc:11073} teaches it with Artisan: learn it on that visit. {item:11137} again; bring about 40. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:13815}在225時為橙色（230變黃，250變綠，270變灰）：約製作39次可升至253。每次需要1個{item:11137}。{npc:11073}在教授大師級時也會教這個配方：那次就一起學。繼續使用{item:11137}，帶約40個。揹包裡對應部位的任意物品都能附魔，即使是灰色物品。",
		["{spell:13815} to 253"] = "{spell:13815} 到253",
		["{spell:20017} is orange at 275 (yellow 285, green 305, grey 325): about 29 crafts to 300. Each takes 6 {item:11176}. Six {item:11176} a craft: the dearest stretch, so disenchant every level 41-50 green you find. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. {skill:333} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:20017}在275時為橙色（285黃、305綠、325灰）：大約29次製作可到300。每次需要6個{item:11176}。每次六份{item:11176}：最貴的一段，所以把找到的每一件41-50級綠裝都分解。給包中該部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。{skill:333} 300是傳承系統里程碑。",
		["{spell:20017} to 300"] = "{spell:20017} 到300",
		["{spell:7418} is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 22, grey 25): about 31 crafts to 25. Each takes 1 {item:247786}. One {item:247786} (10c) a craft; grey at 25 on Forever. Make the {item:6218} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7418}在1時為橙色（20黃、22綠、25灰）：大約31次製作可到25。每次需要1個{item:247786}。每次約耗一個{item:247786}（10銅）；在Forever中25時變灰。先做好{item:6218}：配方要求它在你包裡，所以一直留著。給包中該部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["{spell:7418} to 25"] = "{spell:7418}練到25",
		["{spell:7420} is orange at 25 (yellow 70, green 90, grey 110): about 51 crafts to 75. Each takes 1 {item:10940}. One {item:10940} a craft: the dust most level 5-20 greens break into, armour above all. {item:10938} (from weapons) does the same job through Bracer - Minor Deflect or Chest - {spell:7423} if you have more of it. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7420}在25時為橙色（70變黃，90變綠，110變灰）：約製作51次可升至75。每次需要1個{item:10940}。每次一個{item:10940}：多數物品等級5-20的綠色裝備都能分解出這種粉塵，尤其是護甲。如果{item:10938}（主要來自武器）更多，也可用護腕 - 初級偏斜或胸甲 - {spell:7423}完成這一階段。揹包裡對應部位的任意物品都能附魔，即使是灰色物品。",
		["{spell:7420} is yellow at 75 (yellow 70, green 90, grey 110): about 22 crafts to 90. Each takes 1 {item:10940}. One {item:10940} a craft: the dust most level 5-20 greens break into, armour above all. {item:10938} (from weapons) does the same job through Bracer - Minor Deflect or Chest - {spell:7423} if you have more of it. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. If you got here without learning {spell:7420}, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it."] = "{spell:7420}在75時為黃色（黃色70，綠色90，灰色110）：大約製作22次到90。每次需要1個{item:10940}。每次一個{item:10940}：大部分5-20級綠色物品分解出的粉塵，尤其是護甲。{item:10938}（來自武器）透過護腕 - 初級偏斜或胸甲 - {spell:7423}也能起同樣作用，如果你這種更多的話。給背包裡該部位的任何物品附魔，灰色的也行。如果你到這裡還沒學會{spell:7420}，現在就學：之前的步驟會教。",
		["{spell:7420} to 75"] = "{spell:7420} 到75",
		["{spell:7420} to 90"] = "{spell:7420} 到90",
		["{spell:7771} is orange at 90 (yellow 110, green 130, grey 150): about 48 crafts to 130. Each takes 2 {item:10940}. Two {item:10940} a craft (the trainer teaches it from 70 for 2s); keep disenchanting the greens of the 10-20 zones. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7771}在90時為橙色（110黃、130綠、150灰）：大約48次製作可到130。每次需要2個{item:10940}。每次兩份{item:10940}（訓練師從70起教，收費2銀）；繼續分解10-20級區域的綠裝。給包中該部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
		["{spell:7771} to 130"] = "{spell:7771} 到130",
} end)()
