		["{spell:3918} is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 30, grey 40): about 46 crafts to 35. Each takes 1 {item:2835}. One {item:2835} a craft; {item:2835} comes with the {item:2770} from Copper Veins."] = "{spell:3918}在1時為橙色（20黃、30綠、40灰）：大約46次製作可到35。每次需要1個{item:2835}。每次一個{item:2835}；{item:2835}與銅礦脈出的{item:2770}一同獲得。",
		["{spell:3918} to 35"] = "{spell:3918}練到 35",
		["{spell:3922} is orange at 35 (yellow 45, green 52, grey 60): about 33 crafts to 57. Each takes 1 {item:2840}. One {item:2840} a craft. Keep the bolts: Practice Locks and later gadgets take them. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:5956} is a tool: keep it in your bags."] = "{spell:3922}在技能35時為橙色（45變黃，52變綠，60變灰）：約製作33次可到57。每次需要1個{item:2840}。也就是每次1個{item:2840}。保留螺栓：練習鎖及之後的裝置會用到。附近需要有鐵砧。{item:5956}是工具：保留在揹包中。",
		["{spell:3922} to 57"] = "{spell:3922}練到 57",
		["{spell:3924} is orange at 57 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 18 crafts to 75, a point every craft. Each takes 2 {item:2840} and 1 {item:2880}. Two Copper Bars and a {item:2880} a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby. Make the {item:6219} now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there."] = "{spell:3924}在57時為橙色（80黃、95綠、110灰）：大約18次製作可到75，每次一點。每次需要2個{item:2840}和1個{item:2880}。每次兩個銅錠和一個{item:2880}（鍛造和工程學供應商）。附近需要鐵砧。趁{item:6219}還能漲點時先做出來：後面的配方要求它在你包裡，所以一直留著。",
		["{spell:3924} is yellow at 94 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 14 crafts to 100. Each takes 2 {item:2840} and 1 {item:2880}. Two Copper Bars and a {item:2880} a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby. If you got here without learning {spell:3924}, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it."] = "{spell:3924}在94時為黃色（黃色80，綠色95，灰色110）：大約製作14次到100。每次需要2個{item:2840}和1個{item:2880}。每次兩個銅錠和一個{item:2880}（鍛造和工程學供應商）。需要附近有鐵砧。如果你到這裡還沒學會{spell:3924}，現在就學：之前的步驟會教。",
		["{spell:3924} to 100"] = "{spell:3924} 到100",
		["{spell:3924} to 75"] = "{spell:3924}練到 75",
		["{spell:3930} is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 90, grey 95): about 15 crafts to 94. Each takes 1 {spell:3929} and 1 {item:2840} and makes 200. Make the 15 {spell:3929} first: it gives points too while not grey. The {spell:3929} in each gives its own point while it is not grey: two chances a craft. Sell the shot to hunters or a vendor."] = "{spell:3930} 在技能75時為橙色（85變黃，90變綠，95變灰）：大約製作15次升到94。每次需要1份 {spell:3929} 和1塊 {item:2840}，產出200發。先製作15份 {spell:3929}：只要尚未變灰，製作它也能漲點。每次所用的 {spell:3929} 在未變灰時也有自己的漲點機會：相當於每次有兩次漲點機會。彈藥可賣給獵人或商人。",
		["{spell:3930} to 94"] = "{spell:3930} 到94",
		["{spell:3945} is yellow at 125 (yellow 125, green 135, grey 145): about 27 crafts to 140. Each takes 1 {item:2838}. One {item:2838} a craft (Iron Deposits). Keep some: Iron Grenades take one each."] = "{spell:3945}在125時為黃色（125黃、135綠、145灰）：大約27次製作可到140。每次需要1個{item:2838}。每次一個{item:2838}（鐵礦脈）。留一些：每個鐵手雷都要一個。",
		["{spell:3945} to 140"] = "{spell:3945}練到 140",
		["{spell:3950} is yellow at 140 (yellow 140, green 165, grey 190): about 10 crafts to 150. Each takes 2 {item:4377}, 3 {item:2841} and 1 {spell:3973} and makes 3. Make the 10 {spell:3973} (2 crafts) first. Use the 20 {item:4377} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data. Needs an anvil nearby. {skill:202} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:3950}在技能140時為黃色（140變黃，165變綠，190變灰）：約製作10次可到150。每次需要2個{item:4377}、3個{item:2841}和1個{spell:3973}，產出3個。先製作10個{spell:3973}（製作2次）。用之前做好的20個{item:4377}；上方統計未將其計入。此配方向訓練師學習，是資料中度過這段技能點最便宜的方式。附近需要有鐵砧。{skill:202}150是傳承系統的一個里程碑。",
		["{spell:3950} to 150"] = "{spell:3950} 到150",
		["{spell:3953} is yellow at 166 (yellow 145, green 170, grey 195): about 19 crafts to 175. Each takes 2 {item:2841}, 1 {item:2319} and 1 {item:2592}. Bronze Frameworks are parts for later gadgets; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3953}在166時為黃色（145黃、170綠、195灰）：大約19次製作可到175。每次需要2個{item:2841}、1個{item:2319}和1個{item:2592}。青銅框架是後續裝置的零件；多出來的賣給商人。",
		["{spell:3953} to 175"] = "{spell:3953}練到 175",
		["{spell:3967} is yellow at 191 (yellow 190, green 210, grey 230): about 27 crafts to 210. Each takes 3 {item:3575}, 3 {spell:3945} and 1 {spell:3973} and makes 2. Make the 74 {spell:3945} and 30 {spell:3973} (6 crafts) first. Use the 7 {spell:3945} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. A {item:2842} makes five Silver Contacts (grey by now: no points, but no trip to a vendor either); the {spell:3945} comes from {item:2838}. Each craft makes two bombs. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 30, {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}), {npc:5518} ({zone:1453}), {npc:4586} ({zone:1458}) or Tinkerwiz ({area:392}) sends you to {spell:20220} ({npc:7944}, {zone:1455}, or {npc:7406}, {area:35}: 6 Mithril Tubes, an {item:4407} and 2 Advanced Target Dummies) or Goblin Engineering ({npc:8126}, {area:976}: 20 Big Iron Bombs, 20 {item:10507} and 5 {npc:2675}). The {item:4407} schematic now binds when picked up, but the quest takes a scope someone else made. The membership card lasts 14 days of play; renewing it costs 2g. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby. If you got here without learning {spell:3945} and {spell:3973}, learn them now: an earlier step teaches them."] = "{spell:3967}在191時為黃色（黃色190，綠色210，灰色230）：大約製作27次到210。每次需要3個{item:3575}、3個{spell:3945}和1個{spell:3973}，產出2個。先做74個{spell:3945}和30個{spell:3973}（6次製作）。用上你之前做的7個{spell:3945}；上面的數量不包括它們。一個{item:2842}可以做五個銀觸媒（此時已是灰色：不加點，但也不用跑商人）；{spell:3945}來自{item:2838}。每次製作產出兩個炸彈。專精（可選）：在200技能和30級角色時，{npc:5174}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:5518}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:4586}（{zone:1458}）或丁克維茲（{area:392}）會把你送到{spell:20220}（{npc:7944}、{zone:1455}，或{npc:7406}、{area:35}：6個秘銀管、一個{item:4407}和2個高級假人）或哥布林工程學（{npc:8126}、{area:976}：20個重磅鐵製炸彈、20個{item:10507}和5個{npc:2675}）。{item:4407}的設計圖現在拾取後綁定，但任務接受別人做的瞄準鏡。會員卡可用14天遊戲時間；續期花費2金。只能選一個；到300都不需要，測試版也從未測試過它們（它停在30級）。需要附近有鐵砧。如果你到這裡還沒學會{spell:3945}和{spell:3973}，現在就學：之前的步驟會教。",
		["{spell:3967} to 210"] = "{spell:3967} 到210",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/first-aid"] = (function() return {
		["Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:129} (any character level, 1s); the arrow picks the nearest. Forever teaches {item:118} with it: {item:2447}, {item:2678} and an {item:3371}, orange to 55. With {skill:182} it can replace the Linen Bandages below."] = "你陣營的任何{skill:129}訓練師都會教初級{skill:129}（不限角色等級，1銀）；箭頭會指向最近的一位。Forever會同時教你{item:118}：{item:2447}、{item:2678}和一個{item:3371}，55之前為橙色。有{skill:182}的話，它可以取代下面的亞麻繃帶。",
		["Artisan {skill:129}"] = "專家級{skill:129}",
		["Artisan {skill:129} comes from the {quest:6622} quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the {skill:129} trainer in {zone:1454} sends you to the doctor in {area:321}. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and {item:14047} (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages."] = "大師級{skill:129}來自{quest:6622}任務。需要技能225和角色35級；{zone:1454}的{skill:129}訓練師會派你去找{area:321}的醫生。現在就帶上魔紋布（約74匹）和{item:14047}（約65匹）用於225-300：繃帶不需要火，所以你可以就在醫生旁邊做225-300，他會教大師級繃帶。",
		["Artisan {skill:129} comes from the {quest:6624} quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the {skill:129} trainer in {zone:1455} sends you to the doctor in Theramore. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and {item:14047} (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages."] = "專家級{skill:129}來自{quest:6624}任務。需要技能225和等級35；{zone:1455}的{skill:129}訓練師會派你去塞拉摩找醫生。現在就帶上225-300所需的魔紋布（約74）和{item:14047}（約65）：繃帶不需要火，所以你可以在教授專家級繃帶的醫生旁邊練到300。",
		["Buy and read {item:16084} (Expert {skill:129})"] = "購買並閱讀{item:16084}（高級{skill:129}）",
		["Expert {skill:129}"] = "高級{skill:129}",
		["Expert {skill:129} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, {item:16084} (1g); the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it. The same vendor sells the Heavy Silk and {item:8544} manuals (22s and 50s): buy both now, you read them at 180 and 210."] = "高級{skill:129}將上限提高到225；需要技能125和角色等級20：它是一本書，{item:16084}（1金）；箭頭會指向你陣營最近的賣家。買下並閱讀。同一個商人也出售厚絲質繃帶和{item:8544}的手冊（22銀和50銀）：現在兩本都買，你會在180和210時閱讀。",
		["Journeyman {skill:129}"] = "中級{skill:129}",
		["Journeyman {skill:129} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level: the arrow picks the nearest {skill:129} trainer of your faction; training costs 5s."] = "中級{skill:129}將上限提高到150；需要技能50，沒有角色等級要求：箭頭會指向你陣營最近的{skill:129}訓練師；訓練費用5銀。",
		["Learn {skill:129}"] = "學習{skill:129}",
		["Trauma"] = "創傷",
		["What {item:1251} takes that the Auction House sells: 41 {item:2589}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{item:1251}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：41個{item:2589}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {item:14529} takes that the Auction House sells: 65 {item:14047}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{item:14529}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：65個{item:14047}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {item:2581} takes that the Auction House sells: 20 {item:2589}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{item:2581}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：20個{item:2589}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {item:2581} takes that the Auction House sells: 92 {item:2589}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{item:2581}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：92個{item:2589}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {item:6450} takes that the Auction House sells: 42 {item:4306}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{item:6450}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：42個{item:4306}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {item:6451} takes that the Auction House sells: 84 {item:4306}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{item:6451}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：84個{item:4306}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {item:8544} takes that the Auction House sells: 18 {item:4338}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{item:8544}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：18個{item:4338}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {item:8544} takes that the Auction House sells: 24 {item:4338}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{item:8544}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：24個{item:4338}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {item:8545} takes that the Auction House sells: 50 {item:4338}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{item:8545}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：50個{item:4338}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {spell:3277} takes that the Auction House sells: 49 {item:2592}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{spell:3277}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：49個{item:2592}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {spell:3278} takes that the Auction House sells: 22 {item:2592}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{spell:3278}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：22個{item:2592}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What {spell:3278} takes that the Auction House sells: 76 {item:2592}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "{spell:3278}所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：76個{item:2592}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["{item:1251} is orange from 1 (yellow at 30, green at 45, grey at 60): about 41 crafts to 40. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. At 20 the trainer also teaches {item:279968} (1s; the Camping 101: {skill:129} quest at your starting area's camp teaches it free), Forever's camping item for {skill:129}: three Linen Bandages and a {item:159}; it gives a few points until 25."] = "{item:1251}從1開始為橙色（30變黃，45變綠，60變灰）：約製作41次到40。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能製作。20時訓練師還會教授{item:279968}（1銀；起始區域營地的“野營入門101：{skill:129}”任務可免費學會），這是無限的{skill:129}野營物品：三條亞麻繃帶和一瓶{item:159}；25前能提供少量點數。",
		["{item:1251}: Auction House"] = "{item:1251}：拍賣場",
		["{item:1251}: cloth"] = "{item:1251}：布料",
		["{item:14047} drops from humanoids of level 45-60: keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "{item:14047}由45-60級的人型生物掉落：練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["{item:14529} is yellow from 260 (yellow at 260, green at 290, grey at 320): about 65 crafts to 300. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. If you got here without learning it, learn it now: only the {quest:6622} doctor teaches it ({npc:12939} in Theramore, {npc:12920} in {area:321}). {item:14529} turns green at 290, yet to 300 it takes about the same {item:14047} as switching to {item:14530} (the doctor teaches it at 290): one recipe is enough."] = "{item:14529}從260起為黃色（260黃色，290綠色，320灰色）：大約製作65次到300。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能做。如果你到這裡還沒學會，現在就學：只有{quest:6622}的醫生會教（塞拉摩的{npc:12939}，{area:321}的{npc:12920}）。{item:14529}在290變綠，但到300所需的{item:14047}和換做{item:14530}差不多（醫生在290教）：一個配方就夠了。",
		["{item:14529}: Auction House"] = "{item:14529}：拍賣場",
		["{item:14529}: cloth"] = "{item:14529}：布料",
		["{item:2581} is orange from 40 (yellow at 50, green at 75, grey at 100): about 10 crafts to 50. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 40 for 1s; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "{item:2581}從40開始為橙色（50變黃，75變綠，100變灰）：約製作10次到50。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能製作。你所在陣營的任何{skill:129}訓練師在技能40時教授，花費1銀；箭頭會指向最近的一位。",
		["{item:2581} is yellow from 50 (yellow at 50, green at 75, grey at 100): about 46 crafts to 80. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. If you got here without learning it, learn it now: any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it for 1s; the arrow picks the nearest. Herbalists: {item:858} (from 55, 1s 50c; {item:2450}, two {item:2678} and an {item:3371}) is orange to 85."] = "{item:2581}從50起為黃色（50黃色，75綠色，100灰色）：大約製作46次到80。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能做。如果你到這裡還沒學會，現在就學：你陣營的任何{skill:129}訓練師都會教，1銀；箭頭會選最近的一個。草藥師：{item:858}（從55起，1銀50銅；{item:2450}、兩個{item:2678}和一個{item:3371}）到85前都是橙色。",
		["{item:2581}: Auction House"] = "{item:2581}：拍賣場",
		["{item:2581}: cloth"] = "{item:2581}：布料",
		["{item:2589} drops from humanoids of level 5-20: keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "{item:2589}由5-20級的人型生物掉落：練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["{item:2592} drops from humanoids of level 15-30: keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "{item:2592}由15-30級的人型生物掉落：練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["{item:4306} drops from humanoids of level 25-45: keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "{item:4306}由25-45級的人型生物掉落：練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["{item:4338} drops from humanoids of level 35-50: keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "{item:4338}由35-50級的人型生物掉落：練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["{item:6450} is yellow from 150 (yellow at 150, green at 180, grey at 210): about 42 crafts to 180. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 150 for 50s; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "{item:6450}從150起為黃色（150變黃，180變綠，210變灰）：製作約42次到180。繃帶不需要火堆：隨處都能製作。你陣營的任何{skill:129}訓練師都能在技能150起以50銀教你；箭頭會指向最近的一位。",
		["{item:6450}: Auction House"] = "{item:6450}：拍賣場",
		["{item:6450}: cloth"] = "{item:6450}：布料",
		["{item:6451} is yellow from 180 (yellow at 180, green at 210, grey at 240): about 42 crafts to 210. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Read the {item:16112} you bought with Expert {skill:129} to learn it; without one, the vendor who sold you the book sells it too."] = "{item:6451}從180起為黃色（180黃色，210綠色，240灰色）：大約製作42次到210。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能做。閱讀你隨專家級{skill:129}一起買的{item:16112}來學會它；如果沒有，賣書給你的商人也賣它。",
		["{item:6451}: Auction House"] = "{item:6451}：拍賣場",
		["{item:6451}: cloth"] = "{item:6451}：布料",
		["{item:8544} is yellow from 210 (yellow at 210, green at 240, grey at 270): about 18 crafts to 225. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Read the {item:16113} you bought with Expert {skill:129} to learn it; without one, the vendor who sold you the book sells it too."] = "{item:8544}從210起為黃色（210黃色，240綠色，270灰色）：大約製作18次到225。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能做。閱讀你隨專家級{skill:129}一起買的{item:16113}來學會它；如果沒有，賣書給你的商人也賣它。",
		["{item:8544} is yellow from 225 (yellow at 210, green at 240, grey at 270): about 24 crafts to 240. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. If you got here without learning it, learn it now: read the {item:16113} (the vendor who sold you the Expert {skill:129} book sells it). {item:8544} turns green at 240: switch to Heavy Mageweave there, which costs less cloth than green Mageweave Bandages to 260."] = "{item:8544}從225起為黃色（210黃色，240綠色，270灰色）：大約製作24次到240。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能做。如果你到這裡還沒學會，現在就學：閱讀{item:16113}（賣給你專家級{skill:129}書的商人也賣它）。{item:8544}在240變綠：在那裡換做厚魔紋繃帶，到260所需的布比綠色的魔紋繃帶更少。",
		["{item:8544}: Auction House"] = "{item:8544}：拍賣場",
		["{item:8544}: cloth"] = "{item:8544}：布料",
		["{item:8545} is yellow from 240 (yellow at 240, green at 270, grey at 300): about 25 crafts to 260. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. If you got here without learning it, learn it now: only the {quest:6622} doctor teaches it ({npc:12939} in Theramore, {npc:12920} in {area:321})."] = "{item:8545}從240起為黃色（240黃色，270綠色，300灰色）：大約製作25次到260。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能做。如果你到這裡還沒學會，現在就學：只有{quest:6622}的醫生會教（塞拉摩的{npc:12939}，{area:321}的{npc:12920}）。",
		["{item:8545}: Auction House"] = "{item:8545}：拍賣場",
		["{item:8545}: cloth"] = "{item:8545}：布料",
		["{quest:6622}: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie on the floor inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again."] = "{quest:6622}：醫生會給你急救繃帶；用這些，不要用你自己的。裡面地上躺著十五名傷兵：在他們死亡前，先包紮危重傷員，再包紮重傷員，最後是傷員（按Ctrl+V顯示生命條）。救滿十五人後立即交還任務：其他人會繼續死亡，死亡過多即使顯示已完成也會失敗。如果失敗，放棄任務並重新接受。",
		["{quest:6624}: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again."] = "{quest:6624}：醫生會給你急救繃帶；用這些，不要用你自己的。裡面躺著十五名傷兵：在他們死亡前，先包紮危重傷員，再包紮重傷員，最後是傷員（按Ctrl+V顯示生命條）。救滿十五人後立即交還任務：其他人會繼續死亡，死亡過多即使顯示已完成也會失敗。如果失敗，放棄任務並重新接受。",
		["{spell:10841} (skill 240) is an Artisan recipe: only the {quest:6622} doctor teaches it ({npc:12939} in Theramore, {npc:12920} in {area:321})."] = "{spell:10841}（技能240）是大師級配方：只有{quest:6622}的醫生會教（塞拉摩的{npc:12939}、{area:321}的{npc:12920}）。",
		["{spell:18629} (skill 260) is an Artisan recipe: only the {quest:6622} doctor teaches it ({npc:12939} in Theramore, {npc:12920} in {area:321})."] = "{spell:18629}（技能260）是專家級配方：只有{quest:6622}的醫生會教（塞拉摩的{npc:12939}，{area:321}的{npc:12920}）。",
		["{spell:3277} is yellow from 80 (yellow at 80, green at 115, grey at 150): about 49 crafts to 115. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 80 for 2s 50c; the arrow picks the nearest. {item:6452} ({item:1475}, from spiders) is taught at 80 too: Rogues need it for {spell:9810}, and it sells."] = "{spell:3277}從80起為黃色（80黃、115綠、150灰）：到115約需49次製作。繃帶不需要火：隨處可做。本方陣營的任何{skill:129}訓練師從技能80起教它，收費2銀50銅；箭頭會選最近的一位。{item:6452}（{item:1475}，從蜘蛛身上取得）也在80點時教：盜賊需要它來配合{spell:9810}，而且它賣得出去。",
		["{spell:3277}: Auction House"] = "{spell:3277}：拍賣場",
		["{spell:3277}: cloth"] = "{spell:3277}：布料",
		["{spell:3278} is yellow from 115 (yellow at 115, green at 150, grey at 185): about 11 crafts to 125. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 115 for 10s; the arrow picks the nearest. Herbalists: {item:929} (from 110, 8s; {item:2453}, {item:2692} and a {item:3372}) is orange to 135."] = "{spell:3278}從115開始為黃色（115變黃，150變綠，185變灰）：約製作11次到125。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能製作。你所在陣營的任何{skill:129}訓練師在技能115時教授，花費10銀；箭頭會指向最近的一位。草藥師：{item:929}（110起，8銀；{item:2453}、{item:2692}和一個{item:3372}）在135前為橙色。",
		["{spell:3278} is yellow from 125 (yellow at 115, green at 150, grey at 185): about 38 crafts to 150. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. If you got here without learning it, learn it now: any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it for 10s; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "{spell:3278}從125起為黃色（115黃色，150綠色，185灰色）：大約製作38次到150。繃帶不需要火：隨處都能做。如果你到這裡還沒學會，現在就學：你陣營的任何{skill:129}訓練師都會教，10銀；箭頭會選最近的一個。",
		["{spell:3278}: Auction House"] = "{spell:3278}：拍賣場",
		["{spell:3278}: cloth"] = "{spell:3278}：布料",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/professions/fishing"] = (function() return {
		["Any {skill:356} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:356} at any character level (1s); the arrow picks the nearest, and every starting area has one on its lake or shore. Buy a {item:6256} (23c) from a trade goods or fishing vendor and equip it (you can only fish with a pole in your hands), and two or three Shiny Baubles (+25, 50c each): a lure adds its bonus to your skill for ten minutes, so fewer fish get away at the start. If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:356}, handed in to the fishing trainer it names at skill 20 for the {spell:1229745} recipe."] = "你陣營的任何{skill:356}訓練師都會教初級{skill:356}，不限角色等級（1銀）；箭頭會指向最近的一位，每個起始地區的湖邊或海岸都有一位。向雜貨商或釣魚供應商購買一根{item:6256}（23銅）並裝備（手上拿著魚竿才能釣魚），再買兩三個閃光的小珠（+25，每個50銅）：魚餌能在十分鐘內為技能提供加成，讓剛開始釣魚時少跑掉幾條魚。如果你為了「戶外真好」在起始地區的營火旁坐過，那裡的紮營嚮導也會提供「紮營入門指南：{skill:356}」，技能達到20時繳交給任務指定的釣魚訓練師，可獲得{spell:1229745}配方。",
		["Artisan {skill:356}"] = "專家級{skill:356}",
		["Artisan {skill:356} (cap 300) comes from {npc:12919} in {zone:1445}. The fishing trainer in {zone:1454} sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "專家級{skill:356}（上限300）來自{zone:1445}的{npc:12919}。{zone:1454}的釣魚訓練師會派你去找他；任務需要技能225和等級35。",
		["Artisan {skill:356} (cap 300) comes from {npc:12919} in {zone:1445}. The fishing trainer in {zone:1455} sends you to him; the quest needs skill 225 and level 35."] = "專家級{skill:356}（上限300）來自{zone:1445}的{npc:12919}。{zone:1455}的釣魚訓練師會派你去找他；任務需要技能225和等級35。",
		["Buy and read {item:16083} (Expert {skill:356})"] = "購買並閱讀{item:16083}（高級{skill:356}）",
		["Expert {skill:356}"] = "高級{skill:356}",
		["Expert {skill:356} (cap 225) is a book, not a trainer rank: {npc:2626} sells {item:16083} (1g) on the lowest dock of {area:35}, at the south tip of {zone:1434}, to both factions. Buy it and read it; it needs skill 125 and level 20. At level 20 the safe way in is the boat from {area:392} in {zone:1413}, not the road through Stranglethorn. He also sells {item:6532} (+75 from skill 100, 2s 50c each), the lure for the rest of the way."] = "高級{skill:356}（上限225）是一本書，不是訓練師的等級：{npc:2626}在{zone:1434}南端{area:35}最低層的碼頭上向雙方陣營販售{item:16083}（1金）。購買並閱讀它；需要技能125和等級20。20級時，安全的走法是從{zone:1413}的{area:392}搭船過去，而不是走穿過荊棘谷的道路。他也販售{item:6532}（技能100起+75，每個2銀50銅），這是之後一路要用的魚餌。",
		["Fish along the coast of {zone:1443} ({area:598} in the north-west, or the shore west of {area:2408}) until you catch a {item:16968}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here."] = "在{zone:1443}海岸（西北的{area:598}，或{area:2408}以西的岸邊）釣魚，直到釣上{item:16968}：那裡約每五竿出一竿，別處不會咬鉤。技能225時這裡不會跑魚。",
		["Fish along the {area:2521} in {zone:1444} (south-east of {area:2577}) until you catch a {item:16967}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. This water loses fish below skill 300: at 225 most get away, so put {item:6532} (+75) on the pole first."] = "在{zone:1444}的{area:2521}（{area:2577}東南）釣魚，直到釣上{item:16967}：那裡約每五竿出一竿，別處不會咬鉤。這片水域在技能300以下會跑魚：225時大部分會跑掉，所以先給魚竿裝上{item:6532}（+75）。",
		["Fish along the {area:300} (the east shore of {zone:1435}) until you catch a {item:16970}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here."] = "在{area:300}（{zone:1435}東岸）釣魚，直到釣上{item:16970}：那裡約每五竿出一竿，別處不會咬鉤。技能225時這裡不會跑魚。",
		["Fish along {zone:1434}'s {area:301} (the west shore) until you catch a {item:16969}: about one catch in five there brings it up, and it bites nowhere else. At skill 225 nothing gets away here."] = "在{zone:1434}的{area:301}（西岸）釣魚，直到釣上{item:16969}：那裡約每五竿出一竿，別處不會咬鉤。技能225時這裡不會跑魚。",
		["Fish the pools along the coast here (eels, snappers, wreckage) until skill 300, about 650 catches (one in seven raises the skill at 225, one in ten by 300). Harder water levels no faster: a catch counts the same anywhere. From skill 225 this water loses no fish, so no lure is needed. The {item:6533} (+100 from skill 100, 2s 50c) and {item:6532} are for harder water and rare fish, not for skill."] = "在此沿岸的魚群（鰻魚、鯛魚、殘骸）中釣魚，直到技能300，約650竿（225時約七竿漲一點，300時約十竿一點）。更高階的水域並不會更快：任何地方一竿的收益都一樣。技能225起這片水域不會跑魚，所以不需要魚餌。{item:6533}（技能100起可用，+100，2銀50銅）和{item:6532}是用於更高階水域和稀有魚的，不是用來練技能的。",
		["Fish the pools and open water here until skill 125, about 120 catches: from 75 a catch raises the skill less often (about one in two by 100, one in three by 125). Pools (floating wreckage, schools of fish) also give extra loot. {item:6530} (+50 from skill 50, 1s each) are twice as strong as a {item:6529}. The {item:6365} (+5 from skill 10, 9s 1c) is in limited stock at fishing vendors: buy it when you see it. Fish get away here below skill 75; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap. To cook what you catch: {item:6328} for the {item:6289} of lakes and rivers ({skill:185} 50, 4s: Nyoma ({zone:1438})); {item:6368} for the {item:6361} of the coast ({skill:185} 50, 4s: {npc:4307} ({zone:1439}) or {npc:10118} ({zone:1438})). {item:12238} bites only here: eat it as it is. {npc:10216} ({zone:1439}) takes 6 for The Family and the {item:6256}, which gives the {item:12221}. {item:6358} from the schools here is no food: alchemists make {item:6370} from it ({skill:171} 80); keep it to sell or trade."] = "在這裡的釣魚點和開闊水域釣魚直到技能125，約需釣120次：從75起，釣到魚提升技能的機率變低（100時約二分之一，125時約三分之一）。釣魚點（漂浮的殘骸、魚群）也會給額外的戰利品。{item:6530}（技能50起+50，每個1銀）的效果是{item:6529}的兩倍。{item:6365}（技能10起+5，9銀1銅）在釣魚供應商處限量供應：看到就買。技能低於75時，這裡的魚會脫鉤跑掉；在魚竿上裝魚餌可在十分鐘內提高技能，補上差距。烹飪你釣到的魚：湖泊和河流的{item:6289}用{item:6328}（{skill:185} 50，4銀：{zone:1438}的妮歐瑪）；海岸的{item:6361}用{item:6368}（{skill:185} 50，4銀：{zone:1439}的{npc:4307}或{zone:1438}的{npc:10118}）。{item:12238}只在這裡上鉤：直接食用即可。{zone:1439}的{npc:10216}會為了「家族與{item:6256}」收下6條，獎勵是{item:12221}。這裡魚群釣到的{item:6358}不能吃：鍊金術師可以用它製作{item:6370}（{skill:171} 80）；留著賣掉或交易。",
		["Fish the pools and open water here until skill 125, about 120 catches: from 75 a catch raises the skill less often (about one in two by 100, one in three by 125). Pools (floating wreckage, schools of fish) also give extra loot. {item:6530} (+50 from skill 50, 1s each) are twice as strong as a {item:6529}. The {item:6365} (+5 from skill 10, 9s 1c) is in limited stock at fishing vendors: buy it when you see it. Fish get away here below skill 75; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap. To cook what you catch: {item:6328} for the {item:6289} of lakes and rivers ({skill:185} 50, 4s: {npc:1684} ({zone:1432}) or {npc:5162} ({zone:1455})); {item:6368} for the {item:6361} of the coast ({skill:185} 50, 4s: {npc:3178} ({zone:1437}) or {npc:260487} ({zone:2548}))."] = "在這裡的魚群和普通水域釣到技能 125，約需釣起 120 次：75 起，每次釣起漲技能的機率會下降（100 時約二分之一，125 時約三分之一）。魚群或漂浮殘骸等水面釣魚點還會產出額外戰利品。{item:6530}（技能 50 起可用，+50，每個 1 銀幣）的加成是 {item:6529} 的兩倍。{item:6365}（技能 10 起可用，+5，9 銀 1 銅）在釣魚商人處限量出售：看到就買。技能低於 75 時，這裡的魚會逃脫；給魚竿裝上魚餌可以提高技能，持續十分鐘，彌補差距。烹飪釣到的魚：湖泊和河流的{item:6289}用{item:6328}（{skill:185} 50，4 銀幣：{npc:1684}（{zone:1432}）或 {npc:5162}（{zone:1455}））；海岸的{item:6361}用{item:6368}（{skill:185} 50，4 銀幣：{npc:3178}（{zone:1437}）或 {npc:260487}（{zone:2548}））。",
		["Fish the pools and open water here until skill 125, about 120 catches: from 75 a catch raises the skill less often (about one in two by 100, one in three by 125). Pools (floating wreckage, schools of fish) also give extra loot. {item:6530} (+50 from skill 50, 1s each) are twice as strong as a {item:6529}. The {item:6365} (+5 from skill 10, 9s 1c) is in limited stock at fishing vendors: buy it when you see it. Fish get away here below skill 75; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap. To cook what you catch: {item:6328} for the {item:6289} of lakes and rivers ({skill:185} 50, 4s: {npc:5748} ({zone:1421}) or {npc:4574} ({zone:1458})); {item:6368} for the {item:6361} of the coast ({skill:185} 50, 4s: {npc:4553} ({zone:1458}) or {npc:5748} ({zone:1421})). {item:6358} from the schools here is no food: alchemists make {item:6370} from it ({skill:171} 80); keep it to sell or trade."] = "在這裡的釣魚點和開闊水域釣魚直到技能125，約需釣120次：從75起，釣到魚提升技能的機率變低（100時約二分之一，125時約三分之一）。釣魚點（漂浮的殘骸、魚群）也會給額外的戰利品。{item:6530}（技能50起+50，每個1銀）的效果是{item:6529}的兩倍。{item:6365}（技能10起+5，9銀1銅）在釣魚供應商處限量供應：看到就買。技能低於75時，這裡的魚會脫鉤跑掉；在魚竿上裝魚餌可在十分鐘內提高技能，補上差距。烹飪你釣到的魚：湖泊和河流的{item:6289}用{item:6328}（{skill:185} 50，4銀：{zone:1421}的{npc:5748}或{zone:1458}的{npc:4574}）；海岸的{item:6361}用{item:6368}（{skill:185} 50，4銀：{zone:1458}的{npc:4553}或{zone:1421}的{npc:5748}）。這裡魚群釣到的{item:6358}不能吃：鍊金術師可以用它製作{item:6370}（{skill:171} 80）；留著賣掉或交易。",
