		["144 {item:2589} for {spell:2387} and {item:7026}: humanoids of level 5-20 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{spell:2387}和{item:7026}準備144個{item:2589}：5-20級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["204 {item:4306} for {spell:3871}: humanoids of level 25-45 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{spell:3871}準備204個{item:4306}：25-45級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["264 {item:4306} for {item:7053}: humanoids of level 25-45 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{item:7053}準備264個{item:4306}：25-45級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["3195 {item:14047} for {item:13856}, {item:13863} and {item:13867}: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{item:13856}、{item:13863}和{item:13867}準備3195個{item:14047}：45-60級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["420 {item:8170} for {item:13863} and {item:13867}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 48-60. Skin {npc:6369}, {npc:8760}, {npc:6380}, {npc:6379}, {npc:6378} and {npc:6377} here (level 48-60); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "為 {item:13863} 和 {item:13867} 準備420張 {item:8170}：{skill:393}：剝取48-60級野獸。在這裡剝取 {npc:6369}、{npc:8760}、{npc:6380}、{npc:6379}、{npc:6378} 和 {npc:6377}（48-60級）；{skill:393} 指南會安排相應路線。",
		["420 {item:8170} for {item:13863} and {item:13867}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 48-60. Skin {npc:8598}, Plaguehound and {npc:8596} here (level 48-60); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "為{item:13863}和{item:13867}準備420張{item:8170}：{skill:393}：剝取48-60級野獸。在這裡剝取{npc:8598}、瘟疫犬和{npc:8596}（48-60級）的皮；{skill:393}指南有對應路線。",
		["567 {item:2592} for {spell:2402} and {spell:3866}: humanoids of level 15-30 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "為{spell:2402}和{spell:3866}準備567個{item:2592}：15-30級的人型生物會掉落。練等時把撿到的留著，或從銀行取出。",
		["Apprentice {skill:197} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:197} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Keep every {item:2589} you loot: humanoids of level 5-20 drop it. 1-75 takes about 50c of recipes and 7s 20c of vendor goods, plus 144 {item:2589} to gather or buy."] = "初級{skill:197}讓你在任何角色等級下花10銅把技能練到75。本陣營任意{skill:197}訓練師都教；箭頭會指向最近的一位。拾到的{item:2589}都留著：5-20級的人形生物掉落。1-75大約花50銅的配方錢和7銀20銅的商人貨物，外加144個{item:2589}，需自行採集或購買。",
		["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300; it needs {skill:197} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11052} ({zone:1445}); Horde {npc:2399} ({zone:1424}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:18401} (from 205) and {spell:18402} (from 210). 225-300 takes about 1g 60s of recipes and 58g of vendor goods, plus 420 {item:8170}, 3195 {item:14047} and 124 {item:14227} to gather or buy."] = "大師級把上限從225提高到300；它需要{skill:197} 200和角色35級，所以從200起任何一次造訪都能學。只有少數訓練師教：聯盟{npc:11052}（{zone:1445}）；部落{npc:2399}（{zone:1424}）。箭頭會指向本陣營最近的一位。現在學：{spell:18401}（205起）和{spell:18402}（210起）。225-300大約花1金60銀的配方錢和58金的商人貨物，外加420個{item:8170}、3195個{item:14047}和124個{item:14227}，需自行採集或購買。",
		["Artisan {skill:197}"] = "專家級{skill:197}",
		["Back to a {skill:197} trainer: {spell:3839} (from 100, 5s) and {spell:3871} (from 135)."] = "回到{skill:197}訓練師處：{spell:3839}（100起，5銀）和{spell:3871}（135起）。",
		["Back to a {skill:197} trainer: {spell:3866} (from 85, 2s 50c)."] = "回到{skill:197}訓練師處：{spell:3866}（85起，2銀50銅）。",
		["Back to a {skill:197} trainer: {spell:8776} (from 15, 50c)."] = "回到{skill:197}訓練師處：{spell:8776}（15起，50銅）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 108 {item:2321} (1g 8s), 34 {item:2324} (8s 50c) and 98 {item:2604} (49s); about 1g 65s 50c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, Felika and {npc:5817})."] = "一次買齊這個階段的用量：108個{item:2321}（1金8銀）、34個{item:2324}（8銀50銅）和98個{item:2604}（49銀）；總計約1金65銀50銅。箭頭會指向你陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、菲利卡和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 116 {item:14341} (58g); about 58g in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, Felika and {npc:5817})."] = "一次買齊這個階段的用量：116個{item:14341}（58金）；總計約58金。箭頭會指向你陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、菲利卡和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 72 {item:2320} (7s 20c); about 7s 20c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, Felika and {npc:5817})."] = "一次買齊這個階段的用量：72個{item:2320}（7銀20銅）；總計約7銀20銅。箭頭會指向你陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、菲利卡和{npc:5817}）。",
		["Expert {skill:197}"] = "高級{skill:197}",
		["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs {skill:197} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:197} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:2627} ({zone:1434}), {npc:5153} ({zone:1455}), {npc:4159} ({zone:1457}), {npc:252380} (Zephras Isle), {npc:5567} ({zone:1453}) and {npc:251991} (Zephras Isle); Horde {npc:2627} ({zone:1434}), {npc:3363} ({zone:1454}), {npc:3704} ({zone:1413}), {npc:252380} (Zephras Isle), {npc:11049} ({zone:1458}), {npc:251991} (Zephras Isle) and {npc:3004} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:2964} (from 55, 1s) and {spell:2402} (from 55, 2s 50c). Also learn {spell:1229504} (1s): Forever's {skill:197} camp item, a {spell:2963} and a {item:2320}; each faction has its own. The Camping 101: {skill:197} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a tailoring trainer who teaches it free. 75-150 takes about 11s of recipes and 1g 65s 50c of vendor goods, plus 567 {item:2592} and 204 {item:4306} to gather or buy."] = "中級將上限從75提高到150，費用5銀；需要{skill:197} 50和角色等級10，所以技能達到50後，任何一次經過都可以學。並非每位{skill:197}訓練師都會教：聯盟有{npc:2627}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:5153}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:4159}（{zone:1457}）、{npc:252380}（微風島）、{npc:5567}（{zone:1453}）和{npc:251991}（微風島）；部落有{npc:2627}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:3363}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:3704}（{zone:1413}）、{npc:252380}（微風島）、{npc:11049}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:251991}（微風島）和{npc:3004}（{zone:1456}）。箭頭會選擇你陣營最近的一位。現在學習：{spell:2964}（技能55起，1銀）和{spell:2402}（技能55起，2銀50銅）。也學習{spell:1229504}（1銀）：這是Forever的{skill:197}紮營物品，需要一份{spell:2963}和一個{item:2320}；每個陣營各有自己的版本。起始地區紮營嚮導（完成「戶外真好」後）提供的「紮營入門指南：{skill:197}」任務，會讓你去找免費教授它的裁縫訓練師。75-150約需11銀的配方和1金65銀50銅的商人材料，另需採集或購買567份{item:2592}和204份{item:4306}。",
		["Journeyman {skill:197}"] = "中級{skill:197}",
		["Learn {skill:197}"] = "學習{skill:197}",
		["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:12048} (from 170)."] = "仍在高級訓練師處：{spell:12048}（170起）。",
		["What 1-75 takes that the Auction House sells: 144 {item:2589}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "1-75階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：144個{item:2589}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What 225-300 takes that the Auction House sells: 420 {item:8170}, 3195 {item:14047}, 124 {item:14227} and a {item:14504}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "225-300階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：420個{item:8170}、3195個{item:14047}、124個{item:14227}和一個{item:14504}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["What 75-150 takes that the Auction House sells: 567 {item:2592} and 204 {item:4306}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "75-150階段所需的材料中，拍賣場有賣的：567個{item:2592}和204個{item:4306}。數量會扣除你背包、銀行和郵件中已有的。",
		["from the pattern bought at the Auction House"] = "來自在拍賣行買到的圖樣",
		["from the recipe in your bags"] = "使用背包中的配方",
		["{item:10024} to 225"] = "{item:10024}練到 225",
		["{item:13856} is yellow at 225 (yellow 225, green 240, grey 255): about 11 crafts to 234. Each takes 3 {item:14048} and 1 {item:14341}. Make the 33 {item:14048} first. {item:14341} from tailoring vendors."] = "{item:13856}在225時為黃色（225黃、240綠、255灰）：大約11次製作可到234。每次需要3個{item:14048}和1個{item:14341}。先做好那33個{item:14048}。{item:14341}來自裁縫供應商。",
		["{item:13856} to 234"] = "{item:13856}練到 234",
		["{item:13863} is orange at 234 (yellow 245, green 260, grey 275): about 43 crafts to 265. Each takes 4 {item:14048}, 4 {item:8170} and 1 {item:14341}. Make the 172 {item:14048} first. {npc:11189} in {area:2255} keeps one pattern at a time; the {area:1769} tunnel from {zone:1448} is the road in, so never kill Timbermaw furbolgs on the way."] = "{item:13863}在234時為橙色（245黃、260綠、275灰）：大約43次製作可到265。每次需要4個{item:14048}、4個{item:8170}和1個{item:14341}。先做好那172個{item:14048}。{area:2255}的{npc:11189}每次只保留一張圖樣；從{zone:1448}走{area:1769}隧道是唯一的路，所以路上千萬別殺木喉熊怪。",
		["{item:13863} to 265"] = "{item:13863}練到 265",
		["{item:13867} is orange at 265 (yellow 275, green 290, grey 305): about 62 crafts to 300. Each takes 7 {item:14048}, 2 {item:14227}, 4 {item:8170} and 1 {item:14341}. Make the 434 {item:14048} first. Its pattern ({item:14504}) drops from mobs all over the world and does not bind: buy it at the Auction House. Seven bolts, two {item:14227} and four {item:8170} a craft: the dearest stretch. The spiders of {zone:1422} and {zone:1451} drop the silk (the marked spots), or the Auction House. No pattern on the Auction House? {item:13863} still give a point now and then to 275, and {item:13864} ({npc:7940}, {zone:1450}) to 280, at 4 bolts a craft. {item:14342} (pattern from {npc:11189} or {npc:11188} in {area:2255}; 2 {item:14256} at a Moonwell) stays orange to 270 and yellow to 285, but it can be made once every four days. The {item:279943} patterns (Merchant's Favor sandals and waistcords from {npc:248202} or {npc:256735}; the wheel's blueprint drops from the {npc:246017} in the City of Dalaran) and {item:254123} (Pexmit in {zone:2482}, 10g; we could not confirm that vendor yet) are the other ways on. {skill:197} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:13867}在265時為橙色（275黃、290綠、305灰）：大約62次製作可到300。每次需要7個{item:14048}、2個{item:14227}、4個{item:8170}和1個{item:14341}。先做好那434個{item:14048}。它的圖樣（{item:14504}）由世界各地的怪物掉落，且不繫結：在拍賣行買。每次七個布卷、兩份{item:14227}和四張{item:8170}：最貴的一段。{zone:1422}和{zone:1451}的蜘蛛掉落絲綢（標記處），或在拍賣行購買。拍賣行沒有圖樣？{item:13863}到275前仍時不時漲點，{item:13864}（{npc:7940}，{zone:1450}）可到280，每次4個布卷。{item:14342}（圖樣來自{area:2255}的{npc:11189}或{npc:11188}；在月亮井旁用2個{item:14256}）到270仍是橙色、到285仍是黃色，但每四天才能做一次。{item:279943}系列圖樣（來自{npc:248202}或{npc:256735}的商人的恩惠涼鞋和腰帶；紡車藍圖由達拉然城中的{npc:246017}掉落）和{item:254123}（{zone:2482}的Pexmit，10金；我們尚未能確認該商人）是其他繼續提升的辦法。{skill:197} 300是傳承系統里程碑。",
		["{item:13867} to 300"] = "{item:13867} 到300",
		["{item:14227} (Alliance)"] = "{item:14227}（聯盟）",
		["{item:14227} (Horde)"] = "{item:14227}（部落）",
		["{item:14481} teaches {item:13863} ({skill:197} 230) for 1g 60s. Sold by {npc:11189} ({zone:1452}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:14481}教{item:13863}（{skill:197} 230），售價1金60銀。出售者{npc:11189}（{zone:1452}），限量。賣家每次只備一兩個，售出後過段時間補貨；它拾取即繫結，所以拍賣行永遠沒有。",
		["{item:7026} is orange at 15 (yellow 50, green 67, grey 85): about 65 crafts to 75. Each takes 1 {spell:2963} and 1 {item:2320}. Make the 65 {spell:2963} first: it gives points too while not grey. Each belt takes one bolt; the belts sell to vendors."] = "{item:7026}在15時為橙色（50黃、67綠、85灰）：大約65次製作可到75。每次需要1個{spell:2963}和1個{item:2320}。先做好那65個{spell:2963}：它在未變灰前也能漲點。每條腰帶用一個布卷；腰帶可以賣給商人。",
		["{item:7026} to 75"] = "{item:7026}練到 75",
		["{item:7053} is orange at 150 (yellow 160, green 175, grey 190): about 22 crafts to 170. Each takes 3 {spell:3839}, 2 {item:6260} and 2 {item:2321}. Make the 66 {spell:3839} first. Its recipe is the one bought above; it is the cheapest way through these points in the data. If you got here without learning {spell:3839}, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it."] = "{item:7053}在150時為橙色（黃色160，綠色175，灰色190）：大約製作22次到170。每次需要3個{spell:3839}、2個{item:6260}和2個{item:2321}。先做66個{spell:3839}。它的配方就是上面買的那個；按資料來看這是過這幾點最便宜的方法。如果你到這裡還沒學會{spell:3839}，現在就學：之前的步驟會教。",
		["{item:7053} to 170"] = "{item:7053}練到 170",
		["{item:7089} teaches {item:7053} ({skill:197} 140) for 15s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:6576} ({zone:1444}), limited stock and {npc:251997} ({zone:1416}); Horde: {npc:6574} ({zone:1417}), limited stock and {npc:251997} ({zone:1416})."] = "{item:7089}教{item:7053}（{skill:197} 140），售價15銀。出售者：聯盟{npc:6576}（{zone:1444}），限量，以及{npc:251997}（{zone:1416}）；部落{npc:6574}（{zone:1417}），限量，以及{npc:251997}（{zone:1416}）。",
		["{item:8170} (Alliance)"] = "{item:8170}（聯盟）",
		["{item:8170} (Horde)"] = "{item:8170}（部落）",
		["{skill:197} 1-75: Auction House"] = "{skill:197} 1-75：拍賣場",
		["{skill:197} 1-75: vendor goods"] = "{skill:197} 1-75：商人貨物",
		["{skill:197} 150-225: Auction House"] = "{skill:197} 150-225：拍賣場",
		["{skill:197} 150-225: vendor goods"] = "{skill:197} 150-225：商人貨物",
		["{skill:197} 225-300: Auction House"] = "{skill:197} 225-300：拍賣場",
		["{skill:197} 225-300: vendor goods"] = "{skill:197} 225-300：商人貨物",
		["{skill:197} 75-150: Auction House"] = "{skill:197} 75-150：拍賣場",
		["{skill:197} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:197} 75-150：商人貨物",
		["{skill:197} recipes at 104"] = "{skill:197} 104 配方",
		["{skill:197} recipes at 135"] = "{skill:197} 135 配方",
		["{skill:197} recipes at 15"] = "{skill:197} 15 配方",
		["{skill:197} recipes at 170"] = "{skill:197} 170 配方",
		["{spell:2387} is orange at 1 (yellow 35, green 47, grey 60): about 7 crafts to 15, a point every craft. Each takes 1 {spell:2963} and 1 {item:2320}. Make the 7 {spell:2963} first: it gives points too while not grey. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data."] = "{spell:2387}在1時為橙色（35黃、47綠、60灰）：大約7次製作可到15，每次一點。每次需要1個{spell:2963}和1個{item:2320}。先做好那7個{spell:2963}：它在未變灰前也能漲點。訓練師教這個，而且按資料這是透過這些點數最便宜的辦法。",
		["{spell:2387} to 15"] = "{spell:2387} 到15",
		["{spell:2402} is orange at 75 (yellow 80, green 97, grey 115): about 42 crafts to 104. Each takes 1 {spell:2964} and 1 {item:2321}. Make the 42 {spell:2964} first: it gives points too while not grey. {spell:2964} is taught from 55 on Forever."] = "{spell:2402}在75時為橙色（80黃、97綠、115灰）：大約42次製作可到104。每次需要1個{spell:2964}和1個{item:2321}。先做好那42個{spell:2964}：它在未變灰前也能漲點。Forever中{spell:2964}從55起可學。",
		["{spell:2402} to 104"] = "{spell:2402}練到 104",
		["{spell:3866} is orange at 104 (yellow 110, green 127, grey 145): about 49 crafts to 135. Each takes 3 {spell:2964}, 2 {item:2604} and 1 {item:2321}. Make the 147 {spell:2964} first. Three woolen bolts and two {item:2604} a shirt; {item:2592} drops from humanoids of level 15-30."] = "{spell:3866}在104時為橙色（110黃、127綠、145灰）：大約49次製作可到135。每次需要3個{spell:2964}、2個{item:2604}和1個{item:2321}。先做好那147個{spell:2964}。每件襯衫要三個毛布卷和兩份{item:2604}；{item:2592}由15-30級的人形生物掉落。",
		["{spell:3866} to 135"] = "{spell:3866} 到135",
		["{spell:3871} is orange at 135 (yellow 145, green 150, grey 155): about 17 crafts to 150. Each takes 3 {spell:3839}, 2 {item:2324} and 1 {item:2321}. Make the 51 {spell:3839} first. Silk bolts from here on: {item:4306} drops from humanoids of level 25-45. {item:2324} from tailoring and trade supplies vendors. {skill:197} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:3871}在135時為橙色（145黃、150綠、155灰）：大約17次製作可到150。每次需要3個{spell:3839}、2個{item:2324}和1個{item:2321}。先做好那51個{spell:3839}。從這裡起用絲綢布卷：{item:4306}由25-45級的人形生物掉落。{item:2324}來自裁縫和雜貨供應商。{skill:197} 150是傳承系統里程碑。",
		["{spell:3871} to 150"] = "{spell:3871} 到150",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/alterac-valley"] = (function() return {
		["Alterac Valley Marks of Honor: play games"] = "奧特蘭克山谷榮譽徽記：打戰場",
		["Alterac Valley Reputation"] = "奧特蘭克山谷聲望",
		["Back at the gate"] = "回到大門處",
		["Back in {area:2959}"] = "回到{area:2959}",
		["Back in {area:2961}"] = "回到{area:2961}",
		["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Alterac Valley\" and the last two insignia, 400 reputation that no longer counts for anything but the insignia. {npc:13217} sells the {item:19030} (200g, level 60; its own guide), {item:19325} and {item:21563} (75g56s), {item:19323} (156g49s), {item:19321} (79g53s), {item:19324} (125g66s) and the 50g tomes and off-hands."] = "崇拜會給予傳承點數“奧特蘭克山谷大師”，以及最後兩枚徽記——那400點聲望除了換徽記之外已無用處。{npc:13217}出售{item:19030}（200金，60級；另有專門攻略）、{item:19325}和{item:21563}（75金56銀）、{item:19323}（156金49銀）、{item:19321}（79金53銀）、{item:19324}（125金66銀），以及50金的典籍和副手物品。",
		["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Alterac Valley\" and the last two insignia, 400 reputation that no longer counts for anything but the insignia. {npc:13219} sells the {item:19029} (200g, level 60; its own guide), {item:19325} and {item:21563} (75g56s), {item:19323} (156g49s), {item:19321} (79g53s), {item:19324} (125g66s) and the 50g tomes and off-hands."] = "崇拜會給予傳承點數“奧特蘭克山谷大師”，以及最後兩枚徽記——那400點聲望除了換徽記之外已無用處。{npc:13219}出售{item:19029}（200金，60級；另有專門攻略）、{item:19325}和{item:21563}（75金56銀）、{item:19323}（156金49銀）、{item:19321}（79金53銀）、{item:19324}（125金66銀），以及50金的典籍和副手物品。",
		["Friendly lets {npc:13840} upgrade your insignia: 100 reputation. Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. In Classic a full win paid 300 to 700 with its 3 marks; the Warbringer keeps taking 3 marks for 100. Inside, {item:17354} (75, from the Winterax caves) repeats every game; The Legend of Korrak (200, when he appears in the middle of the valley) goes back to {npc:13840} here. Friendly opens the {item:19031} (1g) and the Superior Healing and Mana Draughts (5s) at {npc:13219} beside him."] = "友善時{npc:13840}可以升級你的徽記：100聲望。友善到尊敬需要6000聲望。原版中一場全勝連同3枚徽記共付300到700；戰爭使者會一直以3枚徽記換100。在戰場內，{item:17354}（75點，來自冰斧洞穴）每場可重複；“科拉克的傳說”（200點，他在山谷中央出現時）交回給這裡的{npc:13840}。友善會在旁邊的{npc:13219}處解鎖{item:19031}（1金）和強效治療藥水、法力藥水（5銀）。",
		["Friendly lets {npc:13841} upgrade your insignia: 100 reputation. Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. In Classic a full win paid 300 to 700 with its 3 marks; the Brigadier General keeps taking 3 marks for 100. Inside, {item:17354} (75, from the Winterax caves) repeats every game; {npc:12159} (200, when he appears in the middle of the valley) goes back to {npc:13841} here. Friendly opens the {item:19032} (1g) and the Superior Healing and Mana Draughts (5s) at {npc:13217} beside him."] = "友善時{npc:13841}可以升級你的徽記：100聲望。友善到尊敬需要6000聲望。原版中一場全勝連同3枚徽記共付300到700；准將會一直以3枚徽記換100。在戰場內，{item:17354}（75點，來自冰斧洞穴）每場可重複；{npc:12159}（200點，他在山谷中央出現時）交回給這裡的{npc:13841}。友善會在旁邊的{npc:13217}處解鎖{item:19032}（1金）和強效治療藥水、法力藥水（5銀）。",
		["Honored: insignia rank 3, 100 reputation. Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. {npc:13217} beside {npc:13841} sells the Stormpike Soldier's and Sage's Cloaks and Pendants (about 7g each), the Stormpike belts (4g74s to 7g12s) and the Major Healing and Mana Draughts (10s)."] = "尊敬：徽記3級，100聲望。尊敬到崇敬需要12000聲望。{npc:13841}旁的{npc:13217}出售雷矛士兵和賢者的披風與墜飾（每件約7金）、雷矛腰帶（4金74銀到7金12銀），以及特效治療藥水和法力藥水（10銀）。",
		["Honored: insignia rank 3, 100 reputation. Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. {npc:13219} beside {npc:13840} sells the {npc:12051}'s and Advisor's Cloaks and Pendants (about 7g each), the Frostwolf belts (5g9s to 7g66s) and the Major Healing and Mana Draughts (10s)."] = "尊敬：徽記3級，100聲望。尊敬到崇敬需要12000聲望。{npc:13840}旁的{npc:13219}出售{npc:12051}和顧問的披風與墜飾（每件約7金）、霜狼腰帶（5金9銀到7金66銀），以及特效治療藥水和法力藥水（10銀）。",
		["Iceblood Tower banner"] = "冰血哨塔旗幟",
		["Master of Alterac Valley: a Legacy Point at Exalted"] = "奧特蘭克山谷大師：達到崇拜可獲得1點傳承點數",
		["Most of this happens on the way to {npc:11946}. Loot {quest:7223} from Horde players and guards you kill. Assault the {area:3301} or any Horde graveyard, burn a Horde tower (click its banner), and take {area:2963}. {npc:13154} stands at {area:2962}; the {npc:13597} at {area:2961}. {quest:7301} asks you to find where the three wing commanders landed. In Classic every tower, graveyard or mine paid 12 reputation, {npc:11947} 125 and {npc:11946} about 300."] = "這些大多是在前往{npc:11946}的路上完成的。從你殺死的部落玩家和衛兵身上拾取{quest:7223}。突襲{area:3301}或任意部落墓地，燒掉一座部落哨塔（點選其旗幟），並佔領{area:2963}。{npc:13154}站在{area:2962}；{npc:13597}在{area:2961}。{quest:7301}要你查明三位空軍指揮官降落在何處。原版中每座哨塔、墓地或礦坑給12點聲望，{npc:11947}給125，{npc:11946}約300。",
		["Most of this happens on the way to {npc:11948}. Loot {item:17422} from Alliance players and guards you kill. Assault the {area:3301} or any Alliance graveyard, burn an Alliance bunker (click its banner), and take {area:2957}. {npc:13320} stands at {area:3304}; the {npc:13598} in {area:2959}. {quest:7302} asks you to find where the three wing commanders landed. In Classic every tower, graveyard or mine paid 12 reputation, {npc:11949} 125 and Vanndar about 300."] = "這些大多是在前往{npc:11948}的路上完成的。從你殺死的聯盟玩家和衛兵身上拾取{item:17422}。突襲{area:3301}或任意聯盟墓地，燒掉一座聯盟碉堡（點選其旗幟），並佔領{area:2957}。{npc:13320}站在{area:3304}；{npc:13598}在{area:2959}。{quest:7302}要你查明三位空軍指揮官降落在何處。原版中每座哨塔、墓地或礦坑給12點聲望，{npc:11949}給125，範達爾約300。",
		["One-time quests worth 2,000 and big wins make it the quickest of the four; Exalted gives a Legacy Point."] = "一次性任務可獲得2,000點聲望，加上大勝獎勵，使其成為四者中最快的；達到崇拜可獲得1點傳承點數。",
		["Queue at the gate, at any battlemaster or from the battleground screen; you enter at {area:2959} in the north. Before the gates open, take the quests in the town: they are done during the battle."] = "在大門處、任意戰場軍官處或戰場介面排隊；你會在北部的{area:2959}進入。開戰前先在鎮裡接任務：它們在戰鬥中完成。",
		["Queue at the gate, at any battlemaster or from the battleground screen; you enter at {area:2961} in the south. Before the gates open, take the quests in the village: they are done during the battle."] = "在大門處、任意戰場軍官處或戰場介面排隊；你會在南部的{area:2961}進入。開戰前先在村裡接任務：它們在戰鬥中完成。",
		["Revered: insignia rank 4, 150 reputation. Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons at {npc:13217}: {item:19100}, {item:19102} and {item:19104} (31g65s to 39g85s), and the {npc:14752} (5g). At 51 and up Concerted Efforts (3 marks each from {zone:1459}, {zone:1461} and {zone:1460}) pays 200 the first time and 150 after, plus reputation for the other two battlegrounds."] = "崇敬：徽記4級，150聲望。崇敬到崇拜需要21000聲望，佔爬升的一半。崇敬會在{npc:13217}處解鎖武器：{item:19100}、{item:19102}和{item:19104}（31金65銀到39金85銀），以及{npc:14752}（5金）。51級及以上時，“共同努力”（各交3枚{zone:1459}、{zone:1461}和{zone:1460}徽記）第一次付200、之後150，並另給另外兩個戰場的聲望。",
		["Revered: insignia rank 4, 150 reputation. Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons at {npc:13219}: {item:19099}, {item:19101} and Frostbite (31g53s to 39g71s), and the {npc:14751} (5g). At 51 and up For Great Honor (3 marks each from {zone:1459}, {zone:1461} and {zone:1460}) pays 200 the first time and 150 after, plus reputation for the other two battlegrounds."] = "崇敬：徽記4級，150聲望。崇敬到崇拜需要21000聲望，佔爬升的一半。崇敬會在{npc:13219}處解鎖武器：{item:19099}、{item:19101}和霜咬（31金53銀到39金71銀），以及{npc:14751}（5金）。51級及以上時，“為了偉大的榮譽”（各交3枚{zone:1459}、{zone:1461}和{zone:1460}徽記）第一次付200、之後150，並另給另外兩個戰場的聲望。",
		["The Frostwolf camp stands outside the {zone:1459} gate in the {zone:1416}. Take every quest here: they all pay 100 or more, once."] = "霜狼營地設在{zone:1416}內{zone:1459}大門外。把這裡的任務全接了：每個都給100點以上，但只能做一次。",
		["The Stormpike camp stands outside the {zone:1459} gate, on the {zone:1416} side above {area:287}. Take every quest here: they all pay 100 or more, once."] = "雷矛營地設在{zone:1459}大門外，{area:287}上方{zone:1416}一側。把這裡的任務全接了：每個都給100點以上，但只能做一次。",
		["The battle"] = "戰鬥",
		["Your first Alterac Valley Marks of Honor go to the {npc:15350} by the gate: 150 the first time ({quest:8369}), then 100 for every 3 more. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1459} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "你的第一批奧特蘭克山谷榮譽徽記交給大門旁的{npc:15350}：第一次150點（{quest:8369}），之後每3枚100點。Forever 的PvP裝備除了榮譽還要花榮譽徽記：交之前先想好想要什麼。你最多隻能攜帶30枚{zone:1459}徽記：在達到上限前交掉或用掉。",
		["Your first Alterac Valley Marks of Honor go to the {npc:15351} beside {npc:13841}: 150 the first time ({quest:8375}), then 100 for every 3 more. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1459} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "你的第一批奧特蘭克山谷榮譽徽記交給{npc:13841}旁的{npc:15351}：第一次150點（{quest:8375}），之後每3枚100點。Forever 的PvP裝備除了榮譽還要花榮譽徽記：交之前先想好想要什麼。你最多隻能攜帶30枚{zone:1459}徽記：在達到上限前交掉或用掉。",
		["assault a graveyard"] = "突襲墓地",
		["capture a mine, 100"] = "佔領礦坑，100",
		["capture a tower or bunker, 100"] = "佔領哨塔或碉堡，100",
		["destroy a tower or bunker banner, 100"] = "摧毀哨塔或碉堡旗幟，100",
		["{area:3058} lies southwest of {area:2959}. The {item:17849} stands at the back of the cave, past the yetis and harpies."] = "{area:3058}位於{area:2959}西南。{item:17849}在洞穴深處，穿過雪人和鷹身女妖之後。",
		["{area:3305} banner"] = "{area:3305}旗幟",
		["{area:3337} lies south of {area:2978}. The {item:17850} stands at the back of the cave, past the gnolls."] = "{area:3337}位於{area:2978}以南。{item:17850}在洞穴深處，穿過豺狼人之後。",
		["{faction:729} to Friendly"] = "{faction:729}到友好",
		["{faction:730} to Friendly"] = "{faction:730}到友好",
		["{item:19031}, 1g"] = "{item:19031}，1金",
		["{item:19032}, 1g"] = "{item:19032}，1金",
		["{npc:13179}'s spot"] = "{npc:13179}的位置",
		["{npc:13180}'s spot"] = "{npc:13180}的位置",
		["{npc:13181}'s spot"] = "{npc:13181}的位置",
		["{npc:13217}: Exalted rewards"] = "{npc:13217}：崇拜獎勵",
		["{npc:13217}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:13217}：崇敬獎勵",
		["{npc:13219}: Exalted rewards"] = "{npc:13219}：崇拜獎勵",
		["{npc:13219}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:13219}：崇敬獎勵",
		["{npc:13437}'s spot"] = "{npc:13437}的位置",
		["{npc:13438}'s spot"] = "{npc:13438}的位置",
		["{npc:13439}'s spot"] = "{npc:13439}的位置",
		["{npc:13776}: assault a graveyard, 100"] = "{npc:13776}：突襲墓地，100",
		["{npc:13777}: assault a graveyard, 100"] = "{npc:13777}：突襲墓地，100",
		["{npc:13816} by the gate wants {npc:11946} dead: win a game in which your team kills him. Then he lets you pick a weapon ({quest:8271})."] = "大門旁的{npc:13816}要{npc:11946}死：贏下一場你的隊伍殺死他的戰鬥。之後他讓你挑選一件武器（{quest:8271}）。",
		["{npc:13817} by the gate wants {npc:11948} dead: win a game in which your team kills him. Then he lets you pick a weapon ({quest:8272})."] = "大門旁的{npc:13817}要{npc:11948}死：贏下一場你的隊伍殺死他的戰鬥。之後他讓你挑選一件武器（{quest:8272}）。",
		["{npc:15350}: 100 for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：3枚徽記換100",
		["{npc:15350}: For Great Honor"] = "{npc:15350}：為了偉大的榮譽",
		["{npc:15350}: {quest:8369} again, 100 for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：再次{quest:8369}，3枚徽記換100",
		["{npc:15351}: 100 for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：3枚徽記換100",
		["{npc:15351}: Concerted Efforts"] = "{npc:15351}：共同努力",
		["{npc:15351}: {quest:8375} again, 100 for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：再次{quest:8375}，3枚徽記換100",
		["{quest:7161}: the {item:17850} in {area:3337}, 100"] = "{quest:7161}：{area:3337}的{item:17850}，100",
		["{quest:7162}: the {item:17849} in {area:3058}, 100"] = "{quest:7162}：{area:3058}的{item:17849}，100",
		["{quest:8271}, 10 and a weapon"] = "{quest:8271}，10和一件武器",
		["{quest:8272}, 10 and a weapon"] = "{quest:8272}，10和一件武器",
		["{zone:1459} is a 40 against 40 battle for level 51 and up, and the fastest of the four battleground reputations: it has about 2,000 reputation of one-time quests, and a full win pays several hundred. The same one-time quests also pay 1,870 {zone:1454} reputation. {npc:13842} stands in the {object:172982}. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1459}是51級及以上的40對40戰場，也是四個戰場聲望中最快的：一次性任務約值2,000聲望，一場全勝還能給幾百點。同樣的一次性任務還會給1,870點{zone:1454}聲望。{npc:13842}站在{object:172982}裡。Forever 的傳承特長“外交家”可使本篇攻略中的每個數字最多提高10%。",
		["{zone:1459} is a 40 against 40 battle for level 51 and up, and the fastest of the four battleground reputations: it has about 2,000 reputation of one-time quests, and a full win pays several hundred. The same one-time quests also pay 1,870 {zone:1455} reputation. {npc:13843} recruits outside the {object:32372}. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1459}是51級及以上的40對40戰場，也是四個戰場聲望中最快的：一次性任務約值2,000聲望，一場全勝還能給幾百點。同樣的一次性任務還會給1,870點{zone:1455}聲望。{npc:13843}在{object:32372}外招募。Forever 的傳承特長“外交家”可使本篇攻略中的每個數字最多提高10%。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/arathi-basin"] = (function() return {
		["Arathi Basin Reputation"] = "阿拉希盆地聲望",
		["Assault the Blacksmith banner"] = "突襲鐵匠鋪旗幟",
		["Assault the Farm banner"] = "突襲農場旗幟",
		["Assault the Mine banner"] = "突襲礦洞旗幟",
		["Assault the Stables banner"] = "突襲獸欄旗幟",
		["Assault the {area:3422} banner"] = "突襲{area:3422}旗幟",
		["Assaulting a base means clicking its banner until it turns: you need not hold it. Four marks in all: one for {npc:14984}, three for the Brigadier General. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1461} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "突襲基地就是點選它的旗幟直到旗幟變色：你不需要守在那裡。總共四枚徽記：一枚交給{npc:14984}，三枚交給准將。Forever的PvP裝備除了榮譽還要花榮譽徽記：交之前先想好想要什麼。你最多隻能攜帶30枚{zone:1461}徽記：在達到上限前交掉或用掉。",
		["Assaulting a base means clicking its banner until it turns: you need not hold it. Four marks in all: one for {npc:15022}, three for the Warbringer. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1461} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "突襲基地就是點選它的旗幟直到旗幟變色：你不需要守在那裡。總共四枚徽記：一枚交給{npc:15022}，三枚交給戰爭使者。Forever的PvP裝備除了榮譽還要花榮譽徽記：交之前先想好想要什麼。你最多隻能攜帶30枚{zone:1461}徽記：在達到上限前交掉或用掉。",
		["At Exalted, {npc:14983} asks your team to hold all five bases at the same time. It pays 200 reputation and the {item:20132}, the only way to get it."] = "崇拜時，{npc:14983}要求你的隊伍同時佔領全部五座基地。獎勵200聲望和{item:20132}，這是獲得它的唯一途徑。",
		["At Exalted, {npc:15021} asks your team to hold all five bases at the same time. It pays 200 reputation and the {item:20131}, the only way to get it."] = "崇拜時，{npc:15021}要求你的隊伍同時佔領全部五座基地。獎勵200聲望和{item:20131}，這是獲得它的唯一途徑。",
		["At level 60 and Friendly, {npc:14983} asks your team to hold four bases at the same time: 200 reputation, once. It opens {quest:8115} for Exalted."] = "60級且友善時，{npc:14983}要求你的隊伍同時佔領四座基地：200聲望，僅一次。它會解鎖崇拜階段的{quest:8115}。",
		["At level 60 and Friendly, {npc:15021} asks your team to hold four bases at the same time: 200 reputation, once. It opens {quest:8122} for Exalted."] = "60級且友善時，{npc:15021}要求你的隊伍同時佔領四座基地：200聲望，僅一次。它會解鎖崇拜階段的{quest:8122}。",
		["Back to {area:320}"] = "回到{area:320}",
		["Back to {area:321}"] = "返回{area:321}",
		["Every 200 resources your team gathers pays it; Exalted gives a Legacy Point, epic shoulders and the tabard."] = "你的隊伍每收集200資源就會給予聲望；達到崇拜可獲得1點傳承點數、史詩護肩和戰袍。",
		["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Arathi Basin\" and opens the epics: the level 60 Defiler's shoulders in every armor type (12g75s to 20g), {item:20068} (13g18s), {item:20069} (50g46s) and Mindfang (42g83s), both from level 55."] = "崇拜會給予傳承點數“阿拉希盆地大師”，並開放史詩獎勵：各甲種的60級汙染者護肩（12金75銀到20金）、{item:20068}（13金18銀）、{item:20069}（50金46銀）和心靈之牙（42金83銀），後兩件從55級起可買。",
		["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Arathi Basin\" and opens the epics: the level 60 Highlander's shoulders in every armor type (12g33s to 18g50s), {item:20073} (12g14s), {item:20069} (55g10s) and Sageclaw (44g24s), both from level 55."] = "崇拜會給予傳承點數“阿拉希盆地大師”，並開放史詩獎勵：各甲種的60級高地人護肩（12金33銀到18金50銀）、{item:20073}（12金14銀）、{item:20069}（55金10銀）和賢者之爪（44金24銀），後兩件從55級起可買。",
		["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation, about 40 wins at the Classic rate. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:15126} beside {npc:15021}: the {item:20072} trinket for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (72s to 4g12s), and food and bandages that work in {zone:1461} (10s to 20s). He also gives one Defiler's care package at Friendly (pick the one for your level): 10 reputation and a bag of battleground food and bandages."] = "友善到尊敬需要6000聲望，按原版速率約需40場勝利。友善會在{npc:15021}旁的{npc:15126}處開放首批獎勵：適用於28、38、48和58級的{item:20072}飾品（72銀到4金12銀），以及在{zone:1461}中可用的食物和繃帶（10銀到20銀）。他還會在友善時給一個汙染者補給包（按你的等級挑選）：10聲望和一袋戰場食物與繃帶。",
		["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation, about 40 wins at the Classic rate. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:15127} beside {npc:14983}: the {item:20071} trinket for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (72s to 4g12s), and food and bandages that work in {zone:1461} (10s to 20s). He also gives one Arathor care package at Friendly (pick the one for your level): 10 reputation and a bag of battleground food and bandages."] = "友善到尊敬需要6000聲望，按原版速率約需40場勝利。友善會在{npc:14983}旁的{npc:15127}處開放首批獎勵：適用於28、38、48和58級的{item:20071}飾品（72銀到4金12銀），以及在{zone:1461}中可用的食物和繃帶（10銀到20銀）。他還會在友善時給一個阿拉索補給包（按你的等級挑選）：10聲望和一袋戰場食物與繃帶。",
		["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation, about 80 wins. Honored opens the Defiler's belts in plate, lamellar, chain, mail, leather, lizardhide and cloth for levels 28 to 58 (75s to 8g78s)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000聲望，約需80場勝利。尊敬會開放汙染者腰帶，包括板甲、鱗甲、鎖甲、鍊甲、皮甲、蜥蜴皮和布甲，適用於28到58級（75銀到8金78銀）。",
		["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation, about 80 wins. Honored opens the Highlander's belts in plate, lamellar, chain, mail, leather, lizardhide and cloth for levels 28 to 58 (72s to 8g84s)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000聲望，約需80場勝利。尊敬會開放高地人腰帶，包括板甲、鱗甲、鎖甲、鍊甲、皮甲、蜥蜴皮和布甲，適用於28到58級（72銀到8金84銀）。",
		["League of Arathor to Exalted"] = "阿拉索聯軍到崇拜",
		["League of Arathor to Friendly"] = "阿拉索聯軍到友好",
		["League of Arathor to Honored"] = "阿拉索聯軍到尊敬",
		["League of Arathor to Revered"] = "阿拉索聯軍到崇敬",
		["Master of Arathi Basin: a Legacy Point at Exalted"] = "阿拉希盆地大師：達到崇拜獲得1點傳承點數",
		["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. In Classic a win paid 100 and its 3 marks bring 50 more at the Brigadier General ({quest:8374}, again and again): about 150 a win, some 20 wins. Forever has not published its battleground rates, so count the games as a rough guide. Below level 50 the quests at {area:320} come in a version for your bracket (from level 20): 200 for assaulting the bases, 200 for one mark, then 100 and 50 per 3 marks at the Brigadier General."] = "中立到友善需要3000聲望。原版中一場勝利給100，3枚徽記在准將處（{quest:8374}，可反覆交）再換50：每場約150，約20場。Forever沒有公佈戰場聲望速率，所以把場次當作粗略參考。50級以下時，{area:320}的任務會提供適合你等級段的版本（20級起）：突襲各基地200，交一枚徽記200，之後在准將處每3枚徽記得100和50。",
		["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. In Classic a win paid 100 and its 3 marks bring 50 more at the Warbringer ({quest:8370}, again and again): about 150 a win, some 20 wins. Forever has not published its battleground rates, so count the games as a rough guide. Below level 50 the quests at {area:321} come in a version for your bracket (from level 20): 200 for assaulting the bases, 200 for one mark, then 100 and 50 per 3 marks at the Warbringer."] = "中立到友善需要3000聲望。原版中一場勝利給100，3枚徽記在戰爭使者處（{quest:8370}，可反覆交）再換50：每場約150，約20場。Forever沒有公佈戰場聲望速率，所以把場次當作粗略參考。50級以下時，{area:321}的任務會提供適合你等級段的版本（20級起）：突襲各基地200，交一枚徽記200，之後在戰爭使者處每3枚徽記得100和50。",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, about 140 wins: half of the whole climb. Revered opens the Defiler's boots and greaves for levels 28 to 58 (1g12s to 13g41s), the ones with the run-speed bonus."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21000聲望，約需140場勝利，佔整個爬升的一半。崇敬會開放汙染者長靴和護脛，適用於28到58級（1金12銀到13金41銀），也就是帶移動速度加成的那幾件。",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, about 140 wins: half of the whole climb. Revered opens the Highlander's boots and greaves for levels 28 to 58 (1g7s to 13g65s), the ones with the run-speed bonus."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21000聲望，約需140場勝利，佔整個爬升的一半。崇敬會開放高地人長靴和護脛，適用於28到58級（1金7銀到13金65銀），也就是帶移動速度加成的那幾件。",
		["all five bases held at once"] = "同時佔領全部五座基地",
		["four bases held at once"] = "同時佔領四座基地",
		["hand in the three marks first"] = "先交三枚徽記",
		["one {item:20559}"] = "一個{item:20559}",
		["three more marks"] = "再交三枚徽記",
		["{faction:510} to Exalted"] = "{faction:510}到崇拜",
		["{faction:510} to Friendly"] = "{faction:510}到友好",
		["{faction:510} to Honored"] = "{faction:510}到尊敬",
		["{faction:510} to Revered"] = "{faction:510}到崇敬",
		["{npc:14983}: assault four bases, 200"] = "{npc:14983}：突襲四座基地，200",
		["{npc:14984}: one mark, 200"] = "{npc:14984}：一枚徽記，200",
		["{npc:15021}: assault four bases, 200"] = "{npc:15021}：突襲四座基地，200",
		["{npc:15022}: one mark, 200"] = "{npc:15022}：一枚徽記，200",
		["{npc:15126}: Exalted rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：崇拜獎勵",
		["{npc:15126}: Friendly rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：友善獎勵",
		["{npc:15126}: Honored rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：尊敬獎勵",
		["{npc:15126}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：崇敬獎勵",
		["{npc:15127}: Exalted rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：崇拜獎勵",
		["{npc:15127}: Friendly rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：友善獎勵",
		["{npc:15127}: Honored rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：尊敬獎勵",
		["{npc:15127}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：崇敬獎勵",
		["{npc:15350}: 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：3枚徽記換50聲望",
		["{npc:15350}: three marks, 100"] = "{npc:15350}：三枚徽記，100",
		["{npc:15350}: {quest:8370} again, 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：再次交{quest:8370}，3枚徽記換50聲望",
		["{npc:15351}: 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：3枚徽記換50聲望",
		["{npc:15351}: three marks, 100"] = "{npc:15351}：三枚徽記，100",
		["{npc:15351}: {quest:8374} again, 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：再次交{quest:8374}，3枚徽記換50聲望",
		["{zone:1461} is a 15 against 15 battle over five bases, from level 20: hold bases to gather resources, and the first team to 2000 wins. Queue at any battlemaster in the capitals or from the battleground screen. In Classic every 200 resources your team gathers pay everyone 10 reputation, so a win pays 100 and a close loss nearly as much; a game also pays 3 Arathi Basin Marks of Honor for a win, 1 for a loss. The three quests here pay 500 reputation together (200, 200 and 100), once. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1461}是15對15、圍繞五座基地的戰場，20級起可進：佔領基地以採集資源，先到2000點的一方獲勝。可在任意主城的戰場軍官處排隊，或用戰場介面排隊。原版中你的隊伍每採集200點資源，全隊每人得10聲望，所以一場勝利給100，惜敗也差不多；一場勝利還給3枚阿拉希盆地榮譽徽記，失敗給1枚。這裡的三個任務合計給500聲望（200、200和100），僅一次。Forever的傳承專長“外交家”會使本攻略中的所有數值最多增加10%。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/argent-dawn"] = (function() return {
		["Argent Dawn Reputation"] = "銀色黎明聲望",
		["Argent Dawn Valor Tokens"] = "銀色黎明勇氣勳章",
		["Argent Dawn Valor Tokens, from the stone turn-ins"] = "銀色黎明勇氣勳章，來自交石頭",
		["At Exalted, {npc:11536} takes 25 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens for the {quest:5517} (150 reputation): +5 to every resistance, on your shoulders. After it, the quartermasters sell more for 40 gold each."] = "崇拜時，{npc:11536}收25枚銀色黎明勇氣勳章，換取{quest:5517}（150聲望）：肩部裝備，所有抗性+5。之後，軍需官以每件40金出售更多。",
		["At Revered, {npc:11536} takes 10 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens for {quest:5513} (100 reputation). After it, any {faction:529} quartermaster sells the five shoulder enchants for 10 gold each: Flame, Frost, Arcane, Nature and {item:18173}, +5 to that resistance. Revered also opens the {item:13810} and its juice (60 silver) and the Revered recipes."] = "達到崇敬後，{npc:11536} 會收取 10 枚銀色黎明勇氣勳章，用於完成 {quest:5513}（100 點聲望）。完成後，任意 {faction:529} 軍需官都會出售五種肩部附魔，每種 10 金幣：火焰、冰霜、奧術、自然和 {item:18173}，對應抗性 +5。崇敬還會解鎖 {item:13810} 及其果汁（60 銀）和崇敬配方。",
		["Back at {area:2268}"] = "回到{area:2268}",
		["Dark Adepts and Shadowmages at {area:2272}"] = "{area:2272}的黑暗專家和暗影法師",
		["Ectoplasmic Resonators: the ghosts around the cauldron"] = "靈質共振器：瘟疫鍋周圍的鬼魂",
		["Every Scourge kill in the Plaguelands gives 5 reputation (named ones 15), from the level 50 ghouls and skeletons up; at level 60 pick the level 53 and up ones, since in Classic grey mobs give only about a fifth. Neutral to Friendly is 2,800: about 560 kills, fewer with the Plaguelands quests on the way. The densest Scourge stand around the four Scourge Cauldrons: {area:199} west of Andorhal (skeletons, 50-53), {area:200} north of Andorhal (zombies and ghouls, 52-55), the {area:202} in the south (ghouls, 54-55) and {area:201} in the east (ghosts, 56-57). Keep every Scourgestone and every quest you can save: turn-ins never stop counting, kills do. {quest:5510} drop from about four in ten of these Scourge, Invader's from about a third of the level 56 and up ones. If you die, take the Commission off and put it back on: it can lose its effect. Paladins (Human and Dwarf): {npc:10838} at {area:3197} asks 20 {quest:5510} once for Dispelling Evil, 100 reputation instead of 25. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "在瘟疫之地每殺一個天災給5聲望（具名的給15），從50級的食屍鬼和骷髏起；60級時挑53級及以上的，因為經典舊世中灰色怪物只給約五分之一。中立到友善需2,800：約560殺，路上做瘟疫之地任務會更少。天災最密集的地方在四口天災瘟疫鍋周圍：安多哈爾以西的{area:199}（骷髏，50-53）、安多哈爾以北的{area:200}（殭屍和食屍鬼，52-55）、南部的{area:202}（食屍鬼，54-55）和東部的{area:201}（鬼魂，56-57）。每塊天災石和每個能攢的任務都留著：交付永遠算數，殺怪則不然。這些天災約十分之四掉{quest:5510}，56級及以上的約三分之一掉入侵者之天災石。若你死了，把委任狀摘下來再戴上：它可能失效。聖騎士（人類和矮人）：{area:3197}的{npc:10838}會一次性索要20個{quest:5510}，換取“驅除邪惡”，給100聲望而非25。傳承特長“外交家”使所有獲取提高最多10%。",
		["Friendly to Honored: stones and named Scourge"] = "友善到尊敬：石頭與具名天災",
		["Honored to Revered is 12,000: about 2,400 {area:2057} and {area:2279} mobs, fewer with their bosses. Their mobs stop at 11,999 of 12,000 Honored; a boss or a turn-in takes you over. Solo, only Scourgestones, the cauldron deliveries and Araj count: 12,000 is 480 turn-ins, or 4,800 {quest:5509}. Keep the stones you get in the dungeons until their mobs stop counting. Honored opens recipes at all three quartermasters: {npc:11536} at {area:2268}, {npc:10857} at {area:3197}, {npc:10856} at the {area:152}. Also the {item:22014} (133 gold) for the Three Kings of Flame quest."] = "尊敬到崇敬需12,000：約2,400個{area:2057}和{area:2279}的怪物，加上它們的首領會更少。它們的怪物在尊敬11,999/12,000時停止；一個首領或一次交付就能帶你越線。單刷時只有天災石、瘟疫鍋交付和阿拉基算數：12,000等於480次交付，或4,800個{quest:5509}。把地城裡拿到的石頭留到其中的怪物停止計數。尊敬開放三位軍需官的配方：{area:2268}的{npc:11536}、{area:3197}的{npc:10857}、{area:152}的{npc:10856}。還有“烈焰三王”任務所需的{item:22014}（133金）。",
		["Honored to Revered: dungeons and stones"] = "尊敬到崇敬：地城與石頭",
		["Hungering Wraiths at {area:201}; any Scourge counts"] = "{area:201}的飢餓怨靈；任何天災都算",
		["Neutral to Friendly: Scourge of the {zone:1422}"] = "中立到友善：{zone:1422}的天災",
		["Normal Scourge outside the dungeons stop giving reputation halfway through Friendly (3,000 of 6,000); {npc:10826}, {npc:10821} and {npc:10825} stop at the end of Friendly. After that only Araj, the {area:2057} and {area:2279} mobs, the cauldron deliveries and Scourgestones count. Now turn in the stones you saved: {npc:11039} at {area:2268} takes all three kinds, and so do the officers at {area:3197} and the {area:152}. Every turn-in pays 25 and an {item:12844}: keep 35 tokens for the mantles at Revered and Exalted. {quest:5509} are worth twice as much per stone: the Dark Adepts, Shadowmages, Dread Weavers and Scourge Champions (level 58-60) at {area:2272}, just north of {area:2268}, drop them about a third of the time or more, next to the turn-in. The named Scourge below drop a {item:12843} half the time or more ({npc:1850} two times in three, Araj and {npc:10821} half the time) and give 15 a kill, Araj until Exalted; {npc:1850} gives no reputation, only the stone. Friendly opens the Enriched Manna Biscuits (60 silver) at the quartermasters."] = "地城外的普通天災在友善過半時（6,000中的3,000）就不再給聲望；{npc:10826}、{npc:10821}和{npc:10825}在友善結束時停止。此後只有阿拉基、{area:2057}和{area:2279}的怪物、瘟疫鍋交付和天災石算數。現在把攢下的石頭交掉：{area:2268}的{npc:11039}收全部三種，{area:3197}和{area:152}的軍官也一樣。每次交付給25聲望和一枚{item:12844}：留35枚勳章換崇敬和崇拜時的斗篷。{quest:5509}每塊石頭價值翻倍：{area:2268}正北方{area:2272}的黑暗專家、暗影法師、恐懼編織者和天災勇士（58-60級）約三分之一或更高几率掉落，就在交付點旁邊。下列具名天災有一半或更高几率掉{item:12843}（{npc:1850}三分之二，阿拉基和{npc:10821}一半），每殺一個給15聲望，阿拉基直到崇拜；{npc:1850}不給聲望，只給石頭。友善時軍需官開放強化瑪納餅乾（60銀）。",
		["Plagued Flesh Samples: the Scourge inside"] = "瘟疫血肉樣本：裡面的天災",
		["Plaguelands quests and the Scourge Cauldrons"] = "瘟疫之地任務與天災瘟疫鍋",
		["Recipes for Tailors, Leatherworkers, Blacksmiths, Enchanters and Alchemists from Honored and Revered"] = "尊敬和崇敬時可獲得裁縫、制皮、鍛造、附魔和鍊金術配方",
		["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 840 Scourgestone or cauldron turn-ins, or the dungeon bosses with their {quest:5508} (a full {area:2057} clear is about 600). Turn in every stone and {item:13920} you saved."] = "崇敬到崇拜需21,000：840次天災石或瘟疫鍋交付，或用地城首領及其{quest:5508}（一次{area:2057}全清約600）。把攢下的每一塊天災石和{item:13920}都交掉。",
		["Scourgestones, {area:2057} and {area:2279}: the shoulder resistance enchants and a dozen recipes."] = "天災石、{area:2057}和{area:2279}：肩部抗性附魔和十幾種配方。",
		["Soulless Ghouls at the {area:202}"] = "{area:202}的無魂食屍鬼",
		["The Plaguelands quests pay in full at 60 from level 55 up and never stop counting, about 1,500 in all; the leveling guides walk them. The cauldron chain from {npc:11053} at {area:3197} (Horde: {npc:11055} at the {area:152}): 150 per cauldron with its return, then Mission Accomplished! 200. Alas, Andorhal 150 ({npc:1852}, elite). At {area:2268}, {npc:11063}'s {area:2262} quests (Brother Carlin 50 from Chromie in Andorhal, Villains of Darrowshire 100, Marauders of Darrowshire 100) and {npc:10926}'s Hidden Treasures 200 at the end of the {area:2262} story; {npc:12250} 75 from {npc:11038}. After Mission Accomplished!, each cauldron takes a repeatable delivery: 25 reputation every time, until Exalted. {npc:11056} at {area:3197} (Horde: {npc:11057} at the {area:152}) gives you a {item:13370}, without which the reagents never drop, and sells Arcane Quickeners for 50 silver (one per delivery; it crumbles after 30 minutes, so buy it last). Each delivery also takes 4 {item:14047}. Farm {area:201}: its ghosts drop an {item:13354} about one time in four, so about 16 kills fill a delivery; the other cauldrons want 5 or 6 reagents that drop one time in ten or less. Once the Plaguelands Scourge stop counting, this earns about four times what their Scourgestones alone do."] = "瘟疫之地的任務從55級起在60級足額給分，而且一直計入，總共約1,500點；練級指南會走過它們。{area:3197}的{npc:11053}（部落：{area:152}的{npc:11055}）的大鍋任務鏈：每口大鍋連同交回給150點，然後是“任務完成！”200點。“唉，安多哈爾”150點（{npc:1852}，精英）。在{area:2268}，{npc:11063}的{area:2262}任務（從安多哈爾的克羅米處接的“卡林修士”50點、“達隆郡的惡徒”100點、“達隆郡的掠奪者”100點）和{area:2262}故事結尾{npc:10926}的“隱藏的寶藏”200點；{npc:11038}處的{npc:12250} 75點。“任務完成！”之後，每口大鍋接受一次可重複交付：每次25點聲望，直到崇拜。{area:3197}的{npc:11056}（部落：{area:152}的{npc:11057}）會給你一個{item:13370}，沒有它材料就不會掉，他還賣50銀的奧術快速劑（每次交付一瓶；30分鐘後失效，所以最後再買）。每次交付還要4塊{item:14047}。刷{area:201}：那裡的幽靈大約四次掉一個{item:13354}，所以約16次擊殺就夠一次交付；其他大鍋要5或6個材料，掉率十分之一或更低。瘟疫之地的天災怪停止計分之後，這條路線的收益大約是隻交天災石的四倍。",
		["the cauldron at {area:201}: handed in from its window, never in the log"] = "{area:201}的大鍋：在它的視窗中直接繳交，不會出現在任務日誌中",
		["the {object:176245}: burn it, Scarlet side"] = "{object:176245}：燒掉它，血色陣營那邊",
		["{area:2057} lies under {area:2298}, the island town in the south-east of the {zone:1422}; your side's {area:2057} quests give the {item:13704} that opens it. It is the best {faction:529} run: its mobs give 5 up to the last point of Honored, and its thirteen bosses about 375 reputation a full clear plus ten or so {quest:5508} (about 250 more). {npc:10508} and {npc:1853} give 50 each."] = "{area:2057}位於{area:2298}之下，那是{zone:1422}東南的島嶼城鎮；你方陣營的{area:2057}任務會給開啟它的{item:13704}。這是刷{faction:529}最好的副本：其中的怪物一直給5點直到尊敬最後一點，十三個首領一次全清約375聲望，外加十來個{quest:5508}（再多約250）。{npc:10508}和{npc:1853}各給50。",
		["{area:2268} quests"] = "{area:2268}的任務",
		["{area:2268}, on the east side of the {zone:1423}, is the {faction:529}'s home: {npc:11039}, {npc:11035} and {npc:243252} give its dungeon quests, 100 to 200 reputation each and about 1,700 in all. They are group quests for {area:2279} and {area:2057} (level 58-60, five players): take the ones your group will run. The Duke's chain ends at the {object:176317}, a chest of {faction:529} gear."] = "{area:2268} 位於 {zone:1423} 東部，是 {faction:529} 的據點：{npc:11039}、{npc:11035} 和 {npc:243252} 會提供地下城任務，每個獎勵100到200點聲望，總計約1,700點。這些是 {area:2279} 和 {area:2057} 的組隊任務（58-60級，五人）：只接你的小隊要去的地下城對應的任務。公爵的任務線最終獎勵 {object:176317}，這是裝有 {faction:529} 裝備的箱子。",
		["{area:2279} is a group of five at the north end of the {zone:1423}. Its Scourge give 5 reputation a kill up to the last point of Honored, and its Scourge bosses 25 until Exalted ({npc:10440} 50), each with a {item:12843}. The Black Guard Sentries by the Baron give 5 until Exalted. The Scourge side, through the service entrance, pays far more than the Scarlet side."] = "{area:2279}是{zone:1423}北端的五人副本。其中的天災每殺一個給5聲望，直到尊敬最後一點；天災首領給25直到崇拜（{npc:10440}給50），每人還掉一塊{item:12843}。男爵身邊的黑衛哨兵給5直到崇拜。走服務入口進去的天災一側，收益遠高於血色一側。",
		["{item:12843}: the named Scourge below, and dungeon bosses"] = "{item:12843}：下列有名字的天譴軍，以及地城首領",
		["{item:13180}: the supply crates"] = "{item:13180}：補給箱",
		["{item:13320}, 50 silver"] = "{item:13320}，50銀",
		["{item:13482} ({skill:171}), 1 gold 50 silver"] = "{item:13482}（{skill:171}），1金50銀",
		["{item:18170}: pick the resistance you need, 10 gold"] = "{item:18170}：挑選你需要的抗性，10金",
		["{item:19203} ({skill:164}), 2 gold 20 silver"] = "{item:19203}（{skill:164}），2金20銀",
		["{item:19205} ({skill:164}), 4 gold"] = "{item:19205}（{skill:164}），4金",
		["{item:19216} ({skill:197}), 2 gold 20 silver"] = "{item:19216}（{skill:197}），2金20銀",
		["{item:19217} ({skill:197}), 4 gold"] = "{item:19217}（{skill:197}），4金",
		["{item:19328} ({skill:165}), 2 gold 20 silver"] = "{item:19328}（{skill:165}），2金20銀",
		["{item:19329} ({skill:165}), 4 gold"] = "{item:19329}（{skill:165}），4金",
		["{item:19442} ({skill:129}), 10 gold"] = "{item:19442}（{skill:129}），10金",
		["{item:19446}, 3 gold"] = "{item:19446}，3金",
		["{item:19447}, 6 gold"] = "{item:19447}，6金",
		["{npc:10811}, Scarlet side"] = "{npc:10811}，血色一側",
		["{npc:10839} stands at the {area:152}, on the road from {zone:1420} into the {zone:1422}. {object:2160} starts at Neutral 200 for everyone. Wear the Commission trinket while you fight the Scourge: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it. {npc:11039} at {area:2268} gives the same Commission; you can only take one."] = "{npc:10839}站在{area:152}，位於從{zone:1420}進入{zone:1422}的路上。{object:2160}對所有人從中立200開始。打天災時戴上委任狀飾品：只有戴著它天災石才會掉落。{area:2268}的{npc:11039}給同樣的委任狀；你只能拿一個。",
		["{npc:10840} stands in {area:3197}, in the south of the {zone:1422}. {object:2160} starts at Neutral 200 for everyone. Wear the Commission trinket while you fight the Scourge: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it. {npc:11039} at {area:2268} gives the same Commission; you can only take one."] = "{npc:10840}站在{area:3197}，在{zone:1422}南部。{object:2160}對所有人從中立200開始。打天災時戴上委任狀飾品：只有戴著它天災石才會掉落。{area:2268}的{npc:11039}給同樣的委任狀；你只能拿一個。",
		["{npc:11056}: ask for a {item:13370}"] = "{npc:11056}：索要{item:13370}",
		["{npc:11057}, at the {area:152}: ask for a {item:13370}"] = "{npc:11057}，在{area:152}：索要{item:13370}",
		["{npc:1850}, {zone:1422}: the stone only"] = "{npc:1850}，{zone:1422}：只有石頭",
		["{npc:1852}, Andorhal"] = "{npc:1852}，安多哈爾",
		["{quest:5212} leads to {quest:5213} (the {item:13176} in a {area:2279} ziggurat), which rewards the {item:13209} or the {item:19812}: better trinkets that also make Scourgestones drop, so they can replace the Commission. {quest:5251} leads on to the {item:13250} and {npc:10440}. A {item:13920}, a rare drop (about 6%) from the {quest:5529} once {quest:5529} is done, starts a quest worth 50 each time: keep them until Revered. {npc:10267} in the {zone:1428}, at the end of her {area:1583} quests, sends you to {npc:243252} (75) and on to {npc:11035}'s {item:12368} in {area:2057} (25 and 200)."] = "{quest:5212} 後續是 {quest:5213}（獲取 {area:2279} 通靈塔中的 {item:13176}），獎勵 {item:13209} 或 {item:19812}：它們是更好的飾品，同樣能讓怪物掉落天災石，因此可以替代委任徽章。{quest:5251} 會繼續引向 {item:13250} 和 {npc:10440}。完成 {quest:5529} 後，{quest:5529} 有較低機率（約 6%）掉落 {item:13920}，可開啟一個每次提供 50 點聲望的任務：留到崇敬再交。{zone:1428} 的 {npc:10267} 在她的 {area:1583} 任務鏈末尾，會讓你去找 {npc:243252}（75 點），再前往 {area:2057} 獲取 {npc:11035} 所需的 {item:12368}（25 點和 200 點）。",
		["{quest:5401} (Alliance)"] = "{quest:5401}（聯盟）",
		["{quest:5405} (Horde)"] = "{quest:5405}（部落）",
		["{quest:5508}: 1 for 25 reputation"] = "{quest:5508}：1個換25聲望",
		["{quest:5509}: 10 for 25 reputation"] = "{quest:5509}：10個換25聲望",
		["{quest:5510}: 20 for 25 reputation"] = "{quest:5510}：20個換25聲望",
		["{quest:5510}: keep them"] = "{quest:5510}：留著",
		["{quest:5529}, in the hatchery"] = "{quest:5529}，在孵化間",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/bloodsail-buccaneers"] = (function() return {
		["\"Pretty Boy\" Duncan, a Bloodsail pirate, stands on the beach north of {area:35}. {area:35} players kill him for a quest: if he is not there, wait for him. He has a quest for you from level 55, while {area:35} is below Neutral; it is done once you are Friendly with the Bloodsail and Hated with {area:35}."] = "血帆海盜“小白臉”鄧肯站在{area:35}以北的海灘上。{area:35}的玩家會為任務殺他：如果他不在，就等他。55級起他會給你一個任務，前提是{area:35}聲望低於中立；當你與血帆達到友善、與{area:35}達到仇恨時才算完成。",
		["At Neutral the Bloodsail crew stop attacking you. {npc:2546} is aboard the {area:1757}, the pirate ship anchored south of {area:35}, on its middle deck. Swim out; take the quest and hand it in on the spot for the {item:22746}: the {item:22742}, Sash, Pants and Boots."] = "到中立後，血帆船員不再攻擊你。{npc:2546}在{area:1757}上，那是停泊在{area:35}以南的海盜船，他在中層甲板。游過去；接任務並當場交回，換取{item:22746}：{item:22742}、腰帶、褲子和靴子。",
		["Back to Firallon for the {item:12185} (in Classic its use calls a parrot to your shoulder): 200 more Bloodsail and 1,000 less {area:35}. Bruisers pay 25 only up to the end of Honored and Jazzrik, a lone goblin in the {zone:1418}, 5 up to the end of Revered; no quest is left, so Exalted cannot be reached."] = "回到菲拉隆處拿{item:12185}（經典舊世中，使用它會召喚一隻鸚鵡停在肩上）：血帆聲望再加200，{area:35}聲望再減1,000。打手只在尊敬結束前每次給25點，而{zone:1418}中獨行的哥布林Jazzrik在崇敬結束前每次給5點；已無任務可做，所以無法達到崇拜。",
		["Before you start"] = "開始之前",
		["Bloodsail Buccaneers Reputation"] = "血帆海盜聲望",
		["Bloodsail standing goes up only by killing the people of {area:35}, and every kill costs you {area:35} 125 and the other goblin towns ({area:976}, {area:392}, {area:2255}, and in Forever likely Powderfuse) about 62 each. After the Bruisers this guide asks for, every goblin town is Hated: their guards attack you, and you lose their flight masters, inns, vendors and {area:976}'s and {area:2255}'s auction houses. Getting back takes longer than getting here (last step). Fly in, bind elsewhere, and do your goblin-town business first. The outfit and the hat need only Friendly; past that Bloodsail has nothing to give. {area:35}'s guards are not your enemies yet: tick At War for {area:35} in your reputation panel, then attack."] = "血帆聲望只能透過殺{area:35}的人來提升，而每殺一個都會讓你損失{area:35} 125點和其它哥布林城鎮（{area:976}、{area:392}、{area:2255}，在Forever中很可能還有火藥鎮）各約62點。完成本指南要求的打手擊殺後，所有哥布林城鎮都會變為仇恨：衛兵會攻擊你，你也會失去它們的飛行管理員、旅店、商人，以及{area:976}和{area:2255}的拍賣行。挽回這些比走到這裡更費時（見最後一步）。飛進來，把爐石綁在別處，並先辦完你在各大哥布林城鎮的事務。套裝和帽子只需友善；再往後血帆就沒有什麼可給的了。{area:35}的衛兵現在還不是你的敵人：在聲望面板中為{area:35}勾選“交戰”，然後再動手。",
		["Booty Bay Bruisers to Neutral"] = "靠藏寶海灣打手到中立",
		["Bruisers to Friendly"] = "靠打手到友善",
		["Every goblin town is now Hated. Forever's quest data takes the town reputation off the four goblin amends quests outside {area:392}, {area:35}, {area:976} and {area:2255}, so the climb back is the Cartel's own: {npc:14637} in {zone:1444} serves everyone, and his Zapped Giants quests pay 25 to every town at once; Bloodsail pirates give {area:35} 5 each up to the end of Neutral (and cost Bloodsail 25); Southsea pirates and the Venture Co. in Stranglethorn give the towns 5 each. The Steamwheedle Cartel guide has the details. Expect it to take longer than the war did."] = "現在所有哥布林城鎮都是仇恨。Forever的任務資料把城鎮聲望從{area:392}、{area:35}、{area:976}和{area:2255}外的四個哥布林補償任務中移除了，所以挽回之路只能靠財團自己：{zone:1444}的{npc:14637}面向所有人服務，他的“電擊巨人”任務會一次性給每個城鎮25點；血帆海盜在中立結束前每次給{area:35} 5點（並扣血帆25點）；荊棘谷的南海海盜和風險投資公司每次給各城鎮5點。熱砂財團指南有詳細說明。做好它比那場戰爭花的時間更長的準備。",
		["Look at your Bloodsail bar first. A new character starts Hated, 500 short of Hostile: 260 Bruisers to Neutral, at 25 each. But every {area:35} quest you did while leveling took five times its {area:35} reward off Bloodsail (An OOX of Your Own, Stranglethorn Fever and Facing Negolash 1,000 each), and every Bloodsail pirate you killed 25 more: after {area:35}'s quests you sit near the bottom of Hated, up to 1,680 Bruisers from Neutral. Divide what the bar still lacks to Hostile, plus 6,000, by 25. Bruisers (level 57) hit hard, net you and knock you back, and new ones come when a goblin calls for help. Fight on the path that turns left from the tunnel up to the blacksmith's house: two Bruisers patrol it and rarely meet. Once they are down, step into the house (or hit one of the goblins inside) and a fresh Bruiser comes running. Players manage 30 to 40 an hour. {area:35} is Hated after about 53 Bruisers from a fresh Neutral 500. At the New Year celebration the town's goblins are drunk and do not fight back. The Blackwater crew at {area:327} in the {zone:1417} (level 37-40) are easier but pay only 5 each. Do not kill Bloodsail pirates: each costs 25."] = "先看看你的血帆聲望條。新角色從仇恨開始，離敵對差500點：殺260個打手可到中立，每個25點。但你在升級時做過的每個{area:35}任務都會按它{area:35}獎勵的五倍扣除血帆聲望（“你自己的OOX”、“荊棘谷熱病”和“直面奈古拉什”各1,000點），而且每殺一個血帆海盜還要再扣25點：做完{area:35}的任務後，你會落在仇恨的最底端，離中立最多要殺1,680個打手。把聲望條離敵對還差的部分加上6,000，再除以25。打手（57級）打得疼，會用網困住你並把你擊退，而且哥布林一呼救就會來新的。在從隧道向上通往鐵匠住宅的岔路左轉那條路上打：兩個打手在那裡巡邏，很少撞在一起。把他們放倒後，走進屋子（或打裡面的一個哥布林），就會有一個新打手跑來。玩家每小時能打30到40個。從全新的中立500起，約殺53個打手後{area:35}就會變成仇恨。新年慶典時，鎮上的哥布林喝醉了，不會還手。{zone:1417}中{area:327}的黑水船員（37-40級）更容易，但每個只給5點。不要殺血帆海盜：每個扣25點。",
		["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 more: 120 Bruisers. Friendly is the last standing that unlocks anything."] = "中立到友善還需3,000點：120個打手。友善是最後一個能解鎖東西的聲望等級。",
		["The pirate outfit and the {item:10030}, bought with a war against {area:35} and every goblin town."] = "海盜套裝和{item:10030}，是用與{area:35}及所有哥布林城鎮為敵的戰爭換來的。",
		["The way back"] = "挽回之路",
		["The {item:10030}"] = "{item:10030}",
		["the path to the smithy"] = "通往鐵匠鋪的小路",
		["{npc:14637}: Zapped Giants, open to the Hated"] = "{npc:14637}：“電擊巨人”，對仇恨者開放",
		["{npc:2496} and {npc:2487} stand on the top floor of the {area:35} inn, out on the balcony. Both are level 60 and Bruisers come to their aid: clear the stairs first and pull them one at a time. They come back, so a friend can kill them too."] = "{npc:2496}和{npc:2487}站在{area:35}旅店的頂層，在陽臺上。兩人都是60級，而且打手會來幫他們：先清乾淨樓梯，再一個一個拉。他們會復活，所以朋友也能來殺。",
		["{npc:2546}, on the {area:1757}: 25"] = "{npc:2546}，在{area:1757}上：25",
		["{npc:2546}: the {item:22746}"] = "{npc:2546}：{item:22746}",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/brood-of-nozdormu"] = (function() return {
		["10 (and 100 Cenarion Circle)"] = "10（另加100塞納里奧議會）",
		["100 (and 100 Cenarion Circle)"] = "100（另加100塞納里奧議會）",
		["200 (and 200 Cenarion Circle)"] = "200（另加200塞納里奧議會）",
		["A raid event: follow {npc:11832} toward {area:2361} and keep him alive against Eranikus and his nightmare adds until Tyrande arrives and redeems Eranikus. Do not kill Eranikus."] = "團隊事件：跟隨{npc:11832}向{area:2361}走，在伊蘭尼庫斯和他的夢魘小怪攻擊下保住他，直到泰蘭德趕到並救贖伊蘭尼庫斯。不要殺死伊蘭尼庫斯。",
		["After The Path, Baristolth takes 200 more fragments for {quest:8302}: 200 reputation, again and again, but only until Neutral. From Hated 500 that is 208 turn-ins, 41,600 fragments, 20,000 to 30,000 elite kills: the only way without the Temple, and a very long one. With the {area:16076} open (a 40-player raid) it is far quicker: every Temple trash mob gives 100 until 2,999 of 3,000 Neutral, about 9,500 a full clear, so four to five clears reach Neutral. Save every {item:21230} and {item:21229} you loot until the trash stops counting: they pay the same later."] = "完成 正義之路 後，流沙守望者巴里斯托爾斯會再收200塊碎片來完成 {quest:8302}：每次200聲望，可反覆交還，但只能到中立。從仇恨500開始，需要交還208次、41,600塊碎片，約擊殺20,000至30,000只精英：這是不打神殿的唯一方式，而且非常漫長。{area:16076} 開放後（40人團隊副本）會快得多：神殿每隻小怪提供100聲望，直到中立2,999/3,000為止，完整清理一次約得9,500，因此四到五次即可達到中立。在小怪不再提供聲望之前，保留所有拾取到的 {item:21230} 和 {item:21229}：以後交還的收益相同。",
		["At Exalted, {npc:15192} gives the last ring of your path: The Protector of Kalimdor, The Qiraji Conqueror or The Grand Invoker. Bring the Revered ring; 100 reputation."] = "崇拜時，{npc:15192}會給你所選路徑的最後一枚戒指：卡利姆多保護者、其拉征服者或大祈求者。帶上崇敬戒指；100聲望。",
		["At Friendly, {npc:15192} upgrades the ring of the path you chose: The Path of the Protector, Conqueror or Invoker. Bring the ring you wear; 100 reputation."] = "友善時，{npc:15192}會升級你所選路徑的戒指：保護者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路。帶上你佩戴的戒指；100聲望。",
		["At Honored, {npc:15192} upgrades the ring of the path you chose: The Path of the Protector, Conqueror or Invoker. Bring the ring you wear; 100 reputation."] = "尊敬時，{npc:15192}會升級你所選路徑的戒指：保護者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路。帶上你佩戴的戒指；100聲望。",
		["At Revered, {npc:15192} upgrades the ring of the path you chose: The Path of the Protector, Conqueror or Invoker. Bring the ring you wear; 100 reputation."] = "崇敬時，{npc:15192}會升級你所選路徑的戒指：保護者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路。帶上你佩戴的戒指；100聲望。",
		["Back to Baristolth"] = "回到巴里斯托爾斯",
		["Back to {npc:11811}"] = "回到{npc:11811}",
		["Baristolth in {area:3425}"] = "巴里斯托爾斯在{area:3425}",
		["Brood of Nozdormu Reputation"] = "諾茲多姆的子嗣聲望",
		["Friendly to Honored: the turn-ins"] = "友善到尊敬：交付",
		["Hated to Neutral"] = "仇恨到中立",
		["Honored to Revered"] = "尊敬到崇敬",
		["Honored to Revered is 12,000: twelve artifacts, 24 insignias, or a mix with {npc:15727} (2,500). After the first, each insignia is the repeatable {quest:8595}. Every Temple boss sometimes drops an {quest:8789} or Regalia (about one time in twenty): {npc:15380} and {npc:15378}, inside the Temple once {npc:15727} is dead, take it with 3 {item:18562} for 200 and a weapon. Honored opens the chest exchange of the tier set (200)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12,000：十二件神器、24枚徽記，或用{npc:15727}（2,500）混搭。第一枚之後，每枚徽記都靠可重複的{quest:8595}。神廟每個首領偶爾會掉落{quest:8789}或徽飾（約二十分之一）：{npc:15727}死後，神廟內的{npc:15380}和{npc:15378}會收下它，外加3個{item:18562}，給200聲望和一件武器。尊敬解鎖套裝胸甲兌換（200）。",
		["Meet {npc:15192}"] = "與{npc:15192}見面",
		["Neutral opens the rest of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands chain. Baristolth sends you back to {quest:8303}."] = "中立會開啟流沙節杖任務的後續。巴里斯托爾斯會把你送回{quest:8303}。",
		["Neutral to Friendly in the Temple"] = "在神廟內從中立到友善",
		["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 reputation. Every trash mob of the {area:16076} (a 40-player raid behind the {area:2737}) gives 100, and the Twin Emperors 210 each, until 2,999 of 3,000 Neutral, one point short of Friendly; there they stop. Then hand in one saved {item:21230} (1,000, to {npc:15502}) or {item:21229} (500, to {npc:15503}) to tip you over. The shoulder and boot exchanges of the Temple's tier set need no standing: the token, two idols and ten scarabs to {npc:15502} (shoulders) or {npc:15503} (boots) pay 200 each. The {area:3454} (20 players) give a little from bosses: Kurinnaxx, Moam, Buru and Ayamiss 50 each, Rajaxx 34, Ossirian 100, to Exalted."] = "中立到友善需要3,000聲望。{area:16076}（{area:2737}後面的40人團隊副本）的每個小怪給100，雙子皇帝各給210，直到中立2,999/3,000——離友善還差一點；到那裡就停止了。然後交一塊留存的{item:21230}（1,000，給{npc:15502}）或{item:21229}（500，給{npc:15503}）把你頂過去。神廟套裝的護肩和靴子兌換不需要聲望：把徽記、兩個神像和十個甲蟲交給{npc:15502}（護肩）或{npc:15503}（靴子），各得200。{area:3454}（20人）的首領也給一些：庫林納克斯、莫阿姆、布魯和阿亞米斯各50，拉賈克斯34，奧西里安100，直到崇拜。",
		["Now hand in what you saved. Each {item:21230} (any Temple trash, 1% to 9%) starts {quest:8784}: 1,000 reputation from {npc:15502}, one of the three bronze dragons inside the Temple. Each {item:21229} (nearly every Temple boss) goes to {npc:15503} for {quest:8595}: 500 here and 100 Cenarion Circle. {npc:15727} gives 2,500, to Exalted. Friendly to Honored is 6,000: six artifacts or twelve insignias. Friendly also opens the helm and leg exchanges of the Temple's tier set (200 reputation each) at {npc:15502} and {npc:15503}."] = "現在把攢下的交出去。每塊{item:21230}（神廟任何小怪，1%到9%）會開啟{quest:8784}：交給神廟內三條青銅龍之一的{npc:15502}，得1,000聲望。每個{item:21229}（幾乎每個神廟首領）交給{npc:15503}完成{quest:8595}：這裡得500，另加100塞納里奧議會。{npc:15727}給2,500，直到崇拜。友善到尊敬需要6,000：六件神器或十二枚徽記。友善還會在{npc:15502}和{npc:15503}處解鎖神廟套裝的頭盔和腿甲兌換（各200聲望）。",
		["Pick one: The Path of the Protector, the Conqueror or the Invoker, 100"] = "三選一：保護者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路，100",
		["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 21 artifacts or 42 insignias, with {npc:15727}'s 2,500 a week. {npc:15727}'s eye starts {quest:8801} for {npc:15379} (200, and 200 Cenarion Circle). At Exalted Anachronos gives the last ring: The Protector of Kalimdor, The Qiraji Conqueror or The Grand Invoker."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21,000：21件神器或42枚徽記，外加{npc:15727}每週2,500。{npc:15727}之眼會為{npc:15379}開啟{quest:8801}（200，另加200塞納里奧議會）。崇拜時，阿納克洛斯會給最後一枚戒指：卡利姆多保護者、其拉征服者或大祈求者。",
		["Stewvul's crate"] = "斯圖沃的箱子",
		["The Bronze Dragonflight's ring, upgraded at every standing; a long climb from Hated, mostly in raids."] = "青銅龍軍團的戒指，每提升一級聲望即可升級；從仇恨開始的漫長攀升，主要靠團隊副本。",
		["The Exalted ring"] = "崇拜戒指",
		["The Redemption of Eranikus: raid"] = "伊蘭尼庫斯的救贖：團隊副本",
		["The blue shard: Azuregos's ledger"] = "藍色碎片：艾索雷葛斯的賬本",
		["The four dream portals sit in groves guarded by elite dragonkin of level 60 to 62 that respawn every 30 minutes; each drops the portal's fragment one time in twenty. Raid content."] = "四條夢境傳送門位於樹林中，由60到62級的精英龍人守衛，每30分鐘重生；每個約二十分之一機率掉落該傳送門的碎片。團隊副本內容。",
		["The green shard: Eranikus"] = "綠色碎片：伊蘭尼庫斯",
		["The island off {area:987}"] = "{area:987}外的島嶼",
		["The red shard: Vaelastrasz"] = "紅色碎片：瓦拉斯塔茲",
		["The red shard: {npc:13020}, the second boss of {area:2677}, gives {quest:8730} before his fight; Nefarian, the last boss, drops the {item:21138} for one raider on the quest each kill. The quest lasts five hours."] = "紅色碎片：{area:2677}的二號首領{npc:13020}會在戰鬥前給{quest:8730}；最終首領奈法利安每次擊殺會為一名接了任務的團隊成員掉落{item:21138}。任務持續五小時。",
		["The ring at Friendly"] = "友善戒指",
		["The ring at Honored"] = "尊敬戒指",
		["The ring at Revered"] = "崇敬戒指",
		["The {area:1121}"] = "那個{area:1121}",
		["The {faction:910} is not in your reputation list until you meet {npc:15192}. {npc:15180}, in the main building of {area:3425}, sends you to him. Meeting him sets you at Hated, 0 of 36,000: Neutral is 42,000 reputation away, and almost all of it comes from raids. {area:2677} and the {area:16076} are not among the first raids Blizzard has announced for Forever: until one of them opens, the 100 from Baristolth's first quest is all the Brood reputation there is. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers in this guide are without it."] = "在你見到{npc:15192}之前，{faction:910}不會出現在你的聲望列表裡。{area:3425}主建築裡的{npc:15180}會派你去找他。見到他後你會被設為仇恨，0/36,000：到中立還差42,000聲望，而且幾乎全靠團隊副本。{area:2677}和{area:16076}並不在暴雪公佈的首批Forever團隊副本之列：在其中一個開放之前，巴里斯托爾斯第一個任務給的100聲望就是子嗣聲望的全部來源。傳承特長“外交家”可為每次聲望獲取最多加10%；本指南的數字不含它。",
		["The {npc:15481} stands on the south coast of {zone:1447}. His ledger starts {npc:11811}'s long chain in {zone:1446}."] = "{npc:15481}站在{zone:1447}的南海岸。他的賬本會在{zone:1446}開啟{npc:11811}的長任務鏈。",
		["The {npc:15624}"] = "這位{npc:15624}",
		["The {npc:15625} (level 63 boss) always drops its fragment."] = "這位{npc:15625}（63級首領）必定掉落它的碎片。",
		["The {object:180633}"] = "那個{object:180633}",
		["The {object:180633} is a small red crystal on the ground just outside the gates of {area:3428}, in the far south-west of {zone:1451}. Click it, then stay and watch the vision of the War of the Shifting Sands to its end. If it is cut short, abandon the quest and click the Tear again."] = "{object:180633}是一小塊紅色水晶，就在{area:3428}大門外的地上，位於{zone:1451}最西南。點選它，然後留在這裡，把流沙之戰的幻象看完。如果中途被打斷，放棄任務再點一次淚珠。",
		["The {object:180642} leans on the {area:230} at the south end of {zone:1421}, left of the closed gate."] = "{object:180642}靠在{zone:1421}南端的{area:230}上，在關閉的大門左側。",
		["The {object:180652} lies on the farther of two islands south of {area:987}, past the fatigue line. {npc:15526}, on the sea floor south of the beach's crashed gyrocopter, gives {quest:8599} and a three-minute swim-speed blessing that gets you across."] = "{object:180652}位於{area:987}以南兩座島中較遠的那座，已過疲勞線。海灘墜毀旋翼機以南的海底有{npc:15526}，他會給{quest:8599}和一個三分鐘的游泳加速祝福，助你渡海。",
		["The {zone:1431} portal"] = "{zone:1431}傳送門",
		["The {zone:1440} portal"] = "{zone:1440}傳送門",
		["The {zone:1444} portal"] = "{zone:1444}傳送門",
		["Watch the vision"] = "觀看幻象",
		["With the three shards, {npc:15192} makes the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. In Classic its first holder rings the {object:180717} once for the whole realm, opening the gates of {area:3428}, and those who finish within ten hours earn the black qiraji crystal mount; whether Forever's realms get that event is not known."] = "集齊三塊碎片後，{npc:15192}會打造流沙節杖。在經典舊世，第一個持有者敲響{object:180717}，全服僅此一次，開啟{area:3428}的大門，十小時內完成的人可獲得黑色其拉水晶坐騎；Forever的伺服器是否會有這個事件尚不清楚。",
		["{area:2677} is a 40-player raid at the top of {area:254}. {npc:12017} always drops his head."] = "{area:2677}是{area:254}頂部的40人團隊副本。{npc:12017}必定掉落他的頭顱。",
		["{item:12360}: Alchemists, or the auction house"] = "{item:12360}：鍊金師，或拍賣行",
		["{item:18562}, {area:2677} or the auction house"] = "{item:18562}，{area:2677}或拍賣行",
		["{item:18562}: {area:2677}, or the auction house"] = "{item:18562}：{area:2677}，或拍賣行",
		["{item:20383}: raid of 40"] = "{item:20383}：40人團隊副本",
		["{item:21027}, {npc:12803}: raid"] = "{item:21027}、{npc:12803}：團隊副本",
		["{item:21137}, {npc:15571}: raid"] = "{item:21137}、{npc:15571}：團隊副本",
		["{item:21138}, Nefarian"] = "{item:21138}，奈法利安",
		["{item:21175} quest chain"] = "{item:21175}任務線",
		["{item:21229}, Temple bosses"] = "{item:21229}，神廟首領",
		["{item:21230}: right-click it, then {npc:15502}"] = "{item:21230}：右鍵點選它，然後找{npc:15502}",
		["{npc:11811}, a goblin seer, lives in a hut north-east of {area:976}. He sends you three ways at once: to Stewvul's crate in {zone:1421}, to an island off the south coast of {zone:1446}, and to {npc:8125} in {area:976}."] = "{npc:11811}是個哥布林先知，住在{area:976}東北的一座小屋裡。他一次派你走三條路：去{zone:1421}斯圖沃的箱子、去{zone:1446}南海岸外的島嶼，以及去{area:976}的{npc:8125}。",
		["{npc:12803} and the Chimaerok on the {area:1121} are elites of level 60 to 62 that respawn every ten minutes: a raid's work. The Chimaerok drop a tenderloin about half the time, Lakmaeran two to four now and then."] = "{npc:12803}和{area:1121}上的奇美洛克是60到62級精英，每十分鐘重生：這是團隊副本的活。奇美洛克約半數掉落裡脊肉，拉克麥拉則偶爾掉兩到四塊。",
		["{npc:13020}, {area:2677}: raid of 40"] = "{npc:13020}，{area:2677}：40人團隊副本",
		["{npc:15192} at the {area:2300}"] = "{npc:15192}在{area:2300}",
		["{npc:15192} now offers the {item:21200} in three kinds: the Path of the Protector (tanks), of the Conqueror (melee fighters) or of the Invoker (casters). Take one: the other two close. Each standing from Friendly to Exalted brings an upgrade of the same ring, 100 reputation each. {quest:8555} sends you after the three shards of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands."] = "{npc:15192}現在提供三種{item:21200}：保護者之路（坦克）、征服者之路（近戰）或祈求者之路（施法者）。選一種：另外兩種就會關閉。從友善到崇拜，每個聲望等級都會帶來同一枚戒指的升級，各需100聲望。{quest:8555}會派你去尋找流沙節杖的三塊碎片。",
		["{npc:15192}, a bronze dragon in elf form, stands at the mouth of the {area:2300} in eastern {zone:1446}, south-east of {area:976}. Walk up to him."] = "{npc:15192}是一條化為人形的青銅龍，站在{zone:1446}東部{area:2300}的入口，位於{area:976}東南。走到他跟前。",
		["{npc:15192}: the Exalted ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你路徑的崇拜戒指任務",
		["{npc:15192}: the Friendly ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你路徑的友善戒指任務",
		["{npc:15192}: the Honored ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你路徑的尊敬戒指任務",
		["{npc:15192}: the Revered ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你路徑的崇敬戒指任務",
		["{npc:15362} appears beside the {npc:5709} at the bottom of the {area:1477} (a five-player dungeon). He sends you to a {npc:15624} outside {zone:1457} (Horde players walk past the city's guards), then to {npc:11832} in {zone:1450}."] = "{npc:15362} 出現在 {area:1477}（五人地下城）底部的 {npc:5709} 旁。他會讓你去找 {zone:1457} 外的一名 {npc:15624}（部落玩家需從城市守衛旁走過），再去找 {zone:1450} 的 {npc:11832}。",
		["{npc:15362}, inside the {area:1477}"] = "{npc:15362}，在{area:1477}內",
		["{npc:15378}: Regalia and 3 {item:18562}, 200"] = "{npc:15378}：徽飾和3個{item:18562}，200",
		["{npc:15380}: Armaments and 3 {item:18562}, 200"] = "{npc:15380}：軍械和3個{item:18562}，200",
		["{npc:15503}: 500, handed in from his window"] = "{npc:15503}：500，在他的視窗中直接繳交",
		["{npc:15554}, elite: group of 3 to 5"] = "{npc:15554}，精英：3到5人隊伍",
		["{npc:15624}: 25 (and 25 Cenarion Circle)"] = "{npc:15624}：25（另加25塞納里奧議會）",
		["{npc:8125} cooks in {area:976}. He sends you to the {area:1121} off southern {zone:1444} for a Chimaerok feast."] = "{npc:8125}在{area:976}做飯。他會派你去{zone:1444}南部外海的{area:1121}赴一場奇美洛克盛宴。",
		["{npc:8125} wants 20 {item:9061} and 20 {item:8150} with the meat. {npc:11811} then wants 20 Arcanite Bars, 10 {item:18562}, 10 Azerothian Diamonds and 10 Blue Sapphires, and gives you an {item:21136}: placed at the {object:180669} in {zone:1447}'s {area:1227}, it calls up {npc:15571}, a level 63 boss for a raid. {npc:15571} drops the {item:21137} for one raider on the quest each kill."] = "{npc:8125}要在肉之外再加20個{item:9061}和20個{item:8150}。隨後{npc:11811}要20塊奧金錠、10個{item:18562}、10顆艾澤拉斯鑽石和10顆藍寶石，並給你一個{item:21136}：把它放在{zone:1447}{area:1227}的{object:180669}處，會召喚{npc:15571}，一個63級的團隊副本首領。{npc:15571}每次擊殺會為一名接了任務的團隊成員掉落{item:21137}。",
		["{npc:8125}'s Chops"] = "{npc:8125}的肉排",
		["{object:180717} hangs before the gates of {area:3428}. {npc:15693} appears beside it once the gong has been rung, with {quest:8745}: a weapon and 200 reputation."] = "{object:180717}懸掛在{area:3428}的大門前。銅鑼敲響後，{npc:15693}會出現在它旁邊，帶著{quest:8745}：一件武器和200聲望。",
		["{quest:8288} wants the head of {npc:12017}, the third boss of {area:2677} (a 40-player raid in {area:254}). Everything after it needs the head, the fragment turn-ins included: until you have it, {quest:8286} is all the Brood reputation there is, solo or not."] = "{quest:8288}要{npc:12017}的頭顱，他是{area:2677}（{area:254}裡的40人團隊副本）的三號首領。之後的一切都需要這顆頭顱，包括碎片交付：在拿到它之前，{quest:8286}就是子嗣聲望的全部來源，無論單刷與否。",
		["{quest:8301} wants 200 Silithid Carapace Fragments. Every hive silithid drops one to three on most kills: the Hive'Ashi Workers, Stingers, Swarmers and Defenders north and north-west of {area:3425}, and those of {area:2743} in the west and {area:2744} in the south. Almost all of them are elites of level 57 to 60: one at a time solo, faster in a group."] = "{quest:8301}要200塊異種蠍殼碎片。每個蟲巢的異種蠍多數擊殺都會掉一到三塊：{area:3425}以北和西北的亞什蟲巢工蜂、刺蟲、群居者和守衛，以及西面{area:2743}和南面{area:2744}的那些。它們幾乎都是57到60級精英：單刷一次一隻，組隊更快。",
		["{quest:8302}: 200 fragments, 200"] = "{quest:8302}：200塊碎片，200",
		["{quest:8303}'s quests"] = "{quest:8303}的任務",
		["{quest:8595}: 1 insignia, 500"] = "{quest:8595}：1枚徽記，500",
		["{quest:8597}, Volume II"] = "{quest:8597}，第二卷",
		["{quest:8597}: Volume II"] = "{quest:8597}：第二卷",
		["{quest:8606} sends you, disguised with {npc:11811}'s turban, to a drop-off point south of {area:2255} in {zone:1452}. Leave the bag of gold there: {npc:15554}, a level 61 elite, comes for it (group of 3 to 5)."] = "{quest:8606}會讓你戴上{npc:11811}的頭巾偽裝，前往{zone:1452}中{area:2255}以南的交貨點。把金幣袋放在那裡：61級精英{npc:15554}會來取（3到5人隊伍）。",
		["{quest:8620} needs the eight chapters of {quest:8597}, Volume II: from {npc:15552} in his house on {area:2079} (a level 63 elite with guards, raid), the Felguard Elites, Doomguard Commanders and Dreadlords of the {zone:1419}, the Hederine south of {area:2255}, and a book in the {zone:1458}. {npc:11811} hands out the binding when you accept."] = "{quest:8620}需要{quest:8597}第二卷的八個章節：來自{area:2079}他房子裡的{npc:15552}（63級精英，帶守衛，需團隊）、{zone:1419}的惡魔衛士精英、末日守衛指揮官和恐懼魔王、{area:2255}以南的赫達林，以及{zone:1458}的一本書。接受任務時{npc:11811}會給你裝訂本。",
		["{quest:8735} wants a fragment from each of the four {npc:235289} portals: elite dragonkin at the {zone:1440}, {zone:1444} and {zone:1425} portals (5% each) and the {npc:15625} in {zone:1431}. Raid content."] = "{quest:8735} 需要從四座{npc:235289}傳送門各獲得一塊碎片：{zone:1440}、{zone:1444} 和 {zone:1425} 傳送門處的精英龍人（各5%），以及 {zone:1431} 的 {npc:15625}。這是團隊內容。",
		["{zone:1425} portal"] = "{zone:1425}傳送門",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/cenarion-circle"] = (function() return {
		["10 texts: 100"] = "10份文字：100",
		["3 crests and a {item:14344}: the Medallion of Station"] = "3枚紋章和一塊{item:14344}：身份勳章",
		["3 signets and 5 Large Brilliant Shards: the Ring of Lordship"] = "3枚印戒和5塊大塊魔光碎片：領主之戒",
		["3 {quest:8363}: 100, Honored"] = "3個{quest:8363}：100，尊敬",
		["3 {quest:8364}: 150, Revered"] = "3個{quest:8364}：150，崇敬",
		["A 20-player raid behind the {area:2737} in the far south-west of {zone:1451}. A full clear is about 1,600 Cenarion reputation: the trash 3 each until 20,999 of 21,000 Revered, Kurinnaxx, Moam, Buru and Ayamiss 150 each and Ossirian 300, to Exalted. Ossirian's head starts {quest:8791} (200 here and 200 {npc:15185}). Their drops buy the ring (Honored), cloak (Revered) and weapon (Exalted) quests of {npc:15498}, {npc:15500} and {npc:15499} in the Hold, 100 reputation each. {npc:16091} in the Hold pays 100 once for {quest:9023}: {item:22217} from here and Venoxis's from {area:19}. {npc:15471} sells {item:22219} (Revered, 5g) and {item:22191} (Exalted, 8g) inside."] = "位於{zone:1451}最西南{area:2737}之後的20人團隊副本。全通約1,600點塞納里奧聲望：小怪每隻3點，直到崇敬的20,999/21,000；庫林納克斯、莫阿姆、布魯和阿亞米斯各150點，奧西里安300點，直到崇拜。奧西里安的頭顱會開啟{quest:8791}（這裡200點，另加{npc:15185}的200點）。他們的掉落可以換取要塞裡{npc:15498}、{npc:15500}和{npc:15499}的戒指（尊敬）、披風（崇敬）和武器（崇拜）任務，各100點聲望。要塞的{npc:16091}為{quest:9023}一次性支付100點：這裡的{item:22217}和{area:19}溫諾希斯的物品。{npc:15471}在裡面出售{item:22219}（崇敬，5金）和{item:22191}（崇拜，8金）。",
		["Allegiance: one Combat, Logistics and Tactical badge, 200"] = "效忠：戰鬥、後勤和戰術徽章各一枚，200",
		["Around {area:3425}"] = "{area:3425}一帶",
		["Back at the Hold"] = "回到要塞",
		["Back to Ortell"] = "回到奧特爾",
		["Back to {area:3425}"] = "返回{area:3425}",
		["Back to {area:3425} with news"] = "帶著訊息回到{area:3425}",
		["Bronzebeard's Encampment"] = "銅鬚營地",
		["Cenarion Circle Reputation"] = "塞納里奧議會聲望",
		["Cultists until the top of Friendly, texts saved"] = "刷教徒直到友善滿，文字留著",
		["Do the {zone:1422} and {area:2100} quests while you level; at 60 they may pay a fraction."] = "升級時就做{zone:1422}和{area:2100}的任務；到60級時它們可能只給一小部分獎勵。",
		["Each Keeper is a level 60, not elite, alone at a camp edge, and always drops its chapter: Mayna in the far west camp, Havunth in the camp south-west of the Hold, Exeter in the far south-west camp beside the Twilight Lord."] = "每位守護者都是60級非精英，獨自守在營地邊緣，必定掉落它那一章：梅娜在最西邊的營地，哈文斯在要塞西南的營地，埃克塞特在最西南的營地、暮光領主旁邊。",
		["Forever's new {zone:1451} patterns for Tailors, Leatherworkers and Blacksmiths, Friendly and Honored"] = "Forever為裁縫、制皮和鍛造新增的{zone:1451}圖樣，友善和尊敬",
		["Friendly (3,000) opens Kania's {item:20732} (10g), Mishta's {item:22251} (2g) and {item:22758} (5g), and Forever's new Friendly gloves patterns (7g 50s)."] = "友善（3,000）解鎖卡尼亞的{item:20732}（10金）、米什塔的{item:22251}（2金）和{item:22758}（5金），以及Forever新增的友善手套圖樣（7金50銀）。",
		["Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation. {npc:15306} takes 10 {quest:8319} for 100 reputation, again and again, until Exalted: 120 turn-ins (1,200 texts) to Revered without the quests, or about 950 texts after them. Hand in the texts you saved now. The cultists no longer count, but the Flamereavers, Twilight Keepers, Marauders and Templars count until 11,999 of 12,000 Honored, and the {npc:14479} and Prophet until Exalted. Honored opens Kania's {item:20733} (10g), Mishta's {item:22773} (5g) and Forever's new Honored patterns (7g 50s each)."] = "從尊敬到崇敬需要12,000點聲望。{npc:15306}收10份{quest:8319}給100點聲望，可反覆交，直到崇拜：不做任務的話，到崇敬需要交120次（1,200份文字）；做完任務後約需950份文字。現在就把留著的文字交掉。教徒不再計入，但裂焰者、暮光守護者、掠奪者和聖殿騎士計入，直到尊敬的11,999/12,000；{npc:14479}和先知計入到崇拜。尊敬解鎖卡尼亞的{item:20733}（10金）、米什塔的{item:22773}（5金）和Forever新增的尊敬圖樣（每份7金50銀）。",
		["Kills alone to the top of Friendly is 8,999 kills (6,999 for druids), but the texts they drop (about 3,000) are worth 30,000 more: most of the way to Exalted."] = "只靠擊殺刷到友善滿需要8,999次擊殺（德魯伊6,999次），但他們掉落的文字（約3,000份）還能再值30,000點：足夠走到崇拜的大部分路程。",
		["Larksbane"] = "拉克斯班",
		["Mistress Natalia"] = "納塔莉亞女士",
		["Mistress Natalia: group of 3 to 5"] = "納塔莉亞女士：3到5人隊伍",
		["Natalia, elite: group up"] = "納塔莉亞，精英：組隊",
		["Nature resistance enchants and patterns, badge gear and Forever's new {zone:1451} patterns, from {zone:1451}'s camps."] = "自然抗性附魔和圖樣、徽章裝備以及Forever新增的{zone:1451}圖樣，來自{zone:1451}的營地。",
		["Neutral to Honored is 9,000 reputation (7,000 for druids). Every {npc:11880}, Geolord, Stonecaller, Master and Overlord gives 1 reputation until 5,999 of 6,000 Friendly, one point short of Honored; there they stop. Save every {item:20404} and leave the quests of the next steps for later: each kill below that point is a free point on top of its text, and the texts and quests pay the same at any standing. A text drops about every third kill, so 30 kills make 30 reputation and 10 texts (100 reputation later). Four camps: south-west of the Hold (39,44), the far west (26,34), the far south-west (19,84) and the north-east below {area:2742} (66,18: Overlords, and Flamereavers that count until the top of Honored). The {npc:15308} (87% text) walks between 18,31 and 23,69. Texts sell on the auction house if you would rather buy. At 5,999 Friendly the last point into Honored comes from a Flamereaver, Twilight Keeper or Marauder, or from your first 10 texts at {npc:15306}."] = "從中立到尊敬需要9,000點聲望（德魯伊7,000點）。每個{npc:11880}、地質領主、喚石者、大師和霸主都給1點聲望，直到友善的5,999/6,000，離尊敬只差一點；到那裡他們就停止給聲望。把每份{item:20404}都留著，後續步驟的任務也留到以後做：在那一點之前的每次擊殺，除了文字之外還白得一點；而文字和任務在任何聲望等級都付同樣的點數。約每三次擊殺掉一份文字，所以30次擊殺可得30點聲望和10份文字（之後值100點）。四個營地：要塞西南（39,44）、最西邊（26,34）、最西南（19,84）和{area:2742}下方的東北（66,18：霸主，以及計入到尊敬滿的裂焰者）。{npc:15308}（87%掉文字）在18,31和23,69之間走動。如果你寧願花錢，文字在拍賣行有售。友善5,999時，進入尊敬的最後一點來自裂焰者、暮光守護者或掠奪者，或者在{npc:15306}處交最初10份文字。",
		["Now cash in the one-time quests: about 1,700 reputation alone, 2,400 with the group quests. They are level 55 to 60, so they pay in full at 60. {quest:8280} needs {quest:8275} first. {npc:15196} is an elite scorpid with two guards (group of 2 or 3). {npc:15174}'s {quest:8307} is for Cooks: its recipe makes the {item:20452} he wants. {npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "現在去完成一次性任務：單人任務約1,700聲望，加上小隊任務共2,400。這些任務為55到60級，所以60級時能拿到全額聲望。{quest:8280}需要先完成{quest:8275}。{npc:15196}是一隻精英蠍子，帶兩個護衛（需2到3人小隊）。{npc:15174}的{quest:8307}是給烹飪者的：其配方可做出他要的{item:20452}。{npc:15189}站在他所在建築的樓上：從室內上樓，箭頭無法區分樓層。",
		["Optional, and needed only for the Dredge quests later: {npc:15187} sends you to {zone:1451} with {quest:8275}, a 10-reputation letter. Skip it if you are already in {zone:1451}."] = "可選，只有後續的挖掘任務才需要：{npc:15187}讓你帶著{quest:8275}去{zone:1451}，那是一封值10點聲望的信。如果你已經在{zone:1451}，就跳過。",
		["Optional, and needed only for the Dredge quests later: {npc:15188} sends you to {zone:1451} with {quest:8276}, a 10-reputation letter. Skip it if you are already in {zone:1451}."] = "可選，只有後續的挖掘任務才需要：{npc:15188}讓你帶著{quest:8276}去{zone:1451}，那是一封值10點聲望的信。如果你已經在{zone:1451}，就跳過。",
		["Optional, for {quest:9023}: {npc:14507} is the first boss of {area:19}, a 20-player raid in north-east {zone:1434}."] = "可選，為{quest:9023}：{npc:14507}是{area:19}的第一個首領，那是{zone:1434}東北的20人團隊副本。",
		["Optional: Natalia waits deep in {area:2744}, the hive in the south of {zone:1451}. She is a level 62 elite who mind-controls, fears and heals herself below half health: bring a group of 3 to 5 and interrupt her heals."] = "可選：納塔莉亞等在{area:2744}深處，那是{zone:1451}南部的蟲巢。她是62級精英，會精神控制、恐懼，並在血量低於一半時自愈：帶3到5人隊伍，打斷她的治療。",
		["Optional: {quest:1123}'s chain pays 525 Cenarion reputation over seven quests of level 55 to 57, full at 60. {npc:10881} sends you to {npc:5769} on {area:1639}, who sends you to {quest:1123} in {area:2361}, {zone:1450}."] = "可選：{quest:1123}的任務鏈在七個55到57級任務中共給525點塞納里奧聲望，60級時給全額。{npc:10881}讓你去{area:1639}的{npc:5769}那裡，後者再讓你去{zone:1450}的{area:2361}找{quest:1123}。",
		["Optional: {quest:6762}'s chain pays 525 Cenarion reputation over seven quests of level 55 to 57, full at 60. {npc:10878} sends you to {npc:3516}, who sends you to {npc:4217}, who sends you to {quest:6762} in {area:2361}, {zone:1450}."] = "可選：{quest:6762}的任務鏈在七個55到57級任務中共給525點塞納里奧聲望，60級時給全額。{npc:10878}讓你去{npc:3516}那裡，後者讓你去{npc:4217}那裡，再讓你去{zone:1450}的{area:2361}找{quest:6762}。",
		["Quests elsewhere"] = "其他地區的任務",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 210 text turn-ins (2,100 texts), or less with the rest. From Honored, Bor takes 3 {quest:8363} for 100 (each Duke also gives 25, to Exalted), and {npc:15282} takes one {item:20515} for {quest:9248} (200, once). From Revered, {quest:8343} leads to {quest:8341}: 3 signets and 5 Large Brilliant Shards buy the Ring of Lordship, and set, medallion and ring open the {object:180466} for an Abyssal Lord: a level 63 boss for a raid of about 20, 50 reputation, and an {item:20515}. Bor pays 200 for the first scepter and 150 for each 3 after. Revered opens Mishta's {item:22252} (5g), {item:22660} (9g) and {item:22756} (5g); Exalted is the standing for Champion's Battlegear at {npc:15176}."] = "從崇敬到崇拜需要21,000點聲望：交210次文字（2,100份），加上其他途徑會更少。從尊敬起，博爾收3個{quest:8363}給100點（每個公爵也給25點，直到崇拜），{npc:15282}收一個{item:20515}用於{quest:9248}（200點，一次）。從崇敬起，{quest:8343}會引向{quest:8341}：3枚印戒和5塊大塊魔光碎片可換領主之戒，而套裝、勳章和戒指能開啟{object:180466}，召喚一位深淵領主：63級首領，約20人團隊，50點聲望，外加一個{item:20515}。博爾為第一根權杖付200點，之後每3根付150點。崇敬解鎖米什塔的{item:22252}（5金）、{item:22660}（9金）和{item:22756}（5金）；崇拜是{npc:15176}處冠軍戰鬥裝備所需的聲望。",
		["Rubbings and brains"] = "拓片與大腦",
		["Rutgar and Frankal hand out the next two quests at their camp. Each hive has a {object:210337} to rub with the {item:20453}, and its silithid drop the brains: {area:2742} north of the Hold, {area:2743} in the west, {area:2744} in the south. Inside {area:2744} waits Mistress Natalia (level 62 elite, mind control and fear; group of 3 to 5). Now and then a hive silithid drops {quest:8308}: it starts a quest for Rutgar worth 100."] = "魯特加和弗蘭卡爾在他們的營地發放接下來的兩個任務。每個蟲巢都有一個{object:210337}，可用{item:20453}拓印，而蟲巢的異種蠍會掉落大腦：要塞以北的{area:2742}、西邊的{area:2743}、南邊的{area:2744}。{area:2744}深處有納塔莉亞女士（62級精英，精神控制和恐懼；3到5人隊伍）。蟲巢異種蠍偶爾會掉落{quest:8308}：它會開啟一個給魯特加的任務，值100點。",
		["Signets and scepters to Exalted"] = "印戒與權杖：到崇拜",
		["Stonelash Flayers, Pincers and Rock Stalkers live south and south-west of the Hold; their stingers and fangs drop about one time in ten. Dredge Crushers dig south and west of the Hold."] = "石鞭撕掠者、石鞭鉗蟲和岩石潛伏者住在要塞以南和西南；它們的毒刺和獠牙約十次擊殺掉一個。挖掘粉碎者在要塞以南和以西挖掘。",
		["Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers roam the sands around the Hold; Dredge Strikers dig north-east of it. The {object:180503} lies in the cultist camp south-west of the Hold."] = "石鞭蠍和沙地疾行者在要塞周圍的沙地上游蕩；挖掘打擊者在要塞東北挖掘。{object:180503}在要塞西南的教徒營地裡。",
		["Stonelash and Dredge Crushers"] = "石鞭蠍與挖掘粉碎者",
		["Templars and the Abyssal Council"] = "聖殿騎士與深淵議會",
		["The Tortured Druids and Sentinels roam the ruins of {area:2738}, south-east of {area:3425}; the {object:178553} sits on the top floor of its wasp-circled tower."] = "受折磨的德魯伊和哨兵在{area:2738}的廢墟中游蕩，位於{area:3425}東南；{object:178553}在它那座被黃蜂環繞的塔頂。",
		["The broken camp in the far north-west of {zone:1451}: the Twilight Tablet Fragments lie on the ground among the ruins."] = "{zone:1451}最西北的破敗營地：暮光石板碎片散落在廢墟之間的地上。",
		["The cultist camp west of {area:3425}"] = "{area:3425}以西的教徒營地",
		["The dwarves' camp in the south of {zone:1451}. Talk {npc:15171} and {npc:15170} through their whole stories for {quest:8304}. {item:20379} lies on the mountain south-east of the camp. {npc:15196} lives up the trail east of the camp: an elite, and his {spell:10101} can throw you off the cliff."] = "矮人營地在{zone:1451}南部。把{npc:15171}和{npc:15170}的完整故事聽完，可獲得{quest:8304}。{item:20379}在營地東南的山上。{npc:15196}住在營地以東的小路上：他是精英，他的{spell:10101}能把你打下懸崖。",
		["The emissary in {zone:1454}"] = "{zone:1454}的特使",
		["The emissary in {zone:1455}"] = "{zone:1455}的特使",
		["The nearest Twilight's Hammer camp lies just south-west of the Hold. Avengers, Geolords and Stonecallers (level 57 to 59) each drop an {item:20404} about a third of the time, and every cultist kill is 1 reputation. {npc:11804} walks the edge of the camp. Keep every cultist robe, cowl and mantle you loot: they are the Twilight Trappings for the Wind Stones later."] = "最近的暮光之錘營地就在要塞西南。復仇者、地質領主和喚石者（57到59級）各約三分之一機率掉落一份{item:20404}，而每殺一個教徒得1點聲望。{npc:11804}在營地邊緣走動。拾到的每一件教徒長袍、頭巾和披肩都留著：它們就是之後風石所需的暮光裝束。",
		["The three Twilight Keepers"] = "三位暮光守護者",
		["The {area:3100}"] = "{area:3100}",
		["The {area:3454}, when they open"] = "{area:3454}，開放後",
		["The {faction:609}'s other quests are spread over {zone:1414} and the Plaguelands. Forever pays them in full at any level: The Wildlife Suffers Too ({npc:10739}, {zone:1422}, levels 54 and 56) 75 and 75, Corruption of Earth and Seed ({area:2100}, level 51) 150. Shards of the Felvine ({quest:1123}, level 60, the {item:18501} from Alzzin in {area:2577}) pays 150 and its Reliquary 100 at any level."] = "{faction:609}的其他任務分佈在{zone:1414}和瘟疫之地。Forever 裡任何等級都足額給分：《野生動物也受苦》（{npc:10739}，{zone:1422}，54級和56級）75和75，《大地與種子的腐化》（{area:2100}，51級）150。《惡魔藤蔓的碎片》（{quest:1123}，60級，{item:18501}來自{area:2577}的阿茲辛）給150，它的聖物箱任務任何等級再給100。",
		["Wanted poster: {npc:15196}, elite"] = "通緝令：{npc:15196}，精英",
		["Wearing a full set of Twilight Trappings (cultist Cowl, Mantle and Robe, about 8%, 8% and 6% per cultist) lets you use a {object:180456}: two stand in each of the three western camps. A random Abyssal Templar appears: a level 60 elite for 1 to 3 players, 5 reputation until the top of Honored and an {item:20513} 93% of the time. The summon uses up the set (and later the medallion and ring too), and if the elemental gets away they are gone: summon only when you can win. {quest:8361} pays 100 for the first crest; after that Bor takes 3 crests for 50. From Friendly, {npc:15270} sends you to {quest:8331}: 3 crests and a {item:14344} buy the Medallion of Station that, worn with a set, opens the larger {object:180461} for a Duke (level 62 elite, group of 5; 25 reputation, {item:20514} 85%)."] = "穿齊一套暮光裝束（教徒的頭巾、披肩和長袍，每隻教徒約8%、8%和6%）就能使用{object:180456}：三個西部營地各立著兩個。會隨機出現一位深淵聖殿騎士：60級精英，適合1到3名玩家，給5點聲望直到尊敬滿，並且93%機率掉落{item:20513}。召喚會消耗整套裝束（之後還要消耗勳章和戒指），而且如果元素逃掉，它們就沒了：只在有把握取勝時才召喚。{quest:8361}為第一枚紋章給100點；之後博爾收3枚紋章給50點。從友善起，{npc:15270}會讓你去接{quest:8331}：3枚紋章和一塊{item:14344}可換身份勳章；它與套裝一起穿戴時，能開啟更大的{object:180461}，召喚一位公爵（62級精英，5人隊伍；25點聲望，85%機率掉{item:20514}）。",
		["raid of 20"] = "20人團隊",
		["{area:3425} is the walled druid camp in north-central {zone:1451}, with flight points for both sides. Everyone starts Neutral with the {faction:609} (druids at 2,000 of 3,000). Bor and {npc:15270} stand together in the main building. {quest:8318} opens the {item:20404} turn-ins for good. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers in this guide are without it."] = "{area:3425}是{zone:1451}中北部有圍牆的德魯伊營地，兩陣營都有飛行點。所有人對{faction:609}都從中立起步（德魯伊為3,000中的2,000）。博爾和{npc:15270}一起站在主建築裡。{quest:8318}會永久開放{item:20404}的交納。傳承特長“外交家”可使每次獲取量最多提高10%；本指南中的數字不含它。",
		["{item:20385}, elite: group of 2 or 3"] = "{item:20385}，精英：2或3人隊伍",
		["{item:20404}: save them"] = "{item:20404}：留著",
		["{item:20452}, from the {object:180503}"] = "{item:20452}，來自{object:180503}",
		["{item:20452}, from {item:20424} and {item:3713}"] = "{item:20452}，來自{item:20424}和{item:3713}",
		["{item:20456}, deep in {area:2744}"] = "{item:20456}，在{area:2744}深處",
		["{item:20465}, {npc:14862}: raid of 20"] = "{item:20465}，{npc:14862}：20人團隊",
		["{item:20513}: Templar, group of 1 to 3"] = "{item:20513}：聖殿騎士，1到3人隊伍",
		["{item:20514}: Duke, group of 5"] = "{item:20514}：公爵，5人隊伍",
		["{item:20515}: Lord, raid of 20"] = "{item:20515}：領主，20人團隊",
		["{item:22216}: raid of 20"] = "{item:22216}：20人團隊",
		["{npc:11939} in {area:2361}"] = "{area:2361}的{npc:11939}",
		["{npc:15171} and {npc:15170}"] = "{npc:15171}和{npc:15170}",
		["{npc:15174}, for Cooks"] = "{npc:15174}，給廚師",
		["{npc:15189} and {npc:15190} stand upstairs in their building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15189}和{npc:15190}站在他們所在建築的樓上：從室內上樓，箭頭無法區分樓層。",
		["{npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15189}站在他所在建築的樓上：從室內上樓，箭頭無法區分樓層。",
		["{npc:15190} and Proudhorn"] = "{npc:15190}和傲角",
		["{npc:15190} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15190}站在他所在建築的樓上：從室內上樓，箭頭無法區分樓層。",
		["{npc:15191}, after {quest:8275}"] = "{npc:15191}，完成{quest:8275}後",
		["{npc:15194} hides in the hills of eastern {zone:1451}. He also decodes {quest:8319} for a chance at a scroll of beckoning, but {quest:8349} pays the reputation: keep the texts for Bor."] = "{npc:15194}藏在{zone:1451}東部的山丘裡。他也能解讀{quest:8319}，有機會得到一張召喚卷軸，但{quest:8349}才給聲望：把文字留給博爾。",
		["{npc:15201}: still counts at 5,999 Friendly"] = "{npc:15201}：友善5,999時仍計入",
		["{npc:15270}, Friendly"] = "{npc:15270}，友善",
		["{npc:15270}, Revered"] = "{npc:15270}，崇敬",
		["{npc:15270}, level 60"] = "{npc:15270}，60級",
		["{npc:15306}: 10 texts, 100"] = "{npc:15306}：10份文字，100",
		["{npc:15306}: 10 texts, 100, for the last point"] = "{npc:15306}：10份文字，100，用於最後一點",
		["{npc:15540} stands by the moonwell of {area:3425}. {quest:8507} (25 reputation, repeatable) sends you with unsigned papers to your side's captain: {npc:15440}'s Ironforge Brigade outside {area:2743} (Alliance) or {npc:15612}'s Orgrimmar Legion outside {area:2744} (Horde). Use the papers first, then talk to the captain: a level 60 elite silithid attacks; keep the captain alive and he signs. Kaldon then lets you pick a Combat, Logistics or {item:20809}, each holding a random briefing worth 50 reputation and a badge: 30 hive silithid kills (elites), goods such as 30 Heavy Runecloth Bandages or 3 {item:7936}, or one Templar, {npc:15542} or scout report. One badge of each kind buys {quest:9338} at Kaldon: 200 reputation, repeatable. A full round is about 375 reputation."] = "{npc:15540}站在{area:3425}的月井旁。{quest:8507}（25點聲望，可重複）會讓你帶著未簽署的檔案去找本陣營的隊長：{area:2743}外{npc:15440}的鐵爐堡旅（聯盟），或{area:2744}外{npc:15612}的奧格瑪軍團（部落）。先使用檔案，再和隊長交談：一隻60級精英異種蠍會攻擊；讓隊長活下來，他就會簽字。然後卡爾東讓你選擇戰鬥、後勤或{item:20809}，每份都含一份隨機簡報，值50點聲望和一枚徽章：30隻蟲巢異種蠍（精英）、30卷厚符文布繃帶或3個{item:7936}之類的貨物，或一位聖殿騎士、{npc:15542}或偵察報告。在卡爾東處每種各一枚徽章可換{quest:9338}：200點聲望，可重複。完整一輪約375點聲望。",
		["{quest:1123} lives in {area:2361}. She sends you to {npc:13220} at {area:3077}, the camp in the north-east corner of {zone:1451}."] = "{quest:1123}住在{area:2361}。她讓你去{area:3077}的{npc:13220}那裡，那是{zone:1451}東北角的營地。",
		["{quest:8308}, a rare drop"] = "{quest:8308}，稀有掉落",
		["{quest:8314} leads to {quest:8315}: {npc:15183} sends you to the {area:3257} to summon {npc:14862}, a level 63 boss for a raid of about 20. Take it only with a raid."] = "{quest:8314}會引向{quest:8315}：{npc:15183}讓你去{area:3257}召喚{npc:14862}，一個63級首領，需要約20人團隊。只在有團隊時再去。",
		["{quest:8319} to Revered"] = "{quest:8319}到崇敬",
		["{quest:8321} (level 61, not elite) waits at the back of {area:3446}, the cave in the north-east of {zone:1451}. Flamereavers and Twilight Masters guard the way: the Flamereavers count until the top of Honored, the Masters stop at the top of Friendly like the other cultists."] = "{quest:8321}（61級，非精英）等在{area:3446}深處，那是{zone:1451}東北的洞穴。裂焰者和暮光大師把守道路：裂焰者計入到尊敬滿，而大師和其他教徒一樣在友善滿時停止。",
		["{quest:8507}, level 60"] = "{quest:8507}，60級",
		["{quest:8800}: {npc:15176}'s badge gear"] = "{quest:8800}：{npc:15176}的徽章裝備",
		["{zone:1451} quests at {area:3425}"] = "{zone:1451}任務：{area:3425}",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/centaur-clans"] = (function() return {
		["12 recipes for {quest:93224} at the clan quartermasters, no standing needed"] = "部族軍需官處可用{quest:93224}兌換12種配方，不需要聲望",
		["At Honored and level 35, after {quest:92743}, {npc:5398} sends you to {npc:253136} at the south end of {area:604}, the northern mouth of the {quest:92841}. The valley steps follow Forever's quest data: nobody who records their play has done these quests yet, so a spot or the order may be off. Every valley quest asks you to stay Honored with the Magram, and each costs the Gelkis five times what it pays. Honored to Revered is 12,000; the valley pays 11,125 of it, {quest:92811} the rest."] = "在尊敬且35級時，完成{quest:92743}後，{npc:5398}會派你去找{area:604}南端的{npc:253136}，也就是{quest:92841}的北側入口。山谷的步驟依照Forever的任務資料：記錄遊玩過程的玩家還沒有人做過這些任務，所以地點或順序可能有誤。山谷的每個任務都要求你保持瑪格拉姆尊敬，而每個任務都會讓吉爾吉斯扣掉其獎勵的五倍。尊敬到崇敬需要12,000點；山谷提供其中的11,125點，其餘由{quest:92811}補足。",
		["At Honored and level 35, {npc:5397} sends you east to {npc:253177}, a Gelkis scout at the western mouth of the {quest:93034}, where the south of {zone:1443} runs into {zone:2652}. The valley steps follow Forever's quest data: nobody who records their play has done these quests yet, so a spot or the order may be off. Every valley quest asks you to stay Honored with the Gelkis, and each costs the Magram five times what it pays. Honored to Revered is 12,000; the valley pays 10,625 of it, {quest:92811} the rest."] = "在尊敬且35級時，{npc:5397}會派你向東去找{npc:253177}，一名吉爾吉斯斥候，位於{quest:93034}的西側入口，也就是{zone:1443}南部與{zone:2652}相接處。山谷的步驟依照Forever的任務資料：記錄遊玩過程的玩家還沒有人做過這些任務，所以地點或順序可能有誤。山谷的每個任務都要求你保持吉爾吉斯尊敬，而每個任務都會讓瑪格拉姆扣掉其獎勵的五倍。尊敬到崇敬需要12,000點；山谷提供其中的10,625點，其餘由{quest:92811}補足。",
		["Back to {npc:5397}, then east to the {zone:1435}: {quest:1373} (level 37) waits by a black cauldron in {area:76}, north-east of {area:75}."] = "回到{npc:5397}，再向東前往{zone:1435}：{quest:1373}（37級）在{area:75}東北、{area:76}的一口黑色大鍋旁等你。",
		["Both quartermasters sell the same 12 recipes for {quest:93224}, no standing needed: {item:273613} and - Lesser Healing Power; Greater Spellblasting and {item:250941}; {item:250538} and {item:250606} plans; {item:252462}, {item:253973}, {item:10011} and {item:274490} patterns; the {item:269900} and {item:269902} schematics. Keep the totems you need for them before you hand the rest in."] = "兩名軍需官都出售相同的12種配方，用{quest:93224}兌換，不需要聲望：{item:273613}和附魔護腕 - 次級治療能量；強效法爆藥水和{item:250941}；{item:250538}和{item:250606}設計圖；{item:252462}、{item:253973}、{item:10011}和{item:274490}圖樣；以及{item:269900}和{item:269902}結構圖。交出其餘圖騰之前，先留下兌換所需的份量。",
		["Friendly to Honored is 6,000; after the clan's quests you are about 3,000 into it (4,000 with {quest:1371}), so 2,000 to 3,000 to go. {npc:253139}'s {quest:92811} takes 5 {quest:93224} for 750, again and again; the Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) of western {zone:1443} drop them, and the totems do not bind, so the auction house is the other source. Gelkis kills add 20 each, but Forever's kill data stops them at the end of Friendly, 1 short of Honored. At Friendly the village has two craft orders for 1,000 each: Mirda's 3 Greater Shadow Protection Potions and Grolkar's 2 Massive Iron Axes (blacksmithing). {npc:5398}'s {quest:92743} (1,000) is no craft order: he wants a {item:254392} from a crypt in the {zone:1418}, and Forever's quest pages put it in his chain before the {quest:92841}, so bring it before you reach Honored. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "友好到尊敬需要6,000點；完成部族任務後大約已有3,000點（做了{quest:1371}則有4,000點），還差2,000到3,000點。{npc:253139}的{quest:92811}可以一再繳交，每次收取5個{quest:93224}，獎勵750點；{zone:1443}西部的瑪洛迪半人馬（36-40級）會掉落圖騰，而且圖騰不綁定，所以也可以從拍賣場購買。每擊殺一個吉爾吉斯增加20點，但Forever的擊殺資料在友好末尾、距離尊敬還差1點時就會停止。友好時村裡有兩個製作訂單，每個獎勵1,000點：Mirda要3瓶強效暗影防護藥水，Grolkar要2把巨型鐵斧（鍛造）。{npc:5398}的{quest:92743}（1,000點）不是製作訂單：他需要{zone:1418}一處墓穴裡的{item:254392}，Forever的任務頁面把它放在{quest:92841}之前的任務鏈中，所以在達到尊敬前就帶來。傳承的外交官最多增加10%。",
		["Friendly to Honored is 6,000; after the clan's quests you are about 4,000 into it, so 2,000 to go. {npc:253140}'s {quest:92812} takes 5 {quest:93224} for 750, again and again: three turn-ins, 15 totems. The Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) of western {zone:1443} drop them; the totems do not bind, so the auction house is the other source. Magram kills add 20 each, but Forever's kill data stops them at the end of Friendly, 1 short of Honored. At Friendly the village also has three craft orders for 1,000 each: Halea wants 3 Greater Mystic Essences, {npc:253140} a {item:10008} (tailoring) and Talra a {item:5739} (leatherworking). Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "友好到尊敬需要6,000；完成部族任務後約已有4,000，還差2,000。{npc:253140}的{quest:92812}每次收取5個{quest:93224}，獎勵750聲望，可以一再繳交：共需三次、15個圖騰。{zone:1443}西部的瑪洛迪半人馬（36-40級）會掉落；圖騰不綁定，所以也可以從拍賣場購買。每殺一個瑪格拉姆半人馬增加20，但Forever的擊殺資料將上限設在友好末尾，距離尊敬還差1點。友好時，村裡還有三項製作訂單，每項獎勵1,000：Halea需要3個強效秘法精華，{npc:253140}需要一件{item:10008}（裁縫），Talra需要一件{item:5739}（製皮）。傳承的外交官最多增加10%。",
		["From Revered on only {quest:92811} is left: Revered to Exalted is 21,000, 28 turn-ins, 140 totems."] = "從崇敬起只剩{quest:92811}：崇敬到崇拜需要21,000，28次上交，140個圖騰。",
		["From Revered on only {quest:92812} is left: Revered to Exalted is 21,000, 28 turn-ins, 140 totems. Nothing is sold for standing; the recipes below need only totems."] = "從崇敬起只剩{quest:92812}：崇敬到崇拜需要21,000，28次上交，140個圖騰。聲望不賣任何東西；下面的配方只需要圖騰。",
		["From the quest data: Outcast Scouts and Marauders hold the hideaway, with Outcast Necrokhans, elite and level 45, among them. The {item:256892} are crates in its west. The quest wants {quest:92846} here too; players have met them only in the valley between {npc:253136} and {npc:253177} so far, so take them there if the hideaway has none."] = "依任務資料：流放者斥候和流放者掠奪者佔據著藏身處，其間還有45級精英流放者死靈可汗。{item:256892}是藏身處西側的箱子。這個任務也要求在這裡擊殺{quest:92846}；目前玩家只在{npc:253136}和{npc:253177}之間的山谷遇到過他們，所以如果藏身處沒有，就到那裡打。",
		["From the quest data: back to {npc:253136}, then east to {quest:93066} for his next order."] = "依任務資料：回到{npc:253136}那裡，然後向東前往{quest:93066}接受他的下一道命令。",
		["From the quest data: back west to {npc:5397} in {area:606}. She needs Tears of Theradras: {npc:253713}, the Voice of Theradras, keeps them in the cave in the south of the village, past {npc:253140}. Ask her for them on {npc:5397}'s behalf and bring three back. {npc:253140} takes {quest:92812} on the way."] = "依任務資料：向西回到{area:606}的{npc:5397}那裡。她需要瑟萊德絲之淚：瑟萊德絲之聲{npc:253713}把它們放在村莊南部的洞穴裡，要經過{npc:253140}。代{npc:5397}向她索取，帶回三個。途中{npc:253140}會收下{quest:92812}。",
		["From the quest data: east of {npc:253177}, in the heart of the valley, the Magram hold Gelkis Captives: free five. Among them lie {npc:253446}, failed summons stuck in the ground: lay eight to rest with {item:256061}, which the quest gives you. Corpsefeeders and Magram Necrokhans, elite and level 45, walk the valley and attack a friend of the Gelkis: let them pass before you pull."] = "依任務資料：在{npc:253177}東邊的山谷中心，瑪格拉姆關押著吉爾吉斯俘虜：救出五名。他們之間躺著{npc:253446}，是卡在地裡的失敗召喚物：用任務給你的{item:256061}讓八具安息。45級精英食屍者和瑪格拉姆死靈可汗在山谷中走動，會攻擊吉爾吉斯的朋友：等他們走過再拉怪。",
		["From the quest data: south-east of {npc:253136}, in the heart of the valley, the Magram keep Gelkis Captives: kill five. The {npc:253446} there are failed summons stuck in the ground: raise ten with the Enhanced Necromancy Staff Orgrul gave you, and kill the ones that fight back. Corpsefeeders, elite and level 45, walk the valley and attack anyone; the Magram Necrokhans, elite too, leave a friend of the Magram alone."] = "依任務資料：在{npc:253136}東南方的山谷中心，瑪格拉姆關押著吉爾吉斯俘虜：殺死五名。那裡的{npc:253446}是卡在地裡的失敗召喚物：用奧格魯給你的強化死靈法杖喚起十具，並殺掉反擊的那些。45級精英食屍者在山谷中走動，會攻擊任何人；同為精英的瑪格拉姆死靈可汗則不會理會瑪格拉姆的朋友。",
		["From the quest data: take the {item:257517} to the ritual site, a tent by the lake in the middle of {area:604}, and raise {quest:93196}. The risen khan takes the quest: 6,000, a title, and your pick of three rare level 35 weapons: {item:271800} (polearm: Stamina, attack power, Agility), {item:271803} (staff: Intellect, Stamina, Spirit) or {item:271804} (main-hand mace: Intellect, Stamina, Spirit). The quest costs the Gelkis 30,000."] = "根據任務資料：把{item:257517}帶到儀式地點，即{area:604}中央湖邊的一頂帳篷，復活{quest:93196}。復活的可汗接收任務：獎勵6,000聲望、一個頭銜，以及三件35級精良武器任選一件：{item:271800}（長柄武器：耐力、攻擊強度、敏捷）、{item:271803}（法杖：智力、耐力、精神）或{item:271804}（主手錘：智力、耐力、精神）。該任務會扣除吉爾吉斯30,000聲望。",
		["From the quest data: the Bristleback quilboar hold {quest:93066}, east of the valley. {npc:253527} (elite, level 43) and {npc:255678} (elite, level 42) lead them: leave those two be. Then report to {npc:253851} at the {area:16675}, south of the Retreat."] = "依任務資料：刺背野豬人佔據山谷東邊的{quest:93066}。{npc:253527}（精英，43級）和{npc:255678}（精英，42級）率領他們：別碰這兩個。然後到撤退地南邊的{area:16675}向{npc:253851}回報。",
		["From the quest data: the Undead Ravagers and the {quest:92846} fill the valley from {npc:253136} south-west to {npc:253177}'s post at its western mouth; players have met them all along it. {npc:253177} is a Gelkis scout. Corpsefeeders, elite and level 45, walk the valley and attack anyone."] = "依任務資料：不死掠奪者和{quest:92846}遍布山谷，從{npc:253136}一直往西南到山谷西側入口{npc:253177}的崗哨；玩家在整條路上都遇到過他們。{npc:253177}是一名吉爾吉斯斥候。45級精英食屍者在山谷中走動，會攻擊任何人。",
		["From the quest data: the Undead Ravagers and the {quest:92846} fill the valley from {npc:253177} north-east to {npc:253136}'s post at its northern mouth; players have met them all along it. {npc:253136}'s Magram are hostile to a friend of the Gelkis. Corpsefeeders, elite and level 45, walk the valley and attack anyone.\nCareful: Undead Ravagers up to level 45 can roam the valley: watch for them."] = "依任務資料：不死掠奪者和{quest:92846}遍布山谷，從{npc:253177}一直往東北到山谷北側入口{npc:253136}的崗哨；玩家在整條路上都遇到過他們。{npc:253136}的瑪格拉姆對吉爾吉斯的朋友有敵意。45級精英食屍者在山谷中走動，會攻擊任何人。\n小心：最高45級的不死掠奪者可能在山谷中遊蕩，請留意。",
		["From the quest data: walk into the Magram camp at the {area:16675}, then south-west into the {area:16676}, where Outcast Necrokhans, elite and level 45, stand guard. In a tent there {npc:254040}, a Gelkis the outcasts hold, asks you to get him out: escort him clear of the hideaway, then tell {npc:253177}."] = "依任務資料：走進{area:16675}的瑪格拉姆營地，然後向西南進入{area:16676}，那裡有45級精英流放者死靈可汗守衛。那裡的一頂帳篷裡，被流放者關押的吉爾吉斯人{npc:254040}請你救他出去：護送他離開藏身處，然後告訴{npc:253177}。",
		["From the quest data: with the Magram's warriors busy at the Front, {npc:253177} sees a chance at their khan."] = "依任務資料：瑪格拉姆的戰士們忙於前線，{npc:253177}看見了對付他們可汗的機會。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:253136} gives you a {item:254870}. He laid out two skeletons on the hill just east of his post: put the staff to use there, and the Nascent Undead Ravagers give the Well Cursed Bones."] = "依任務資料：{npc:253136}會給你一根{item:254870}。他在崗哨東邊不遠的山丘上擺了兩具骷髏：在那裡使用法杖，新生的不死掠奪者會給你精心詛咒的骨頭。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:253136} pays 500 and your pick of three items for level 35: {item:271796} (one-handed sword), {item:271797} (staff) or {item:271798} (shield)."] = "依任務資料：{npc:253136}會給你500點，並讓你從三件35級物品中選一件：{item:271796}（單手劍）、{item:271797}（法杖）或{item:271798}（盾牌）。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:253136} wants bones from the valley's Undead Ravagers (the quest log counts them in hundreds) and six {quest:92846} dead: Gelkis exiles meddling with the Magram's new magic."] = "依任務資料：{npc:253136}要山谷中不死掠奪者的骨頭（任務日誌以百為單位計數），以及六名死掉的{quest:92846}：插手瑪格拉姆新魔法的吉爾吉斯流亡者。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:253136} wants three {item:254841} from the valley's accursed trees (the game's data has no spot for them) and three {item:254840}: {npc:5398} keeps the crystals you took from the Gelkis, so ask him."] = "依任務資料：{npc:253136}要三個來自山谷中受詛咒之樹的{item:254841}（遊戲資料中沒有它們的位置），以及三個{item:254840}：你從吉爾吉斯那裡拿到的水晶在{npc:5398}手上，所以去問他。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:253177} gives you a {item:255941} to show {npc:5397}, with an {item:255945} you find yourself: a freshly cursed skull, hoarded in the jaws of one of the valley's giant skeletons. The game's data has no spot for it."] = "依任務資料：{npc:253177}會給你一件{item:255941}拿給{npc:5397}看，另外還要一個你自己找到的{item:255945}：一個剛被詛咒的頭骨，藏在山谷中一具巨大骷髏的嘴裡。遊戲資料中沒有它的位置。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:253177} pays 500 and your pick of three weapons for level 35: {item:271794} (polearm), {item:271795} (two-handed sword) or {item:271799} (dagger). Then he has two jobs deeper in the valley."] = "依任務資料：{npc:253177}會給你500點，並讓你從三把35級武器中選一把：{item:271794}（長柄武器）、{item:271795}（雙手劍）或{item:271799}（匕首）。之後他在山谷更深處還有兩個差事。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:253177} waits at the valley's western mouth. He wants six Undead Ravagers put to rest and the ritual garb of an {npc:11559}: the outcasts are Gelkis exiles who took up the Magram's necromancy."] = "依任務資料：{npc:253177}在山谷西側入口等著。他要你讓六隻不死掠奪者安息，並取得一名{npc:11559}的儀式長袍：流放者是學了瑪格拉姆死靈術的吉爾吉斯流亡者。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:253177}'s next order takes you deeper into {zone:2652} to scout two places: the {area:16675}, a Magram camp south-east of the valley, and the {area:16676}, the exiles' camp west of the Shen'dralar town, further south."] = "依任務資料：{npc:253177}的下一道命令要你深入{zone:2652}偵察兩個地點：{area:16675}，山谷東南方的瑪格拉姆營地；以及{area:16676}，流亡者在辛德拉城鎮西邊、更南方的營地。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:253851} sends you south-west to the {area:16676}, the exiles' camp west of the Shen'dralar town."] = "依任務資料：{npc:253851}派你向西南前往{area:16676}，也就是流亡者在辛德拉城鎮西邊的營地。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:5397} gives you her staff and a {item:6071}. Put them together into {item:256061}, take it to the ritual site by the pond just east of the village and dispel the curse on the {item:255945}. Then east again to {npc:253177}."] = "依任務資料：{npc:5397}會給你她的法杖和一個{item:6071}。把它們組合成{item:256061}，帶到村莊東邊不遠水池旁的儀式地點，驅散{item:255945}上的詛咒。然後再向東去找{npc:253177}。",
		["From the quest data: {npc:5601} (level 37) leads the Magram from the west side of {area:604}, north-east of {npc:253177}. The village is hostile to a friend of the Gelkis, and two Magram Necrokhans, elite and level 45, stand a little west of the khan. {npc:5397} pays 6,000, a title, and your pick of three rare level 35 weapons: {item:271801} (two-handed axe: Strength, Stamina, Agility), {item:271802} (one-handed mace: Strength, Stamina, Agility) or {item:271805} (off-hand: Spirit, Intellect, Stamina). The quest costs the Magram 30,000."] = "根據任務資料：{npc:5601}（37級）在 {area:604} 西側、{npc:253177} 東北方統領瑪格拉姆。該村莊對吉爾吉斯的朋友懷有敵意，可汗西邊不遠處還站著兩名45級精英瑪格拉姆死靈可汗。{npc:5397} 會獎勵6,000點聲望、一個頭銜，以及三件35級稀有武器中的一件：{item:271801}（雙手斧：力量、耐力、敏捷）、{item:271802}（單手錘：力量、耐力、敏捷）或 {item:271805}（副手：精神、智力、耐力）。該任務會扣除瑪格拉姆30,000聲望。",
		["From the quest data: {quest:93196} has been slain by outsiders working for the Gelkis, and {npc:253136} means to raise him."] = "依任務資料：{quest:93196}被替吉爾吉斯辦事的外人殺死了，{npc:253136}打算讓他復活。",
		["Gelkis and Magram Centaur Reputation"] = "吉爾吉斯和瑪格拉姆半人馬聲望",
		["Gelkis done"] = "吉爾吉斯完成",
		["Gelkis or Magram"] = "吉爾吉斯或瑪格拉姆",
		["Gelkis: back to {npc:253177}"] = "吉爾吉斯：回到{npc:253177}處",
		["Gelkis: the Kolkar camps"] = "吉爾吉斯：科卡爾營地",
		["Gelkis: the choice quest"] = "吉爾吉斯：選擇任務",
		["Gelkis: the heart of the valley"] = "吉爾吉斯：山谷中心",
		["Gelkis: the valley's mouth"] = "吉爾吉斯：山谷入口",
		["Gelkis: the {area:16675} and the {area:16676}"] = "吉爾吉斯：{area:16675}與{area:16676}",
		["Gelkis: totems and kills to Honored"] = "吉爾吉斯：圖騰與擊殺衝尊敬",
		["Gelkis: totems to Exalted"] = "吉爾吉斯：圖騰衝崇拜",
		["Gelkis: {area:604}"] = "吉爾吉斯：{area:604}",
		["Gelkis: {npc:253177}"] = "吉爾吉斯：{npc:253177}",
		["Gelkis: {npc:253177}'s last order"] = "吉爾吉斯：{npc:253177}的最後命令",
		["Gelkis: {npc:5397} and {npc:253713}"] = "吉爾吉斯：{npc:5397}與{npc:253713}",
		["Gelkis: {npc:5397} sends you to the valley"] = "吉爾吉斯：{npc:5397}派你前往山谷",
		["Gelkis: {npc:5601}"] = "吉爾吉斯：{npc:5601}",
		["Gelkis: {quest:1373}"] = "吉爾吉斯：{quest:1373}",
		["Gelkis: {quest:93041}"] = "吉爾吉斯：{quest:93041}",
		["Gelkis: {quest:93045}"] = "吉爾吉斯：{quest:93045}",
		["Gelkis: {quest:93122}"] = "吉爾吉斯：{quest:93122}",
		["Gently Cursed Bones: Undead Ravagers"] = "輕度詛咒的骨頭：不死掠奪者",
		["Lay {npc:253446} to rest"] = "讓{npc:253446}安息",
		["Magram: back to {npc:253851}"] = "瑪格拉姆：回到{npc:253851}處",
		["Magram: the Kolkar camps"] = "瑪格拉姆：科卡爾營地",
		["Magram: the heart of the valley"] = "瑪格拉姆：山谷中心",
		["Magram: the quilboar"] = "瑪格拉姆：野豬人",
		["Magram: the valley's mouth"] = "瑪格拉姆：山谷入口",
		["Magram: the {area:16676}"] = "瑪格拉姆：{area:16676}",
		["Magram: totems and kills to Honored"] = "瑪格拉姆：圖騰與擊殺衝尊敬",
		["Magram: totems to Exalted"] = "瑪格拉姆：圖騰衝崇拜",
		["Magram: {npc:253136}"] = "瑪格拉姆：{npc:253136}",
		["Magram: {npc:253136}'s next tasks"] = "瑪格拉姆：{npc:253136}的下一批任務",
		["Magram: {npc:253136}'s ritual"] = "瑪格拉姆：{npc:253136}的儀式",
		["Magram: {npc:253851} at the {area:16675}"] = "瑪格拉姆：{area:16675}的{npc:253851}",
		["Magram: {npc:5398} sends you to the valley"] = "瑪格拉姆：{npc:5398}派你前往山谷",
		["Magram: {quest:1369}"] = "瑪格拉姆：{quest:1369}",
		["Magram: {quest:1371}"] = "瑪格拉姆：{quest:1371}",
		["Magram: {quest:92847}"] = "瑪格拉姆：{quest:92847}",
		["Magram: {quest:92873}"] = "瑪格拉姆：{quest:92873}",
		["Magram: {quest:93066}"] = "瑪格拉姆：{quest:93066}",
		["Magram: {quest:93196}"] = "瑪格拉姆：{quest:93196}",
		["No Gelkis quests done: on to the Magram, south-east."] = "沒有完成任何吉爾吉斯任務：前往東南方的瑪格拉姆。",
		["No clan's quests in your log: the guide goes on with the Gelkis. For the Magram, take their choice quest and Buying Friendship and the guide goes to the Magram half."] = "任務日誌中沒有任何部族的任務：指南按吉爾吉斯路線繼續。若選瑪格拉姆，接取他們的選擇任務和「收買友誼」，指南就會跳到瑪格拉姆部分。",
		["Pick your clan"] = "選擇你的部族",
		["Raise or slay {npc:253446}"] = "喚起或殺死{npc:253446}",
		["Take the quests of one clan"] = "只接一個部族的任務",
		["The Gelkis (south-west {zone:1443}) and the Magram (south-east) are at war: every kill of one clan gives the other 20 and costs its own clan 100, and every quest of one clan costs the other five times what it pays (Buying Friendship: 3,000 for yours, 15,000 off the other), so you can only climb with one. Both start Neutral. Forever's quests are worth far more than kills now. Alliance: {npc:5396} at {area:608} offers {quest:1382} (Gelkis) and {quest:1385} (Magram). Horde: {npc:5412} offers {quest:1368} and {quest:1367}. Take the one of your clan, and {quest:93224}: each clan's Buying Friendship (3,000) is offered once you bring the totems back. Then tick the task. The guide goes on with the Gelkis; take the Magram's quests instead and it goes to the Magram half. Forever pays these quests in full at any level."] = "吉爾吉斯（{zone:1443}西南）與瑪格拉姆（東南）正在交戰：每殺一名某部族成員，另一部族增加20點聲望，被殺的部族則扣100點；而某一部族的每個任務，都會讓另一部族扣掉其獎勵的五倍（「收買友誼」：你的部族得3,000點，另一部族扣15,000點），所以只能提升其中一方。兩者初始都是中立。現在Forever的任務獎勵遠高於擊殺。聯盟：{area:608}的{npc:5396}提供{quest:1382}（吉爾吉斯）和{quest:1385}（瑪格拉姆）。部落：{npc:5412}提供{quest:1368}和{quest:1367}。接取你所選部族的任務和{quest:93224}：帶回圖騰後，就會提供該部族的「收買友誼」（3,000點）。然後勾選此項。指南接下來走吉爾吉斯路線；改接瑪格拉姆的任務，就會跳到瑪格拉姆部分。在Forever中，這些任務在任何等級都給予全額獎勵。",
		["The Gelkis half starts with the clan's choice quest from the giver you just handed the totems to: {npc:5397}'s quests in {area:606} follow from it, and Buying Friendship alone does not open them."] = "吉爾吉斯部分從你剛交圖騰的那位任務給予者提供的部族選擇任務開始：{area:606}的{npc:5397}的任務由此展開，只完成「收買友誼」並不會開啟它們。",
		["The Kolkar centaurs (level 30-33) hold the camps south of {area:608}, along the eastern road. About one in four drops a {item:6079}."] = "科卡爾半人馬（30到33級）佔據{area:608}以南沿東側道路的營地。約每四個掉落一個{item:6079}。",
		["The Kolkar centaurs (level 30-33) hold the camps south of {area:608}."] = "科卡爾半人馬（30到33級）佔據{area:608}以南的營地。",
		["The Kolkar centaurs (level 30-33) in the camps along the eastern road, south of {area:608}, drop the totems, and so do the Magram and the Maraudine. Bring five back, then take your clan's Buying Friendship (Gelkis below; the Magram's instead for the Magram)."] = "{area:608}以南、東邊道路沿線營地裡的科卡爾半人馬（30-33級）會掉落圖騰，瑪格拉姆和瑪洛迪半人馬也會掉。帶回五個，然後接取你所選部族的「收買友誼」（下面是吉爾吉斯的；瑪格拉姆則接瑪格拉姆的）。",
		["The Sacks of Meat lie about {area:604}, in the south-east. Every Magram you kill on the way pays the Gelkis 20."] = "肉袋散落在東南部{area:604}一帶。路上每殺一個瑪格拉姆人，吉爾吉斯加20。",
		["The Tears of Theradras are crystals in the cave behind {area:606}, in the south-west. Every Gelkis you kill on the way pays the Magram 20."] = "瑟萊德絲之淚是西南部{area:606}後方洞穴中的水晶。路上每殺一個吉爾吉斯人，瑪格拉姆加20。",
		["The totem recipes"] = "圖騰配方",
		["Well Cursed Bones: Nascent Undead Ravagers"] = "精心詛咒的骨頭：新生的不死掠奪者",
		["dispel the {item:255945} by the pond"] = "在水池旁驅散{item:255945}的詛咒",
		["escort {npc:254040} out of the hideaway"] = "護送{npc:254040}離開藏身處",
		["free five Gelkis Captives"] = "救出五名吉爾吉斯俘虜",
		["raise {quest:93196} at the tent by the lake"] = "在湖邊的帳篷復活{quest:93196}",
		["three Tears of Theradras, in {npc:253713}'s cave"] = "三顆瑟拉達斯之淚，在{npc:253713}的洞穴裡",
		["{area:604} fills the valley of south-east {zone:1443}; {npc:5398} stands on its north side, {npc:253139}, the Magram quartermaster, near the lake. Buying Friendship alone takes you from Neutral to Friendly."] = "{area:604}佔據{zone:1443}東南的山谷；{npc:5398}站在它的北側，瑪格拉姆軍需官{npc:253139}在湖邊。僅“購買友誼”一項就能把你從中立帶到友善。",
		["{area:604}: {npc:5398} and {npc:253139}"] = "{area:604}：{npc:5398}和{npc:253139}",
		["{area:606} sits in the hills of south-west {zone:1443}; {npc:5397} stands at its heart. {npc:253140}, the Gelkis quartermaster, is at the south end of the village. Buying Friendship alone takes you from Neutral to Friendly."] = "{area:606}位於{zone:1443}西南的山丘中；{npc:5397}站在它的中心。吉爾吉斯軍需官{npc:253140}在村子南端。僅“購買友誼”一項就能把你從中立帶到友善。",
		["{area:606}: {npc:5397} and {npc:253140}"] = "{area:606}：{npc:5397}和{npc:253140}",
		["{item:254432}: Kolkar centaurs"] = "{item:254432}：科卡爾半人馬",
		["{item:254432}: Maraudine centaurs"] = "{item:254432}：瑪拉迪半人馬",
		["{item:254841}: the valley's accursed trees"] = "{item:254841}：山谷中受詛咒的樹",
		["{item:255945}: in a giant skeleton's jaws"] = "{item:255945}：在一具巨大骷髏的嘴裡",
		["{item:256892}: crates"] = "{item:256892}：箱子",
		["{item:4392}: made by engineers, or bought"] = "{item:4392}：工程師製作，或直接購買",
		["{item:6069}: Sacks of Meat"] = "{item:6069}：肉袋",
		["{item:6079}: Kolkar centaurs"] = "{item:6079}：科卡爾半人馬",
		["{npc:253713}, in the cave"] = "{npc:253713}，在洞穴裡",
		["{npc:4640}: 20 Gelkis"] = "{npc:4640}：20個吉爾吉斯人",
		["{npc:4641}: 20 Gelkis"] = "{npc:4641}：20個吉爾吉斯人",
		["{npc:4648}: 20 Magram"] = "{npc:4648}：20個瑪格拉姆人",
		["{npc:4649}: 20 Magram"] = "{npc:4649}：20個瑪格拉姆人",
		["{npc:5398} wants an {item:4392}: engineers make it (4 {item:4234}, a {item:4389}, a {item:4382} and an {item:4387}); others buy one. It pays 1,000 and a choice of two engineering schematics, the {item:269900} or the {item:269902}."] = "{npc:5398}要一個{item:4392}：工程師可以製作（4個{item:4234}、一個{item:4389}、一個{item:4382}和一個{item:4387}）；其他人則直接買。它給1,000聲望，並可從兩張工程學結構圖中選一張：{item:269900}或{item:269902}。",
		["{npc:5601}'s quest: a clan title and a choice of three rare level 35 weapons"] = "{npc:5601}的任務：一個部族頭銜，以及三把35級稀有武器任選其一",
		["{quest:1369}: the {object:22246} crystals"] = "{quest:1369}：{object:22246}水晶",
		["{quest:1382}: Gelkis"] = "{quest:1382}：吉爾吉斯",
		["{zone:1443}'s feuding clans, reworked in Forever: pick one, buy its friendship, and trade totems for recipes."] = "{zone:1443}的敵對部族，在Forever中經過重製：選擇其一，換取其友誼，並用圖騰交換配方。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/darkspear-islands"] = (function() return {
		["Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor: play games"] = "暗矛群島榮譽徽記：打戰場",
		["Darkspear Islands Reputation"] = "暗矛群島聲望",
		["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Darkspear Islands\" and opens the epics: gloves in plate, mail, leather and cloth for levels 50 and 60 ({item:271940}, Gloves, Handguards and Handwraps, 3g94s to 15g16s) and level 60 shoulders in every armor type ({item:271955}, Shoulders, Spaulders, Mantle, Epaulets, Shoulderpads and Shoulderguards, 9g44s to 16g86s). The {item:276504} comes from a short questline that Exalted opens here."] = "崇拜會給予傳承點數“暗矛群島大師”，並解鎖史詩裝備：50級和60級的板甲、鎖甲、皮甲和布甲手套（{item:271940}，手套、護手和裹手，3金94銀到15金16銀），以及60級各甲種的護肩（{item:271955}，護肩、肩甲、襯肩、肩章、肩墊和肩鎧，9金44銀到16金86銀）。{item:276504}來自崇拜在此解鎖的一條短任務鏈。",
		["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Darkspear Islands\" and opens the epics: gloves in plate, mail, leather and cloth for levels 50 and 60 ({item:272095}, Gloves, Handguards and Handwraps, 3g94s to 15g16s) and level 60 shoulders in every armor type ({item:272105}, Shoulders, Spaulders, Mantle, Epaulets, Shoulderpads and Shoulderguards, 9g44s to 16g86s). The {item:276502} comes from a short questline that Exalted opens here."] = "崇拜會給予傳承點數“暗矛群島大師”，並解鎖史詩裝備：50級和60級的板甲、鎖甲、皮甲和布甲手套（{item:272095}，手套、護手和裹手，3金94銀到15金16銀），以及60級各甲種的護肩（{item:272105}，護肩、肩甲、襯肩、肩章、肩墊和肩鎧，9金44銀到16金86銀）。{item:276502}來自崇拜在此解鎖的一條短任務鏈。",
		["Forever's new battleground: its gear comes for every bracket from 30, and Exalted gives a Legacy Point."] = "無限的新戰場：從30級起每個等級段都有其裝備，崇拜可獲得1點傳承點數。",
		["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:263569}, the quartermaster at {area:385}: the trinkets {item:271903} and {item:271904} for levels 33 and 48 (1g49s to 11g85s), and food, bandages and draughts for the battleground. A Theramore care package for Friendly also exists in Forever's data."] = "友善到尊敬需要6000聲望。友善會在{area:385}的軍需官{npc:263569}處解鎖第一批獎勵：33級和48級的飾品{item:271903}和{item:271904}（1金49銀到11金85銀），以及戰場用的食物、繃帶和藥劑。Forever 的資料裡還存在一份友善可得的塞拉摩補給包。",
		["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:263570}, the quartermaster beside {npc:275276}: the trinkets {item:272059} and {item:272060} for levels 33 and 48 (1g49s to 11g85s), and food, bandages and draughts for the battleground (5s to 20s). A Darkspear care package for Friendly also exists in Forever's data."] = "友善到尊敬需要6000聲望。友善會在{npc:275276}旁的軍需官{npc:263570}處解鎖第一批獎勵：33級和48級的飾品{item:272059}和{item:272060}（1金49銀到11金85銀），以及戰場用的食物、繃帶和藥劑（5銀到20銀）。Forever 的資料裡還存在一份友善可得的暗矛補給包。",
		["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. Honored opens {item:271913}, {item:271908}, {item:271917} and {item:271907} for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (1g11s to 12g6s): rings, neck and cloak that fit the bracket you are in."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000聲望。尊敬解鎖{item:271913}、{item:271908}、{item:271917}和{item:271907}，分別對應28、38、48和58級（1金11銀到12金6銀）：戒指、項鍊和披風，適配你所在的等級段。",
		["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. Honored opens {item:272064}, {item:272068}, {item:272072} and {item:272063} for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (1g11s to 12g6s): rings, neck and cloak that fit the bracket you are in."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000聲望。尊敬解鎖{item:272064}、{item:272068}、{item:272072}和{item:272063}，分別對應28、38、48和58級（1金11銀到12金6銀）：戒指、項鍊和披風，適配你所在的等級段。",
		["Master of Darkspear Islands: a Legacy Point at Exalted"] = "暗矛群島大師：崇拜時獲得1點傳承點數",
		["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. Forever has not said how much a game pays by itself; the sure part is the Brigadier General's 100 for every 3 marks, which is one win, so at most 30 wins from Neutral even before the games' own reputation. Each new bracket (40, 50, 60) brings a new first win for {npc:275273} (200) and a new first mark quest (150)."] = "中立到友善需要3000聲望。Forever 沒有說明單場戰場本身給多少；確定的部分是准將每3枚徽記給的100點（相當於一勝），所以即使不算戰場本身的聲望，從中立起也最多30勝。每個新的等級段（40、50、60）都會帶來一次新的首勝（{npc:275273}，200點）和一次新的首枚徽記任務（150點）。",
		["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. Forever has not said how much a game pays by itself; the sure part is the Warbringer's 100 for every 3 marks, which is one win, so at most 30 wins from Neutral even before the games' own reputation. Each new bracket (40, 50, 60) brings a new first win for {npc:275276} (200) and a new first mark quest (150)."] = "中立到友善需要3000聲望。Forever 沒有說明單場戰場本身給多少；確定的部分是戰爭使者每3枚徽記給的100點（相當於一勝），所以即使不算戰場本身的聲望，從中立起也最多30勝。每個新的等級段（40、50、60）都會帶來一次新的首勝（{npc:275276}，200點）和一次新的首枚徽記任務（150點）。",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58: {item:271924} (two-handed axe), {item:271928} (dagger), Guerrilla's Jagged Mace and {item:271932} (off-hand), 1g44s to 37g15s."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21000聲望，佔整段的一半。崇敬可購買等級28、38、48和58的武器：{item:271924}（雙手斧）、{item:271928}（匕首）、游擊隊鋸齒錘和{item:271932}（副手），價格1g44s到37g15s。",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58: {item:272079} (two-handed axe), {item:272083} (dagger), {item:272091} (mace) and the {item:272087} (off-hand), 1g44s to 37g15s."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21000聲望，佔爬升的一半。崇敬解鎖28、38、48和58級的武器：{item:272079}（雙手斧）、{item:272083}（匕首）、{item:272091}（釘錘）和{item:272087}（副手），1金44銀到37金15銀。",
		["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time ({quest:98887}), then 100 for every 3 more. One stands here at the {area:391}, beside the portal; others at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413}, in {zone:1454}, {zone:1456} and the {zone:1458}, at {area:321} and by the {zone:1459} gate. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "{npc:15350} 首次收取 3 枚暗矛群島榮譽獎章，獎勵 150 點聲望（{quest:98887}），之後每 3 枚獎勵 100 點。這裡的 {area:391} 傳送門旁就有一位；其他幾位位於 {zone:1413} 北部的摩爾沙、{zone:1454}、{zone:1456}、{zone:1458}、{area:321} 及 {zone:1459} 大門旁。無限的 PvP 裝備除了榮譽，還要消耗榮譽獎章：交還前先想好要買什麼。{zone:2524} 的獎章最多隻能攜帶 30 枚：達到上限前及時交還或花掉。",
		["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98889}), then keeps taking 3 more. One stands here at the {area:391}, beside the portal; others at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15350} 在每個等級段首次接受 3 枚暗矛群島榮譽獎章時，會提供 150 點聲望（{quest:98889}），之後仍會持續接受每 3 枚獎章。這裡的 {area:391} 傳送門旁就有一位；其他幾位在 {zone:1413} 北部的摩爾沙和 {zone:1454}。無限的 PvP 裝備除了榮譽外也需要榮譽獎章：交還前先決定想換什麼。你最多隻能攜帶 30 枚 {zone:2524} 獎章。",
		["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98891}), then keeps taking 3 more. One stands here at the {area:391}, beside the portal; others at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15350} 在每個等級段首次接受 3 枚暗矛群島榮譽獎章時，會提供 150 點聲望（{quest:98891}），之後仍會持續接受每 3 枚獎章。這裡的 {area:391} 傳送門旁就有一位；其他幾位在 {zone:1413} 北部的摩爾沙和 {zone:1454}。無限的 PvP 裝備除了榮譽外也需要榮譽獎章：交還前先決定想換什麼。你最多隻能攜帶 30 枚 {zone:2524} 獎章。",
		["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98893}), then keeps taking 3 more. One stands here at the {area:391}, beside the portal; others at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15350} 在每個等級段首次接受 3 枚暗矛群島榮譽獎章時，會提供 150 點聲望（{quest:98893}），之後仍會持續接受每 3 枚獎章。這裡的 {area:391} 傳送門旁就有一位；其他幾位在 {zone:1413} 北部的摩爾沙和 {zone:1454}。無限的 PvP 裝備除了榮譽外也需要榮譽獎章：交還前先決定想換什麼。你最多隻能攜帶 30 枚 {zone:2524} 獎章。",
		["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time ({quest:98895}), then 100 for every 3 more. One stands here at {area:385}, beside the portal; others in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440}, at {area:320} in the {zone:1417} and at both gates of {zone:1459}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "{npc:15351} 首次接受 3 枚暗矛群島榮譽獎章時，會提供 150 點聲望（{quest:98895}），之後每 3 枚提供 100 點。這裡的 {area:385} 傳送門旁就有一位；其他幾位位於 {zone:1453}、{zone:1455} 和 {zone:1457}，以及 {zone:1440} 南部的 {area:3319}、{zone:1417} 的 {area:320} 和 {zone:1459} 兩側大門處。無限的 PvP 裝備除了榮譽外也需要榮譽獎章：交還前先決定想換什麼。你最多隻能攜帶 30 枚 {zone:2524} 獎章：達到上限前就要交還或花掉。",
		["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98897}), then keeps taking 3 more. One stands here at {area:385}, beside the portal; others in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440} and at {area:320}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "每個等級段首次向 {npc:15351} 交還3枚暗矛群島榮譽獎章，可獲得150點聲望（{quest:98897}），之後仍可每次交還3枚。這裡的 {area:385} 傳送門旁就有一位；其他幾位在 {zone:1453}、{zone:1455}、{zone:1457}、{zone:1440} 南部的 {area:3319} 和 {area:320}。無限服的PvP裝備除了榮譽外，也需要榮譽獎章：交還前先決定想買什麼。最多隻能攜帶30枚 {zone:2524} 獎章。",
		["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98899}), then keeps taking 3 more. One stands here at {area:385}, beside the portal; others in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440} and at {area:320}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "每個等級段首次向 {npc:15351} 交還3枚暗矛群島榮譽獎章，可獲得150點聲望（{quest:98899}），之後仍可每次交還3枚。這裡的 {area:385} 傳送門旁就有一位；其他幾位在 {zone:1453}、{zone:1455}、{zone:1457}、{zone:1440} 南部的 {area:3319} 和 {area:320}。無限服的PvP裝備除了榮譽外，也需要榮譽獎章：交還前先決定想買什麼。最多隻能攜帶30枚 {zone:2524} 獎章。",
		["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98901}), then keeps taking 3 more. One stands here at {area:385}, beside the portal; others in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440} and at {area:320}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "每個等級段首次向 {npc:15351} 交還3枚暗矛群島榮譽獎章，可獲得150點聲望（{quest:98901}），之後仍可每次交還3枚。這裡的 {area:385} 傳送門旁就有一位；其他幾位在 {zone:1453}、{zone:1455}、{zone:1457}、{zone:1440} 南部的 {area:3319} 和 {area:320}。無限服的PvP裝備除了榮譽外，也需要榮譽獎章：交還前先決定想買什麼。最多隻能攜帶30枚 {zone:2524} 獎章。",
		["The {zone:2524} lie off the coast of {zone:1445}: 15 against 15, from level 30. Hold the four capture points to gain points, faster the more you hold, and carry the flag from the middle to a base your team holds for more; the first team to 2000 points wins. The sea kills: cross on the bridges. Queue at any battlemaster or step through the portal here at the {area:391}, north of {area:392}. {npc:275276} pays 200 reputation for your first win. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:2524}位於{zone:1445}外海：15對15，30級起可參加。佔領四個據點可以得分，佔得越多得分越快；再把中央的旗幟運到己方控制的基地可得更多分；先到2000分的一方獲勝。海水會致命：走橋過海。在任意戰場軍官處排隊，或從這裡{area:392}以北{area:391}的傳送門進入。首次獲勝時{npc:275276}會給200聲望。Forever 的傳承特長“外交家”可使本篇攻略中的每個數字最多提高10%。",
		["The {zone:2524} lie off the coast of {zone:1445}: 15 against 15, from level 30. Hold the four capture points to gain points, faster the more you hold, and carry the flag from the middle to a base your team holds for more; the first team to 2000 points wins. The sea kills: cross on the bridges. Queue at any battlemaster or step through the portal here at {area:385}, south of {area:392}. {npc:275273} pays 200 reputation for your first win. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:2524}位於{zone:1445}外海：15對15，30級起可參加。佔領四個據點可以得分，佔得越多得分越快；再把中央的旗幟運到己方控制的基地可得更多分；先到2000分的一方獲勝。海水會致命：走橋過海。在任意戰場軍官處排隊，或從這裡{area:392}以南{area:385}的傳送門進入。首次獲勝時{npc:275273}會給200聲望。Forever 的傳承特長“外交家”可使本篇攻略中的每個數字最多提高10%。",
		["after a win"] = "獲勝後",
		["win a {zone:2524} battleground"] = "贏得一場{zone:2524}戰場",
		["{faction:2798} to Exalted"] = "{faction:2798}到崇拜",
		["{faction:2798} to Friendly"] = "{faction:2798}到友善",
		["{faction:2798} to Honored"] = "{faction:2798}到尊敬",
		["{faction:2798} to Revered"] = "{faction:2798}到崇敬",
