t.guides["forever/reputation/darkspear-trolls"] = (function() return {
		["A {npc:3118} may drop a {item:277661}: use it to start {quest:97281}. Once you hand that in, {npc:3293} offers {quest:97282}."] = "{npc:3118}可能掉落{item:277661}：使用它開啟{quest:97281}。交完該任務後，{npc:3293}會提供{quest:97282}。",
		["Blackrock Mountain, with a group"] = "黑石山，組隊前往",
		["Boars, weapons and peons"] = "野豬、武器和苦工",
		["Darkspear Trolls Reputation"] = "暗矛食人妖聲望",
		["Darkspear reputation comes from quests and cloth. {npc:14727}, the Darkspear cloth quartermaster, stands in {zone:1454}'s {object:172961}. She takes four one-time donations of 60 cloth (150 each) and then {quest:7837}, 20 {item:14047} for 50, as often as you like. Every point you earn with the {faction:530} also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1454}, {zone:1456} and the {zone:1458}. While you level, do the Darkspear quests within 5 levels of them: {zone:1411} at 5 to 12, {area:414} in {zone:1440} at 19 to 27, {object:3202} in Stranglethorn at 34 to 46. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10%. Rewards: at Honored the Darkspear merchants sell to you for 10% less (the Classic rule), the raptor vendor included; at Exalted other races can buy the raptors: 20 gold for a level 40 raptor, 200 gold for a swift raptor at level 60, once you have mount training. The {faction:530} have no tabard or other reward."] = "暗矛聲望來自任務和布料。暗矛布料軍需官{npc:14727}站在{zone:1454}的{object:172961}。她先接受四次各60塊布的一次性捐獻（每次150聲望），然後開放{quest:7837}，每20塊{item:14047}換50聲望，可無限重複。你每獲得一點{faction:530}聲望，也會向{zone:1454}、{zone:1456}和{zone:1458}各溢位四分之一。練級時，在任務等級與自身相差不超過5級時完成暗矛任務：5到12級做{zone:1411}，19到27級做{zone:1440}的{area:414}，34到46級做荊棘谷的{object:3202}。傳承的外交家特長最多增加10%。獎勵：尊敬時，暗矛商人的售價降低10%（經典版規則），包括迅猛龍商人；崇拜後其他種族也能購買迅猛龍：學會坐騎騎術後，40級迅猛龍20金幣，60級迅捷迅猛龍200金幣。{faction:530}沒有戰袍或其他獎勵。",
		["Exalted with the {faction:530}"] = "{faction:530}聲望達到崇拜",
		["For The Horde! (Rend's head, {area:1583}) and The Lord of Blackrock (Nefarian's head) pay 200 to every Horde city, the {faction:530} included. {area:340} in the {zone:1418} starts the Rend chain: {quest:4903}, {npc:3144}'s Wisdom, then For The Horde!. Take them when your group goes. The Spider God chain of the {zone:1458} guide ({area:978} and the {zone:1425}) pays 225 Darkspear on the way."] = "《為了部落！》（雷德之首，{area:1583}）和《黑石之王》（奈法利安之首）給每個部落城市200點，包括{faction:530}。{zone:1418}的{area:340}開啟雷德任務鏈：{quest:4903}、{npc:3144}的“智慧”，然後是《為了部落！》。組隊去的時候順便接。{zone:1458}指南裡的蜘蛛之神任務鏈（{area:978}和{zone:1425}）路上給225點暗矛聲望。",
		["Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. The {area:363} is the best of them: about 1,400 {zone:1454} and 1,400 Darkspear reputation in 25 minutes. {npc:3143} waits in the Den, the big hut; {npc:10176} stands outside it."] = "Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。{area:363}是其中最好的：25分鐘約1,400點{zone:1454}和1,400點暗矛食人妖聲望。{npc:3143}在大棚屋“洞穴”裡等著，{npc:10176}站在外面。",
		["Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. {area:362} and north {zone:1411}: about 1,650 {zone:1454} and 1,650 Darkspear reputation in 80 minutes. {npc:3142} and {npc:3139} stand in the middle of the town, {npc:3191} by the barracks, {npc:3147} and Turroc at the edges."] = "Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。{area:362}和{zone:1411}北部：80分鐘約1,650點{zone:1454}和1,650點暗矛食人妖聲望。{npc:3142}和{npc:3139}站在鎮子中間，{npc:3191}在兵營旁，{npc:3147}和圖洛克在邊上。",
		["Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. {area:367} and the {area:368}: about 625 {zone:1454} and 650 Darkspear reputation in 25 minutes. {npc:3188} and {npc:3304} stand by the huts, {npc:3194} near the water, {npc:7953} south of the village."] = "Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。{area:367}和{area:368}：25分鐘約625點{zone:1454}和650點暗矛食人妖聲望。{npc:3188}和{npc:3304}站在棚屋旁，{npc:3194}在水邊，{npc:7953}在村子以南。",
		["From here it is cloth. Wool, Silk and Mageweave must all be handed in before {npc:14727} offers the {item:14047} donation, and {quest:7837} needs the {item:14047} donation. Buy cloth at the Auction House, or farm it: humanoids drop it, Wool from level 15 to 25, Silk 25 to 40, Mageweave 40 to 50, {item:14047} 50 and up. At 60 farm mobs of level 52 or more: lower ones are grey."] = "從這裡開始就是布料。必須先交完毛料、絲綢和魔紋布，{npc:14727}才會提供{item:14047}捐獻，而{quest:7837}也需要先完成{item:14047}捐獻。布料可在拍賣行購買，或自己刷：人形生物掉落布料，毛料來自15至25級，絲綢25至40級，魔紋布40至50級，{item:14047}50級起。60級時刷52級及以上的怪物，等級更低的怪是灰色的。",
		["Go back into the cave and keep to the right-hand wall all the way, over a small stream, to {npc:3183} on a ledge above a pool."] = "回到洞裡，全程貼著右手邊的牆走，越過一條小溪，{npc:3183}就在水潭上方的巖架上。",
		["Honored to Revered is 12,000: 240 hand-ins, 4,800 {item:14047}. The Auction House price of a stack decides whether to farm or buy."] = "尊敬到崇敬是12000點：240次交付，4800張{item:14047}。拍賣行的整組價格決定是刷還是買。",
		["Mageweave: the Jadefire satyrs in southern {zone:1448} and the Dunemaul ogres in {zone:1446} drop it about one kill in three, or buy it."] = "魔紋布：{zone:1448}南部的碧火薩特和{zone:1446}的砂槌食人魔約三殺出一，或者直接買。",
		["Makrura and surf crawlers walk the beaches east and south of Sen'jin. The {quest:97223} is east of the village."] = "龍蝦人和碎浪爬行者在森金以東和以南的海灘上活動。{quest:97223}在村子以東。",
		["North of the Den"] = "獸穴以北",
		["North {zone:1411}"] = "{zone:1411}北部",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 420 hand-ins, 8,400 {item:14047}. At Exalted, {npc:7952} in {area:367} sells the raptors to every Horde race: 20 gold for a level 40 raptor, 200 gold for a swift raptor at level 60 (Forever's prices); in Classic other races needed Exalted to buy them."] = "崇敬到崇拜是21000點：420次交付，8400張{item:14047}。崇拜後，{area:367}的{npc:7952}向每個部落種族出售迅猛龍：40級迅猛龍20金，60級迅捷迅猛龍200金（Forever的價格）；經典舊世中其他種族需要崇拜才能購買。",
		["Run out of {zone:1454}'s west gate and over the bridge into the {zone:1413}. {npc:3337} and {quest:809} stand at {area:379}."] = "跑出{zone:1454}西門，過橋進入{zone:1413}。{npc:3337}和{quest:809}在{area:379}。",
		["Silk: the Syndicate in {area:287} and Alterac drop it about one kill in three, or buy it."] = "絲綢：{area:287}和奧特蘭克的辛迪加約三殺出一，或者直接買。",
		["Swim to the largest of the {area:368}, south-east of the village. {quest:826}, the idols and the skulls at the circle of power are all there; the Durotar Tigers prowl the smaller islands."] = "游到村子東南{area:368}中最大的島上。{quest:826}、神像和力量法陣處的頭骨都在那裡；杜洛塔猛虎在較小的島上出沒。",
		["The Charged Thunder Lizard Organs come from the thunder lizards on {area:369}, just west of {npc:3293}."] = "充能的雷霆蜥蜴器官來自{area:369}的雷霆蜥蜴，就在{npc:3293}西面。",
		["The Razormane camps are south-west and west of {area:362}. Then head to the {area:368} for the {object:3240}: each nest gives an egg every time."] = "鋼鬃野豬人的營地在{area:362}西南和西邊。然後去{area:368}找{object:3240}：每個巢每次都給一個蛋。",
		["The cactus apples grow beside the cacti north of the Den. {npc:3287} lies wounded by the rocks to the north; {quest:790}, his big scorpid, roams close by. {quest:792} swarm at the mouth of the {area:365}; {quest:6394} lies inside: take the middle tunnel where it splits three ways."] = "仙人掌果長在獸穴以北的仙人掌旁。{npc:3287}受傷躺在北邊的岩石旁；他的大蠍子{quest:790}就在附近遊蕩。{quest:792}在{area:365}洞口成群出沒；{quest:6394}在洞裡面：在三岔口走中間的隧道。",
		["The coast and the road"] = "海岸與道路",
		["The keep is south of {area:362} on the coast. {npc:3192} is in the keep's only building; his key opens {object:3239} on the roof, and the {item:4881} inside starts {quest:830}. The sailors and marines drop the {item:4870}."] = "要塞在{area:362}以南的海岸上。{npc:3192}在要塞唯一的那棟樓裡；他的鑰匙能開啟屋頂的{object:3239}，裡面的{item:4881}會開啟{quest:830}。水手和陸戰隊員掉{item:4870}。",
		["The training weapons lie on the ground in the Den and among the boars to the north. For the peons: target a sleeping {npc:10556} and use the {item:16114} on it."] = "訓練武器散落在獸穴的地上和北面野豬群中。對付苦工：選中一個睡著的{npc:10556}，對它使用{item:16114}。",
		["The wreck"] = "沉船",
		["The wrecked ship lies in the shallows east of {area:372}. Open the Gnomish Toolboxes."] = "失事的船在{area:372}以東的淺灘裡。開啟地精工具箱。",
		["The {area:368}"] = "{area:368}",
		["Wake {npc:10556}"] = "喚醒{npc:10556}",
		["back at {npc:3139} in {area:362}"] = "回到{area:362}的{npc:3139}處",
		["her donations are handed in from her window and never enter the log"] = "她的捐獻任務在她的視窗中直接繳交，不會進入任務日誌",
		["{area:362} (optional hub)"] = "{area:362}（可選任務點）",
		["{area:362}: Sen'jin hand-ins"] = "{area:362}：森金交付",
		["{area:362}: hand in"] = "{area:362}：交付",
		["{area:363} (optional hub)"] = "{area:363}（可選任務點）",
		["{area:364}: hand in"] = "{area:364}：交付",
		["{area:364}: hand in again"] = "{area:364}：再次交付",
		["{area:367} (optional hub)"] = "{area:367}（可選任務點）",
		["{area:367}: hand in"] = "{area:367}：交付",
		["{area:369} and {area:410}"] = "{area:369}和{area:410}",
		["{area:816} and the {area:368}"] = "{area:816}和{area:368}",
		["{item:14047} to Exalted, with the old {zone:1411} quests as a fast extra that pays {zone:1454} too."] = "交{item:14047}交到崇拜，同時把{zone:1411}的舊任務當作快速補充，它們也給{zone:1454}聲望。",
		["{item:14047}: the Scarlet at {area:2266} in the {zone:1423}, the Gordok ogres outside {area:2577} in {zone:1444} and the Twilight camps of {zone:1451} drop it about one kill in three. The Auction House is faster if you have gold."] = "{item:14047}：{zone:1423}{area:2266}的血色十字軍、{zone:1444}{area:2577}外的戈多克食人魔和{zone:1451}的暮光營地約三殺出一。有金幣的話拍賣行更快。",
		["{item:14047}: the Scarlet outside {area:2266}"] = "{item:14047}：{area:2266}外的血色十字軍",
		["{item:2592}: the Thistlefur furbolgs drop it about one kill in four"] = "{item:2592}：薊皮熊怪約四殺出一",
		["{item:4306}: the Syndicate"] = "{item:4306}：辛迪加",
		["{item:4338}: the Jadefire satyrs"] = "{item:4338}：碧火薩特",
		["{npc:10556}: hit it with the {item:16114}"] = "{npc:10556}：用{item:16114}敲它",
		["{npc:14727}: how it works"] = "{npc:14727}：運作方式",
		["{npc:3117}, in {area:370}"] = "{npc:3117}，在{area:370}",
		["{npc:3144}, in {zone:1454}: {quest:787}, +50"] = "{npc:3144}，在{zone:1454}：{quest:787}，+50",
		["{npc:3145}, in the Den"] = "{npc:3145}，在獸穴裡",
		["{npc:3203} keeps a Burning Blade camp in {area:369}, south of {zone:1454}, among the thunder lizards. The supply sacks lie in {area:410}, north of {area:362}. {item:4891} drops from the crocolisks along the river to the west, about one in ten."] = "{npc:3203}在{zone:1454}以南的{area:369}設有火刃營地，周圍都是雷霆蜥蜴。補給袋在{area:362}以北的{area:410}。{item:4891}由西面河邊的鱷魚掉落，約十殺出一。",
		["{npc:3293} and Misha"] = "{npc:3293}和米莎",
		["{npc:3293} stands on the road north of {area:362}, {npc:3193} at her farm west of it."] = "{npc:3293}站在{area:362}以北的路上，{npc:3193}在村西她的農場。",
		["{npc:5765}: {quest:792}, warlocks only"] = "{npc:5765}：{quest:792}，僅限術士",
		["{npc:7952}: the raptors"] = "{npc:7952}：迅猛龍",
		["{npc:9077}: {quest:4903}, a group of five"] = "{npc:9077}：{quest:4903}，五人小隊",
		["{quest:6394}, in the cave"] = "{quest:6394}，在洞裡",
		["{quest:7837} to Exalted"] = "{quest:7837}到崇拜",
		["{quest:7837} to Honored"] = "{quest:7837}到尊敬",
		["{quest:7837} to Revered"] = "{quest:7837}到崇敬",
		["{quest:7837}: 20 {item:14047} for 50 reputation, as often as you like. Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 120 hand-ins, 2,400 {item:14047}, less what the quests gave you (a troll starts at Friendly 1,000: 100 hand-ins; an Undead or Skyborne at Neutral 2,000 first needs 20 more to reach Friendly). Hand in every 20 you carry, one after another."] = "{quest:7837}：20張{item:14047}換50點聲望，可無限重複。友善到尊敬是6000點：120次交付，2400張{item:14047}，再減去任務已給的（食人妖從友善1000點開始：100次交付；不死族或天裔從中立2000點開始，需先多交20次才到友善）。身上每攢夠20張就連續交掉。",
		["{quest:794}, from {npc:3183}"] = "{quest:794}，來自{npc:3183}",
		["{quest:805}, +50: {quest:97225} waits on it"] = "{quest:805}，+50：{quest:97225}要等它完成",
		["{quest:806}, +100: needs {quest:823} from Sen'jin"] = "{quest:806}，+100：需要森金的{quest:823}",
		["{quest:808}: click an {object:3237} skull"] = "{quest:808}：點選一顆{object:3237}頭骨",
		["{quest:828} camps outside {quest:827}, the cave just east of {zone:1454}."] = "{quest:828}在{quest:827}外面紮營，那是{zone:1454}以東不遠處的洞穴。",
		["{quest:829} is in the {object:172960}; {npc:3230} in Grommash Hold beside Thrall."] = "{quest:829}在{object:172960}裡；{npc:3230}在格羅瑪什要塞索爾旁邊。",
		["{quest:830}, +100: to {npc:3230} in {zone:1454}"] = "{quest:830}，+100：交給{zone:1454}的{npc:3230}",
		["{quest:842}, +100: to {npc:3338}"] = "{quest:842}，+100：交給{npc:3338}",
		["{quest:969} is level 60, so it pays in full. {npc:11755} in {area:2255} sends you to {npc:10307}, who stands in the same town. The {item:12334} lie on the ground in {area:2249}, the canyon at the south end of {zone:1452}, and the Frostmaul Giants there drop them too (about one in five). The giants are elite level 59 and 60 and stand close together: pick the shards at the edges, pull one giant at a time, or bring a friend."] = "{quest:969}是60級任務，所以全額給聲望。{area:2255}的{npc:11755}讓你去找同鎮的{npc:10307}。{item:12334}散落在{area:2249}——{zone:1452}南端的峽谷——的地上，那裡的霜槌巨人也會掉落（約五殺出一）。巨人是59和60級精英且站位密集：撿邊緣的碎片，一次拉一個巨人，或者帶上朋友。",
		["{quest:97225}, +100: needs {quest:805} from the Den"] = "{quest:97225}，+100：需要洞穴裡的{quest:805}",
		["{zone:1454}: {npc:3216} and {npc:3230}"] = "{zone:1454}：{npc:3216}和{npc:3230}",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/darnassus"] = (function() return {
		["About 3,700 {faction:69} reputation from low-level quests in {zone:1438} and {zone:1439}"] = "{zone:1438}和{zone:1439}的低階任務約3,700點{faction:69}聲望",
		["Capture a {npc:2164}"] = "捕獲一隻{npc:2164}",
		["Cloth, {item:11040} and the {zone:1438} and {zone:1439} hubs: the quests pay most while you level."] = "布料、{item:11040}以及{zone:1438}和{zone:1439}的任務據點：升級期間做任務給的聲望最多。",
		["Darnassus Reputation"] = "達納蘇斯聲望",
		["Dig {quest:3764} from the dirt mounds all over the crater; most of the crater's beasts and the Gorishi silithids drop it too, about one kill in three. Take far more than 20: every pouch use takes 2, about 18 for each 10 {item:11040}."] = "在環形山各處的土堆裡挖{quest:3764}；環形山的大多數野獸和戈裡什異種蟲也會掉落，約三次擊殺掉一個。多挖遠超20個：每次使用袋子消耗2個，每10個{item:11040}約需18個。",
		["Every 10 {item:11040}: 50 reputation at {npc:4217}. Keep the pouch and buy seeds as you go. It is slow: about 9 casings, 90 minutes of pouch waits, 18 {quest:3764} and 9 seed packets for each hand-in, a little over 30 reputation an hour, so run it beside the {item:14047}. {npc:7879} at {area:1116} in {zone:1444} takes {item:11040} at the same rate, 25 for 5, after his own quest."] = "每10個{item:11040}：在{npc:4217}處換50點聲望。留著袋子，邊做邊買種子。這很慢：每次交任務約需9個莢殼、90分鐘的袋子等待、18個{quest:3764}和9包種子，每小時略多於30點聲望，所以把它和{item:14047}一起做。{zone:1444}中{area:1116}的{npc:7879}在他自己的任務之後也按同樣比例收{item:11040}，5個換25點。",
		["Exalted with {faction:69}: in Classic, other races may buy the nightsabers"] = "{faction:69}崇拜：在經典版中，其他種族可購買夜刃豹",
		["Honored: in Classic Darnassus's vendors take 10% off for you, Lelanai's nightsabers (20g, the swift ones 200g) included; Forever has not settled it, and guide sites report 5% at Friendly rising to 20% at Exalted. Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation: 240 turn-ins, 4,800 {item:14047}."] = "尊敬：經典懷舊服中，達納蘇斯商人會給你 10% 折扣，包括萊蘭奈出售的夜刃豹（20 金幣，迅捷型 200 金幣）；無限尚未確定，指南網站報告為友善 5%，逐步提高到崇拜 20%。尊敬到崇敬需要 12,000 點聲望：交還 240 次，共 4,800 個 {item:14047}。",
		["Optional: the Night Elf start glade in north-east {zone:1438}, about 1,050 reputation in 30 minutes at 60. The givers stand around {area:256}, the great tree. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可選：{zone:1438}東北的夜精靈新手林地，60級時30分鐘約1,050點聲望。發任務的都站在巨樹{area:256}周圍。Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。跳過這一步就跳過這個點。",
		["Optional: the village on the road to {faction:69}, about 1,250 reputation in 45 minutes at 60. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub.\n{npc:2151} patrols the road west of the village: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the road until you meet her."] = "可選：通往{faction:69}道路上的村莊，60級時用45分鐘可獲得約1,250點聲望。Forever中，無論角色等級多少，這些舊任務都提供全額聲望。跳過本步驟即可跳過整個任務區。\n{npc:2151}在村莊西邊的道路上巡邏：如果她不在箭頭處，就沿道路走，直到遇到她。",
		["Optional: {area:442} in {zone:1439}, a boat trip from {area:702}, about 1,400 reputation in an hour at 60. The givers stand along the town's street and pier. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可選：{zone:1439}的{area:442}，從{area:702}坐船過去，60級時一小時約1,400點聲望。發任務的都在鎮上的街道和碼頭一帶。Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。跳過這一步就跳過這個點。",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 420 turn-ins, 8,400 {item:14047}. At Exalted, Lelanai at the {area:1658} in {faction:69} sells her nightsabers to other races in Classic; the Saber and Swift Saber guides cover them."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21,000點聲望：420次交任務，8,400個{item:14047}。崇拜後，經典版中{faction:69}的{area:1658}處的萊拉奈會向其他種族出售她的夜刃豹；夜刃豹和迅捷夜刃豹指南有介紹。",
		["The Blackwood furbolgs camp south of town; the grells of {quest:955}, east of town, drop the earrings; the sea turtle remains lie on the beach west of town."] = "黑木熊怪在鎮南紮營；鎮東{quest:955}的格雷爾掉落耳環；海龜殘骸躺在鎮西的海灘上。",
		["The four relics of Wakening lie in the {area:262}, south-west of {area:186}; Ferocitas and the Gnarlpine Mystics camp east of the village."] = "四件覺醒遺物位於{area:186}西南的{area:262}；費羅西塔斯和瘤背秘法師在村東紮營。",
		["The furbolg camp south of town counts for How Big a Threat; the Rabid Thistle Bears roam the woods south of town; the Highborne ghosts of the Ruins of Ameth'Aran, south-east of town, carry the relics, and Anaya's ghost walks there too; the bones lie on the beach south of town; the mushrooms grow in the {area:445} cave to the north-east."] = "鎮南的熊怪營地算作“威脅有多大”；狂暴薊熊在鎮南的樹林遊蕩；鎮東南阿米斯阿蘭廢墟的上層精靈幽靈帶著遺物，阿納雅的鬼魂也在那裡遊走；骸骨躺在鎮南的海灘上；蘑菇生長在東北{area:445}的洞穴裡。",
		["The nightsabers and boars roam the glade; the grells around {area:256} drop the {item:3297}; the totems stand in the furbolg camp north-west of the tree; the Webwood spiders live in the cave north of the glade. {npc:8584} waits outside that cave."] = "夜刃豹和野豬在林間空地遊蕩；{area:256}周圍的格雷爾掉落{item:3297}；圖騰立在樹西北的熊怪營地；蛛網林地蜘蛛住在空地以北的洞穴裡。{npc:8584}在那個洞外等著。",
		["The timberlings by the lake drop seeds and sprouts; the Gnarlpine Ambushers lurk on the road west to {faction:69}; {npc:2038} waits deep in {area:258}, north-west of the village; the dreamcatcher lies in the furbolg camp east of the village, by {npc:2107}; the Nightsabers west of the village carry the pelts."] = "湖邊的林精掉落種子和幼苗；瘤背伏擊者潛伏在向西通往{faction:69}的路上；{npc:2038}在村西北{area:258}深處等著；捕夢器在村東的熊怪營地裡、{npc:2107}旁邊；村西的夜刃豹身上帶著毛皮。",
		["The {item:5338} drops from the satyrs of {quest:956}; destroy the seal at the flame there. The {npc:6788} lairs north-east of {quest:956}; the Moonstalker Sires and Matriarchs roam the south of {zone:1439}."] = "{item:5338}由{quest:956}的薩特掉落；在那裡火焰旁摧毀封印。{npc:6788}巢居在{quest:956}東北；月行者公豹和母豹在{zone:1439}南部遊蕩。",
		["The {quest:917} lies at the back of the spider cave; the mushrooms grow by the trees, the lilies by the pools, and the {item:10640} drops from the Webwood Lurkers."] = "{quest:917}在蜘蛛洞穴深處；蘑菇長在樹旁，百合長在水塘邊，{item:10640}由蛛網林地潛伏者掉落。",
		["the blue aura in the ruins of {quest:954}"] = "{quest:954}廢墟中的藍色光環",
		["the corrupt furbolg camp south of town"] = "城鎮南邊被腐化的熊怪營地",
		["the seal at the ancient flame"] = "古老火焰處的封印",
		["{area:186}: first hand-in"] = "{area:186}：第一次交任務",
		["{area:186}: the relics and Ferocitas"] = "{area:186}：遺物與費羅西塔斯",
		["{area:186}: the woods around the village"] = "{area:186}：村莊周圍的樹林",
		["{area:186}: the {area:262}'s entrance"] = "{area:186}：{area:262}的入口",
		["{area:186}: {npc:2080} and the lake"] = "{area:186}：{npc:2080}與湖泊",
		["{area:188}: first hand-in"] = "{area:188}：第一次交任務",
		["{area:188}: last hand-in"] = "{area:188}：最後一次交任務",
		["{area:188}: the egg and the antidote"] = "{area:188}：蛋與解藥",
		["{area:188}: the glade and the spider den"] = "{area:188}：林間空地與被蜘蛛巢",
		["{area:442}: first hand-in"] = "{area:442}：第一次交任務",
		["{area:442}: second hand-in"] = "{area:442}：第二次交任務",
		["{area:442}: the coast and the woods"] = "{area:442}：海岸與樹林",
		["{area:442}: the furbolgs, the bears and the grells"] = "{area:442}：熊怪、熊與格雷爾",
		["{area:442}: the seal, the {npc:6788} and the pelts"] = "{area:442}：封印、{npc:6788}與毛皮",
		["{item:11040} (optional)"] = "{item:11040}（可選）",
		["{item:11040}: grow it here and open the casings"] = "{item:11040}：在這裡種植並開啟莢殼",
		["{item:14047} drops from humanoids level 50 and up: the Deadwood furbolgs of {zone:1448}, the Winterfall furbolgs of {zone:1452}, the Scourge cultists of the Plaguelands. Keep any {item:14047} past the first 60 for {quest:7801}."] = "{item:14047}由50級及以上人形怪掉落：{zone:1448}的枯木熊怪、{zone:1452}的冬泉熊怪、瘟疫之地的天災教徒。頭60個之後的{item:14047}都留給{quest:7801}。",
		["{item:2592}: furbolgs, satyrs and naga in {zone:1439} and {zone:1440}"] = "{item:2592}：{zone:1439}和{zone:1440}的熊怪、薩特和納迦",
		["{item:4306} drops from humanoids level 23 to 40: the satyrs and furbolgs of {zone:1440}, the Thistlefur and Foulweald camps, the Grimtotem of Stonetalon."] = "{item:4306}由23到40級人形怪掉落：{zone:1440}的薩特和熊怪、薊皮和邪林營地、石爪山的恐怖圖騰。",
		["{item:4338} drops from humanoids level 35 to 50: the Hatecrest naga and Gordunni ogres of {zone:1444}, the Dunemaul ogres of {zone:1446}."] = "{item:4338}由35到50級人形怪掉落：{zone:1444}的憎恨之冠納迦和戈杜尼食人魔、{zone:1446}的砂槌食人魔。",
		["{item:8050}, from {quest:2459}"] = "{item:8050}，來自{quest:2459}",
		["{npc:14725} takes cloth for {faction:69}; he stands in the {area:1659}, in the north-east of {faction:69}, by the tailors. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and {item:14047} pays 150 reputation once; after the {item:14047} one, {quest:7801} pays 50 for every 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. The Auction House in the {area:1662} is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do {zone:1438} (levels 1-12), {zone:1439} (11-20) and {zone:1440} (18-30) while you level through them. After the donations come {quest:4183} in the {zone:1428} and {item:11040}, a second repeatable turn-in; then the optional hubs, best rate first: {area:188} (about 35 a minute at full value), {area:186} (28), {area:442} (23). Every {faction:69} gain also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and the Gnomeregan Exiles, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "{npc:14725}為{faction:69}收布料；他站在{faction:69}東北的{area:1659}，裁縫鋪旁。首次各捐60個毛料、絲綢、魔紋布和{item:14047}，各給一次150點聲望；捐過{item:14047}之後，{quest:7801}每20個{item:14047}給50點，想做多少次都行。{area:1662}的拍賣行是獲取布料最快的來源。經典版中，任務最多比你低5級時仍給全額聲望，所以趁升級時做{zone:1438}（1-12級）、{zone:1439}（11-20級）和{zone:1440}（18-30級）。捐完之後，還有{zone:1428}的{quest:4183}和{item:11040}這第二種可重複交任務；接著是可選的樞紐，按時效從高到低：{area:188}（全額時約每分鐘35點）、{area:186}（28）、{area:442}（23）。除1-10級起始區域的任務外，每獲得一點{faction:69}聲望，也會給{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和諾莫瑞根流亡者四分之一。Legacy Diplomat最多為每筆聲望加成10%。",
		["{npc:14725}, the cloth quartermaster"] = "{npc:14725}，布料軍需官",
		["{npc:2080} tends his garden on the south-east shore of {area:259}; {npc:2107} stands upstairs in a house in {area:260}, east of {area:186}: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:2080}在{area:259}東南岸照料他的園子；{npc:2107}站在{area:186}以東{area:260}一座房子的樓上：從裡面上去，箭頭分不清樓層。",
		["{npc:2151} patrols the road west of the village: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the road until you meet her."] = "{npc:2151}在村莊西邊的道路上巡邏：如果她不在箭頭處，沿著道路走直到遇見她。",
		["{npc:2164}: use {quest:2139} on it and lead it back to {npc:3701}"] = "{npc:2164}：對它使用{quest:2139}，然後帶回{npc:3701}那裡",
		["{npc:344} waits in the town hall of {area:69}; his next quest takes you to {object:2117} (the {zone:1453} guide follows it). Other {faction:69} quests at this level, for when you pass by: {npc:7916} in {area:702} has a wildkin chain into {zone:1452} (325 in all, with Ranshalla's escort), Arei's escort in {zone:1448} pays 150 after the {area:2479}'s chain, {npc:10739} at the {area:202} in the {zone:1422} 100 for the {item:12663}, and Put Her Down in Upper Blackrock Spire 100 with a group."] = "{npc:344}在{area:69}的鎮公所等著；他的下一個任務會把你引向{object:2117}（隨後接{zone:1453}指南）。這個等級其他{faction:69}任務，路過時可以順帶做：{area:702}的{npc:7916}有一條通往{zone:1452}的野性生物任務鏈（含蘭莎拉的護送共325點）；{zone:1448}的阿雷伊護送在{area:2479}任務鏈之後給150點；{zone:1422}的{area:202}處{npc:10739}為{item:12663}給100點；還有上層黑石塔的“放倒她”，組隊給100點。",
		["{npc:8584}, outside the spider cave"] = "{npc:8584}，蜘蛛洞穴外",
		["{npc:9047}, beside Fandral in the {area:1658}, takes the soil. {npc:4217} sells the {item:11020} and Packets of Tharlendris Seeds. With a seed packet and 2 {quest:3764} in your bags, use the pouch to grow an {item:11024} and open it: about one casing in three holds {item:11040} (1 to 5), the rest other herbs. The pouch works once every 10 minutes, so use it whenever it is ready while you do other things."] = "{npc:9047}在{area:1658}範達爾身旁收泥土。{npc:4217}出售{item:11020}和塔倫德里斯種子包。揹包裡有種子包和2個{quest:3764}時，用袋子種出一個{item:11024}並開啟它：約三分之一的莢殼含{item:11040}（1到5個），其餘是別的草藥。袋子每10分鐘只能用一次，所以做別的事時一好就用。",
		["{npc:9562} at {area:2418}, in the south-east of the {zone:1428}, starts {quest:4183}: 175 {faction:69} reputation for two quests (level 54: in Classic 140 at 60), and the chain goes on to {object:2117} for 175 {zone:1453}. The Black Broodlings and the {npc:7044} live on the slopes north of the Vigil; the {npc:7040} and {npc:7041} west of it, in the middle of the zone."] = "{zone:1428}東南{area:2418}的{npc:9562}開啟{quest:4183}：兩個任務共175點{faction:69}聲望（54級：經典版60級時140點），任務鏈繼續到{object:2117}，給175點{zone:1453}聲望。黑色雛龍和{npc:7044}住在守望崗哨以北的山坡；{npc:7040}和{npc:7041}在其以西、區域中部。",
		["{quest:3803} takes 10 {item:11040} for 50, as often as you like, and pays in full at 60. The chain before it is level 50: 220. {npc:6735} sends you to {npc:3516} in the {area:1658}; he wants 20 {quest:3764}. (The innkeepers of {zone:1453} and {zone:1455} give the same start.)"] = "{quest:3803}收10個{item:11040}給50點，可重複，60級足額給。它前面的任務鏈是50級：220點。{npc:6735}把你派去{area:1658}的{npc:3516}；他要20個{quest:3764}。（{zone:1453}和{zone:1455}的旅店老闆給同樣的起點。）",
		["{quest:3803}: 50 reputation for every 10 {item:11040}, as often as you like"] = "{quest:3803}：每10個{item:11040}給50點聲望，可無限重複",
		["{quest:486}, a big bear, roams the {area:478} in south-west {zone:1438}."] = "{quest:486}，一隻大熊，在{zone:1438}西南的{area:478}遊蕩。",
		["{quest:7801} to Exalted"] = "{quest:7801}到崇拜",
		["{quest:7801} to Honored"] = "{quest:7801}到尊敬",
		["{quest:7801} to Revered"] = "{quest:7801}到崇敬",
		["{quest:7801}: 50 reputation for 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. After the four first donations a Human, Dwarf or Gnome stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 {item:14047} (Night Elves start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; Skyborne start at Neutral 500, so 7,900 away: 158, two fewer after Exploring the Alliance). {quest:4183} and the {item:11040} chain above take 8 turn-ins off, and every 10 {item:11040} you hand in counts as one more; each hub you did takes 20 to 28 more off. More quests pay {faction:69}, in full while they are no more than 5 levels below you: the rest of {zone:1439} (about 3,400 more), {area:415} in {zone:1440} (about 3,900) and Feathermoon in {zone:1444} (about 1,700). Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your {item:14047} at once."] = "{quest:7801}：20塊{item:14047}換50點聲望，可重複。前四次捐贈之後，人類、矮人或地精處在友善 700/6,000，離崇敬還差5,300：106次交付，2,120塊{item:14047}（夜精靈起點高900：88次；空裔從中立 500 開始，差7,900：158次，做了“探索聯盟”後再少兩次）。{quest:4183}和上面的{item:11040}鏈能減掉8次，每交10個{item:11040}再算一次；你每做過一個任務點再減20到28次。還有更多工給{faction:69}聲望，只要等級差不低於5級就足額：{zone:1439}的其餘部分（再約3,400）、{zone:1440}的{area:415}（約3,900）和{zone:1444}的羽月要塞（約1,700）。每次城市聲望收益還會給另外三個聯盟城市四分之一（此處不計）。把所有{item:14047}一次交清。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/gnomeregan-exiles"] = (function() return {
		["400 {area:133} reputation from {npc:9616}'s ooze jars and {quest:4262} (level 52-54)"] = "{npc:9616}的軟泥瓶和{quest:4262}（52-54級）帶來的400點{area:133}聲望",
		["About 3,000 {area:133} reputation from low-level quests in {zone:1426}, paid to {zone:1455} too"] = "{zone:1426}的低階任務約3,000點{area:133}聲望，同時也給{zone:1455}",
		["Cloth, {npc:9616}'s ooze quests and the {zone:1426} hubs, which pay {zone:1455} too: best done while leveling."] = "布料、{npc:9616}的軟泥怪任務以及{zone:1426}的任務點，同時也會提升{zone:1455}聲望：最好在升級時完成。",
		["Coldridge: on to {area:131}"] = "寒脊山谷：前往{area:131}",
		["Coldridge: the hot Mornbrew"] = "寒脊山谷：滾燙的晨釀",
		["Coldridge: wolves, troggs and {npc:8416}'s things"] = "寒脊山谷：狼、穴居人和{npc:8416}的東西",
		["Coldridge: {area:77} and {npc:714}"] = "寒脊山谷：{area:77}和{npc:714}",
		["Coldridge: {npc:786} and the troll cave"] = "寒脊山谷：{npc:786}和食人妖洞",
		["Exalted with {faction:54}: in Classic, other races may buy the mechanostriders"] = "{faction:54}達到崇拜：在經典版中，其他種族可購買機械陸行鳥",
		["Gnomeregan Exiles Reputation"] = "諾姆瑞根流亡者聲望",
		["Honored: in Classic the {faction:54}' vendors take 10% off for you, {npc:7955}'s mechanostriders (20g, the swift ones 200g) included; Forever has not settled it, and guide sites report 5% at Friendly rising to 20% at Exalted. Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation: 240 turn-ins, 4,800 {item:14047}."] = "尊敬：經典懷舊服中，{faction:54} 商人會給你 10% 折扣，包括 {npc:7955} 出售的機械陸行鳥（20 金幣，迅捷型 200 金幣）；無限尚未確定，指南網站報告為友善 5%，逐步提高到崇拜 20%。尊敬到崇敬需要 12,000 點聲望：交還 240 次，共 4,800 個 {item:14047}。",
		["Optional: eastern {zone:1426}, from {npc:264936}'s camp to the {area:134} and {area:803}, about 500 reputation in 30 minutes at 60. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可選：{zone:1426}東部，從{npc:264936}的營地到{area:134}和{area:803}，60級時30分鐘約500點聲望。Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。跳過這一步就跳過這個點。",
		["Optional: the Dwarf and Gnome start valley south-west of {area:131}, about 1,150 reputation in 30 minutes at 60. {npc:658} and {npc:713} stand at {area:77}. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可選：{area:131}西南的矮人和地精新手山谷，60級時30分鐘約1,150點聲望。{npc:658}和{npc:713}站在{area:77}。Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。跳過這一步就跳過這個點。",
		["Optional: {area:131} and the Brewnall and {area:133} roads around it, about 1,300 reputation in 50 minutes at 60. Most givers stand in and around the {area:2102} and at {area:189} east of it. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可選：{area:131}以及周圍的不來梅爾和{area:133}道路，60級時50分鐘約1,300點聲望。發任務的多在{area:2102}內外和它以東的{area:189}。Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。跳過這一步就跳過這個點。",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 420 turn-ins, 8,400 {item:14047}. At Exalted, {npc:7955} at {area:189} in {zone:1426} sells her mechanostriders to other races in Classic; the Mechanostrider and Swift Mechanostrider guides cover them."] = "崇敬到崇拜是21,000點聲望：420次上交，8,400個{item:14047}。崇拜後，經典舊世裡{zone:1426}的{area:189}處{npc:7955}會把她的機械陸行鳥賣給其他種族；機械陸行鳥和迅捷機械陸行鳥指南有詳細介紹。",
		["The Cursed and Tainted Oozes slide about the streams and fel pools around {area:1763} and {area:1765}: kill one and use an empty jar on its remains."] = "被詛咒的軟泥怪和受汙染的軟泥怪在{area:1763}和{area:1765}周圍的溪流和邪能水池裡滑行：殺一隻，在它的殘骸上使用空瓶。",
		["The Dark Iron Spies lurk around Farsen's camp; the troggs dig in the {area:134}; {npc:1388}, a big snow leopard, prowls the hills above {area:803}."] = "黑鐵間諜潛伏在法爾森營地附近；穴居人在{area:134}挖掘；{npc:1388}，一隻大雪豹，在{area:803}上方的山丘遊蕩。",
		["The Primal Oozes live in the pools around {area:537} in the middle of the crater; the Muculent and Glutinous Oozes fill the jars too. Kill one and use a jar on its remains."] = "原始軟泥怪生活在火山口中央{area:537}周圍的水池裡；黏液軟泥怪和膠質軟泥怪也能裝滿瓶子。殺一隻，在它的殘骸上使用瓶子。",
		["The Scalding Mornbrew cools in five minutes: run straight to {npc:836} at {area:77}."] = "滾燙的晨釀五分鐘後就會涼：直接跑到{area:77}的{npc:836}那裡。",
		["The boars and bears roam around {area:131}; the wendigos live in the {area:136} south-west of town; the leper gnomes at the {area:133} road carry the cogs and gears; Rumbleshot's ammo lies at his camp west of town."] = "野豬和熊在{area:131}周圍遊蕩；溫迪戈住在小鎮西南的{area:136}；{area:133}路上的麻風地精帶著齒輪和零件；朗布林肖特的彈藥在他的營地、小鎮西邊。",
		["The quarry and {area:803}"] = "採石場與{area:803}",
		["The quarry: troggs, spies and {npc:1388}"] = "採石場：穴居人、間諜和{npc:1388}",
		["The wolves roam the valley floor; the troggs dig in the camps east of {area:77}; {npc:8416}'s box, chest and bucket lie in the trogg camps."] = "狼在山谷底部遊蕩；穴居人在{area:77}東邊的營地挖掘；{npc:8416}的箱子、木箱和水桶在穴居人營地裡。",
		["walk to the back of the cave"] = "走到洞穴深處",
		["{area:131}: Brewnall and {quest:287}"] = "{area:131}：布瑞恩諾爾和{quest:287}",
		["{area:131}: back in town"] = "{area:131}：回到鎮上",
		["{area:131}: last hand-in"] = "{area:131}：最後一次交任務",
		["{area:131}: the hills and the depot"] = "{area:131}：山丘與補給站",
		["{area:2418}: hand in"] = "{area:2418}：交任務",
		["{area:254} stands in the west of the {zone:1428}. {quest:4262}, a fire elemental, walks the lava paths inside it, near the door of {area:1584} but outside the dungeon: at 60 you take him alone."] = "{area:254}位於{zone:1428}西部。{quest:4262}，一個火元素，在裡面的熔岩路徑上走動，靠近{area:1584}門口但在地城外：60級時可以單挑他。",
		["{item:14047} drops from humanoids level 50 and up: the Scourge cultists and Scarlet Crusade in the Plaguelands, the Deadwood furbolgs of {zone:1448}, the Winterfall furbolgs of {zone:1452}. Keep any {item:14047} past the first 60 for {quest:7812}."] = "{item:14047}由50級及以上的人形怪掉落：瘟疫之地的天災教徒和血色十字軍、{zone:1448}的死木熊怪、{zone:1452}的冬泉熊怪。前60個之外的{item:14047}都留著給{quest:7812}。",
		["{item:2592}: troggs, gnolls and kobolds in {zone:1432} and the {zone:1437}"] = "{item:2592}：{zone:1432}和{zone:1437}的穴居人、豺狼人和狗頭人",
		["{item:4306} drops from humanoids level 23 to 40: the Dragonmaw of the {zone:1437}, the Syndicate of Alterac and Arathi, Stranglethorn's trolls."] = "{item:4306}由23到40級的人形怪掉落：{zone:1437}的龍喉、奧特蘭克和阿拉希的辛迪加、荊棘谷的食人妖。",
		["{item:4338} drops from humanoids level 35 to 50: the Shadowforge and {object:147516} dwarves of the {zone:1418} and {zone:1427}, the Dunemaul ogres of {zone:1446}, the Hatecrest naga of {zone:1444}."] = "{item:4338}由35到50級的人形怪掉落：{zone:1418}和{zone:1427}的暗爐和{object:147516}矮人、{zone:1446}的砂槌食人魔、{zone:1444}的憎恨之鱗納迦。",
		["{npc:1252}, in {area:131}"] = "{npc:1252}，在{area:131}",
		["{npc:1274}, in the throne room"] = "{npc:1274}，在王座廳",
		["{npc:1374} stands by {area:137} on the lake north-west of {area:131}; {quest:287} is the troll cave west of it."] = "{npc:1374}站在{area:131}西北湖邊{area:137}旁；{quest:287}在它西邊的食人妖洞。",
		["{npc:14724} takes cloth for the {faction:54}; he stands in {object:171524} in {zone:1455}, by the tram. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and {item:14047} pays 150 reputation once; after the {item:14047} one, {quest:7812} pays 50 for every 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. The Auction House in the Commons is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do {zone:1426} (levels 1-12) and {npc:4077}'s quests in Stonetalon (20-25) while you level. After the donations come {npc:9616}'s ooze quests and {quest:4262} (400), then the optional {zone:1426} hubs, best rate first: {area:132} (about 38 a minute at full value), {area:131} (26), the quarry (17). Every {area:133} gain also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "{npc:14724}為{faction:54}收布；他站在{zone:1455}地鐵旁的{object:171524}。首次各捐60個毛料、絲綢、魔紋布和{item:14047}，每次給150點聲望；交完{item:14047}那次後，{quest:7812}每20個{item:14047}給50點，想交多少次都行。公共區的拍賣行是最快的布匹來源。經典舊世裡，只要任務最多低於你5級，就按全額給聲望，所以練級時做{zone:1426}（1-12級）和{npc:4077}在石爪山的任務（20-25級）。捐贈之後是{npc:9616}的軟泥任務和{quest:4262}（400點），然後是可選{zone:1426}任務點，按效率從高到低：{area:132}（全額時每分鐘約38）、{area:131}（26）、採石場（17）。每一份{area:133}聲望收益還會以四分之一的比例給{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和{zone:1457}，1-10級新手區的任務除外。傳承外交官能讓每份收益最多提高10%。",
		["{npc:14724}, the cloth quartermaster"] = "{npc:14724}，布匹軍需官",
		["{npc:6806}, in the inn"] = "{npc:6806}，在旅店裡",
		["{npc:786} camps south of {area:77}, at the mouth of the troll cave; the journal lies at the back of the cave."] = "{npc:786}在{area:77}以南紮營，就在食人妖洞口；手記在洞穴深處。",
		["{npc:9561} at {area:2418}, in the south-east of the {zone:1428}, wants {quest:4262} dead: 100 {area:133} reputation (level 52: in Classic 40 at 60). Her next quest, Incendius!, needs a {area:1584} group: 100 more, in full."] = "{npc:9561}在{area:2418}，位於{zone:1428}東南部，要{quest:4262}死：100點{area:133}聲望（52級：經典舊世裡60級時40點）。她的下一個任務“Incendius!”需要一個{area:1584}隊伍：再給100點，全額。",
		["{npc:9616} in {object:171524} wants ooze samples for her research: 150 {area:133} reputation for each of her two quests (level 52 and 54: in Classic 60 and 120 of it at 60). She hands you the empty jars."] = "{object:171524}處的{npc:9616}要為研究收集軟泥樣本：她的兩個任務（52級和54級）各給150點{area:133}聲望（經典舊世裡60級時分別是60點和120點）。她會把空瓶交給你。",
		["{object:171524}: hand in"] = "{object:171524}：交任務",
		["{object:171524}: the second jars"] = "{object:171524}：第二批瓶子",
		["{quest:7812} to Exalted"] = "{quest:7812}到崇拜",
		["{quest:7812} to Honored"] = "{quest:7812}到尊敬",
		["{quest:7812} to Revered"] = "{quest:7812}到崇敬",
		["{quest:7812}: 50 reputation for 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. After the four first donations a Human, Dwarf or Night Elf stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 {item:14047} (Gnomes start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; Skyborne start at Neutral 2,000, so 6,400 away: 128, two fewer after Exploring the Alliance). {npc:9616}'s and {npc:9561}'s quests above take 8 turn-ins off; each {zone:1426} hub you did takes 10 to 26 more off. Outside Dun Morogh Gnomeregan pays little: {npc:4077}'s quests in Stonetalon (about 500) and {object:171524}'s {area:133} dungeon quests. Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your {item:14047} at once."] = "{quest:7812}：20塊{item:14047}換50點聲望，可重複。前四次捐贈之後，人類、矮人或夜精靈處在友善 700/6,000，離崇敬還差5,300：106次交付，2,120塊{item:14047}（地精起點高900：88次；空裔從中立 2,000 開始，差6,400：128次，做了“探索聯盟”後再少兩次）。上面{npc:9616}和{npc:9561}的任務能減掉8次；你每做過一個{zone:1426}任務點再減10到26次。在丹莫德以外諾莫瑞根給得很少：{npc:4077}在石爪山的任務（約500）和{object:171524}的{area:133}地城任務。每次城市聲望收益還會給另外三個聯盟城市四分之一（此處不計）。把所有{item:14047}一次交清。",
		["{zone:1448}: Cursed and Tainted Oozes"] = "{zone:1448}：被詛咒的軟泥怪和受汙染的軟泥怪",
		["{zone:1449}: Primal Oozes"] = "{zone:1449}：原始軟泥怪",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/hydraxian-waterlords"] = (function() return {
		["Elementals to Honored"] = "元素生物到尊敬",
		["Everyone starts Neutral with the Waterlords, and their reputation comes from killing the servants of fire, air and earth. {npc:13278}'s quests aren't offered on Forever yet: they come back when the {area:2717} opens. The numbers in this guide leave out the Legacy perk Diplomat, which adds up to 10%.\nNeutral to Honored is 9,000 reputation. It comes from the elementals: 5 per {npc:11744} or {npc:11746}, which drift around the {area:2740} in the north-west of {zone:1451}, or {npc:7032} (the {zone:1428}), about 1,800 kills from Neutral. They stop at 5,999 of 6,000 Friendly, one point short, so the last point needs a kill that still counts there: {npc:14478}, a rare air elemental in the {area:2740} (25), or {npc:9017} at the {object:174825} in {area:1584} (15, a five-player dungeon). Those two keep paying through Honored as well."] = "每個人與水元素領主的關係都從中立開始，聲望來自擊殺火、空氣和土的僕從。{npc:13278}的任務在Forever上還未提供：等{area:2717}開放後才會回來。本指南中的數字沒有計入傳承特權外交家，它最多增加10%。\n從中立到尊敬需要9,000聲望。聲望來自元素：每隻{npc:11744}或{npc:11746}5點，牠們在{zone:1451}西北部的{area:2740}周圍遊蕩，或者{npc:7032}（{zone:1428}），從中立開始大約1,800次擊殺。牠們在友好5,999/6,000時停止，差一點，所以最後一點需要一次在那裡仍然計數的擊殺：{npc:14478}，{area:2740}中的稀有空氣元素（25），或{area:1584}的{object:174825}處的{npc:9017}（15，五人地城）。這兩者在尊敬期間也會繼續給聲望。",
		["Hydraxian Waterlords Reputation"] = "海達希亞水元素聲望",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation. The trash has stopped, but all nine bosses still pay while you are Revered: 100 each from the seven, 150 from {npc:11988} and 200 from {npc:11502}, 1,050 a clear: about 20 clears. The seven stop at 20,999 of 21,000 Revered, so the last point comes from {npc:11988} or {npc:11502}, and from Exalted on only those two pay."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21,000聲望。小怪已不再計數，但在崇敬階段九個首領仍然給：七個各100，{npc:11988}給150，{npc:11502}給200，一次全清1,050：大約20次全清。那七個在崇敬20,999/21,000處停止，所以最後一點來自{npc:11988}或{npc:11502}；到崇拜之後只有這兩個還給。",
		["The reputation kills to Honored, and the reusable {item:22754} at Revered once the {area:2717} opens."] = "擊殺到尊敬的聲望，以及{area:2717}開放後在崇敬時取得的可重複使用的{item:22754}。",
		["The {item:22754}"] = "{item:22754}",
		["{area:2717} to Exalted"] = "{area:2717}到崇拜",
		["{area:2717} to Revered"] = "{area:2717}到崇敬",
		["{item:22754}, ask the Duke"] = "{item:22754}，向公爵索要",
		["{npc:12118} and the other bosses, 100: they carry you past 11,999"] = "{npc:12118}和其他首領，100：他們把你帶過11,999",
		["{npc:13278} stands on a small island off the east coast of {zone:1447}; swim out to him. At Revered he gives you the {item:22754}: pour it on a rune in the {area:2717} to douse it. It is not used up, so you never come back for another. With every rune doused, {npc:12018} comes out, and after him {npc:11502}."] = "{npc:13278}站在{zone:1447}東海岸外的一個小島上；游過去找他。崇敬時他會給你{item:22754}：把它倒在{area:2717}裡的符文上熄滅它。它不會用完，所以你不用再回來拿。所有符文熄滅後，{npc:12018}會出來，之後是{npc:11502}。",
		["{npc:14478}, rare, 25"] = "{npc:14478}，稀有，25",
		["{npc:227939} is a raid of 40 and not open on Forever yet. Once it is: every elemental there pays, Firewalkers, Flameguards, Lava Elementals, Lava Reavers and Molten Destroyers 40, Firelords, Lava Surgers, Molten Giants and Ancient Core Hounds 20, up to 11,999 of 12,000 Honored; about 3,360 for a full clear of the trash.\nHonored to Revered is 12,000 reputation. The trash still counts, so a full clear pays about 3,360 plus 700 from the seven bosses, 150 from {npc:11988} and 200 from {npc:11502}: about three clears. {npc:9017} (15) and {npc:9816} (50) count too while you are Honored. The trash stops at 11,999 of 12,000 Honored; the bosses carry you over."] = "{npc:227939}是40人團隊副本，Forever上還未開放。開放後：那裡的每個元素都給聲望，火焰行者（{npc:11666}）、烈焰守衛（{npc:11667}）、熔岩元素（{npc:12076}）、熔岩掠奪者（{npc:12100}）和熔火毀滅者（{npc:11659}）40點，火焰領主、熔岩奔騰者（{npc:12101}）、熔火巨人（{npc:11658}）和上古熔火惡犬（{npc:11673}）20點，直到尊敬11,999/12,000；清完全部小怪大約3,360點。\n從尊敬到崇敬需要12,000聲望。小怪仍然計數，所以一次全清大約3,360，加上七個首領700點、{npc:11988}150點和{npc:11502}200點：大約三次全清。尊敬期間{npc:9017}（15）和{npc:9816}（50）也計數。小怪在尊敬11,999/12,000時停止；首領會讓你越過。",
		["{npc:9017}, {area:1584}: 15, group up"] = "{npc:9017}，{area:1584}：15點，組隊前往",
		["{npc:9816} is a boss in Upper Blackrock Spire, inside {area:254}: a group of up to ten, and someone needs the {item:12344} to open the door. He pays 50 reputation per kill up to 11,999 of 12,000 Honored."] = "{npc:9816}是黑石塔上層的首領，在{area:254}裡面：最多十人的小隊，需要有人帶著{item:12344}才能開門。每次擊殺他給50聲望，直到尊敬11,999/12,000。",
		["{npc:9816}: raid of ten"] = "{npc:9816}：十人團隊",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/ironforge"] = (function() return {
		["About 2,900 {faction:47} reputation from low-level quests in {zone:1426}, most of it paid to {area:133} too"] = "{zone:1426}的低階任務約2,900點{faction:47}聲望，其中大部分也給{area:133}",
		["About 600 {faction:47} reputation from level 52-59 quests in the {zone:1428} and {zone:1452}; {zone:1459}'s quests pay {faction:47} too"] = "{zone:1428}和{zone:1452}的52-59級任務約提供600點{faction:47}聲望；{zone:1459}的任務也會提升{faction:47}聲望",
		["Cloth, the {zone:1428} quests and the {zone:1426} hubs, which pay {area:133} too; {zone:1459} adds more."] = "布匹、{zone:1428}的任務和{zone:1426}的各任務點，同時也會給{area:133}；{zone:1459}還能再加一些。",
		["Coldridge: on to {area:131}"] = "寒脊山谷：前往{area:131}",
		["Coldridge: the hot Mornbrew"] = "寒脊山谷：滾燙的晨釀",
		["Coldridge: wolves, troggs and {npc:8416}'s things"] = "寒脊山谷：狼、穴居人和{npc:8416}的東西",
		["Coldridge: {area:77} and {npc:714}"] = "寒脊山谷：{area:77}和{npc:714}",
		["Coldridge: {npc:786} and the troll cave"] = "寒脊山谷：{npc:786}和食人妖洞",
		["Exalted with {faction:47}: in Classic, other races may buy the rams"] = "{faction:47}達到崇拜：在經典版中，其他種族可購買山羊",
		["Hear {npc:8879} out"] = "聽{npc:8879}說完",
		["Honored: in Classic Ironforge's vendors take 10% off for you, {npc:1261}'s rams (20g, the swift ones 200g) included; Forever has not settled it, and guide sites report 5% at Friendly rising to 20% at Exalted. Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation: 240 turn-ins, 4,800 {item:14047}."] = "尊敬：經典懷舊服中，鐵爐堡商人會給你 10% 折扣，包括 {npc:1261} 出售的山羊（20 金幣，迅捷型 200 金幣）；無限尚未確定，指南網站報告為友善 5%，逐步提高到崇拜 20%。尊敬到崇敬需要 12,000 點聲望：交還 240 次，共 4,800 個 {item:14047}。",
		["Ironforge Reputation"] = "鐵爐堡聲望",
		["Optional: eastern {zone:1426}, from {npc:264936}'s camp to the {area:134} and {area:803}, about 500 reputation in 30 minutes at 60. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可選：{zone:1426}東部，從{npc:264936}的營地到{area:134}和{area:803}，60級時30分鐘約500點聲望。Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。跳過這一步就跳過這個點。",
		["Optional: the Dwarf and Gnome start valley south-west of {area:131}, about 1,100 reputation in 30 minutes at 60. {npc:658} and {npc:713} stand at {area:77}. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可選：{area:131}西南的矮人和地精新手山谷，60級時30分鐘約1,100點聲望。{npc:658}和{npc:713}站在{area:77}。Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。跳過這一步就跳過這個點。",
		["Optional: {area:131} and the Brewnall and {area:133} roads around it, about 1,300 reputation in 50 minutes at 60. Most givers stand in and around the {area:2102} and at {area:189} east of it. Forever pays these old quests in full at any level. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可選：{area:131}以及周圍的不來梅爾和{area:133}道路，60級時50分鐘約1,300點聲望。發任務的多在{area:2102}內外和它以東的{area:189}。Forever 裡這些舊任務任何等級都足額給分。跳過這一步就跳過這個點。",
		["Plant {npc:9176}'s head on the soft dirt mound at the top of {area:249}."] = "把{npc:9176}的頭顱插在{area:249}頂部鬆軟的土堆上。",
		["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 420 turn-ins, 8,400 {item:14047}. At Exalted, {npc:1261} at {area:803} in eastern {zone:1426} sells his rams to other races in Classic; the Ram and Swift Ram guides cover them."] = "崇敬到崇拜是21,000點聲望：420次上交，8,400個{item:14047}。崇拜後，經典舊世裡{zone:1426}東部{area:803}的{npc:1261}會把他的山羊賣給其他種族；山羊與迅捷山羊攻略中有介紹。",
		["Thaurissan and {area:252}"] = "索瑞森與{area:252}",
		["The Dark Iron Spies lurk around Farsen's camp; the troggs dig in the {area:134}; {npc:1388}, a big snow leopard, prowls the hills above {area:803}."] = "黑鐵間諜潛伏在法爾森營地附近；穴居人在{area:134}挖掘；{npc:1388}，一隻大雪豹，在{area:803}上方的山丘遊蕩。",
		["The Scalding Mornbrew cools in five minutes: run straight to {npc:836} at {area:77}."] = "滾燙的晨釀五分鐘後就會涼：直接跑到{area:77}的{npc:836}那裡。",
		["The Thaurissan relics are the carved stones in the ruins around {area:251}, west along the road: click twelve of them. {npc:9176} and the Blackrock orcs and worgs hold the camps at the foot of {area:254}, further west; each may drop a {item:11467} (about one kill in three), and {npc:9177} wants fifty. The orcs are level 50 and up, so they drop {item:14047} too: keep it for {quest:7806}."] = "索瑞森的遺物是沿路向西{area:251}周圍廢墟裡的雕刻石，點選其中十二塊。{npc:9176}和黑石獸人、座狼佔據更西邊{area:254}腳下的營地；它們每個都可能掉落{item:11467}（約三次殺一隻），而{npc:9177}要五十個。獸人是50級及以上，所以也會掉{item:14047}：留著給{quest:7806}。",
		["The boars and bears roam around {area:131}; the wendigos live in the {area:136} south-west of town; the leper gnomes at the {area:133} road carry the cogs and gears; Rumbleshot's ammo lies at his camp west of town."] = "野豬和熊在{area:131}周圍遊蕩；溫迪戈住在小鎮西南的{area:136}；{area:133}路上的麻風地精帶著齒輪和零件；朗布林肖特的彈藥在他的營地、小鎮西邊。",
		["The quarry and {area:803}"] = "採石場與{area:803}",
		["The quarry: troggs, spies and {npc:1388}"] = "採石場：穴居人、間諜和{npc:1388}",
		["The wolves roam the valley floor; the troggs dig in the camps east of {area:77}; {npc:8416}'s box, chest and bucket lie in the trogg camps."] = "狼在山谷底部遊蕩；穴居人在{area:77}東邊的營地挖掘；{npc:8416}的箱子、木箱和水桶在穴居人營地裡。",
		["These quests are level 52 to 59, so they pay in full at 60: about 600 {faction:47} reputation. {npc:8879} stands beside King Magni in the {object:171709}; he sends you to the ruins of Thaurissan in the {zone:1428}."] = "這些任務是52到59級，所以在60級足額給：約600點{faction:47}聲望。{npc:8879}站在{object:171709}裡麥格尼國王身旁；他把你派去{zone:1428}的索瑞森廢墟。",
		["With a group, {area:1584} pays more: Archesonus's chain goes on with {npc:9021} (100) and The Fate of the Kingdom (Emperor Thaurissan, 150), and {npc:9177} takes 20 Dark Iron Fanny Packs from the dwarves inside (The Good Stuff, 100). {zone:1459}, from level 51, pays {faction:47} too: its one-time quests about 1,900 as your Stormpike standing grows (the {zone:1459} guide walks them), and inside the battle 25 for every 10 Irondeep or {item:17542} and 50 for 5 Storm Crystals, as often as you like."] = "組隊時，{area:1584}給的更多：阿克森努斯的任務鏈會繼續，{npc:9021}（100點）以及“王國的命運”（索瑞森皇帝，150點），{npc:9177}還會收裡面矮人身上的20個黑鐵腰包（“好東西”，100點）。{zone:1459}從51級起也會給{faction:47}：隨著你的雷矛聲望增長，它的一次性任務約給1,900點（{zone:1459}攻略有逐步說明），戰場內每10個深鐵礦或{item:17542}給25點，5個風暴水晶給50點，想交多少次都行。",
		["walk to the back of the cave"] = "走到洞穴深處",
		["{area:131}: Brewnall and {quest:287}"] = "{area:131}：布瑞恩諾爾和{quest:287}",
		["{area:131}: back in town"] = "{area:131}：回到鎮上",
		["{area:131}: last hand-in"] = "{area:131}：最後一次交任務",
		["{area:131}: the hills and the depot"] = "{area:131}：山丘與補給站",
		["{area:2418} sits in the south-east of the {zone:1428}, at the top of the pass up from Redridge. {npc:9177} wants the Firegut ogres of {area:249}, north of the Vigil, thinned out; the Brutes keep to the rock's east side."] = "{area:2418}位於{zone:1428}東南部，在從赤脊山向上的山口頂端。{npc:9177}想讓你清理摩根崗哨以北{area:249}的火腹食人魔；蠻兵守在石頭的東側。",
		["{area:2418}: hand in"] = "{area:2418}：交任務",
		["{faction:47}: Archesonus again"] = "{faction:47}：再找阿克森努斯",
		["{item:14047} drops from humanoids level 50 and up: the Scourge cultists and Scarlet Crusade in the Plaguelands, the Deadwood furbolgs of {zone:1448}, the Winterfall furbolgs of {zone:1452}. Keep any {item:14047} past the first 60 for {quest:7806}."] = "{item:14047}由50級及以上的人形怪掉落：瘟疫之地的天災教徒和血色十字軍、{zone:1448}的死木熊怪、{zone:1452}的冬泉熊怪。前60個之外的{item:14047}都留著給{quest:7806}。",
		["{item:2592}: troggs, gnolls and kobolds in {zone:1432} and the {zone:1437}"] = "{item:2592}：{zone:1432}和{zone:1437}的穴居人、豺狼人和狗頭人",
		["{item:4306} drops from humanoids level 23 to 40: the Dragonmaw of the {zone:1437}, the Syndicate of Alterac and Arathi, Stranglethorn's trolls."] = "{item:4306}由23到40級的人形怪掉落：{zone:1437}的龍喉、奧特蘭克和阿拉希的辛迪加、荊棘谷的食人妖。",
		["{item:4338} drops from humanoids level 35 to 50: the Shadowforge and {object:147516} dwarves of the {zone:1418} and {zone:1427}, the Dunemaul ogres of {zone:1446}, the Hatecrest naga of {zone:1444}."] = "{item:4338}由35到50級的人形怪掉落：{zone:1418}和{zone:1427}的暗爐和{object:147516}矮人、{zone:1446}的砂槌食人魔、{zone:1444}的憎恨之鱗納迦。",
		["{npc:11755} in {area:2255} sends you west to {npc:10301} at {area:2253}. {npc:10301}'s damaged crate and wrecked wagon lie at {area:2245}, down the valley to the south-east; his supplies lie around the wagon and the owlbeasts nearby carry his amulet. The last quest is level 59: 100 {faction:47} in full."] = "{area:2255}的{npc:11755}派你向西去找{area:2253}的{npc:10301}。{npc:10301}損壞的木箱和毀壞的貨車在{area:2245}，沿山谷往東南下去；他的補給散落在貨車周圍，附近的貓頭鷹獸帶著他的護符。最後一個任務是59級：全額100點{faction:47}。",
		["{npc:1252}, in {area:131}"] = "{npc:1252}，在{area:131}",
		["{npc:1274}, in the throne room"] = "{npc:1274}，在王座廳",
		["{npc:1374} stands by {area:137} on the lake north-west of {area:131}; {quest:287} is the troll cave west of it."] = "{npc:1374}站在{area:131}西北湖邊{area:137}旁；{quest:287}在它西邊的食人妖洞。",
		["{npc:14723} takes cloth for {faction:47}; she stands outside the clothier on the north side of the {object:32372}, among the tailors. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and {item:14047} pays 150 reputation once; after the {item:14047} one, {quest:7806} pays 50 for every 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. The Auction House in the Commons is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do {zone:1426} (levels 1-12), {zone:1432} (10-20) and the {zone:1437} (20-30) while you level through them. After the donations come the level 52-59 quests of the {zone:1428} and {zone:1452} (about 600), then the optional {zone:1426} hubs, best rate first: {area:132} (about 37 a minute at full value), {area:131} (26), the quarry (17). Every {faction:47} gain also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1453}, {zone:1457} and the Gnomeregan Exiles, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "{npc:14723}為{faction:47}收布；她站在{object:32372}北側裁縫店外，混在裁縫中間。首次各捐60個毛料、絲綢、魔紋布和{item:14047}，每次給150點聲望；交完{item:14047}那次後，{quest:7806}每20個{item:14047}給50點，想交多少次都行。公共區的拍賣行是最快的布匹來源。經典舊世裡，只要任務最多低於你5級，就按全額給聲望，所以練級時做{zone:1426}（1-12級）、{zone:1432}（10-20級）和{zone:1437}（20-30級）。捐贈之後是{zone:1428}和{zone:1452}的52-59級任務（約600點），然後是可選{zone:1426}任務點，按效率從高到低：{area:132}（全額時每分鐘約37）、{area:131}（26）、採石場（17）。每一份{faction:47}聲望收益還會以四分之一的比例給{zone:1453}、{zone:1457}和諾莫瑞根流亡者，1-10級新手區的任務除外。傳承外交官能讓每份收益最多提高10%。",
		["{npc:14723}, the cloth quartermaster"] = "{npc:14723}，布匹軍需官",
		["{npc:6806}, in the inn"] = "{npc:6806}，在旅店裡",
		["{npc:786} camps south of {area:77}, at the mouth of the troll cave; the journal lies at the back of the cave."] = "{npc:786}在{area:77}以南紮營，就在食人妖洞口；手記在洞穴深處。",
		["{quest:7806} to Exalted"] = "{quest:7806}到崇拜",
		["{quest:7806} to Honored"] = "{quest:7806}到尊敬",
		["{quest:7806} to Revered"] = "{quest:7806}到崇敬",
		["{quest:7806}: 50 reputation for 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. After the four first donations a Human, Night Elf or Gnome stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 {item:14047} (Dwarves start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; Skyborne start at Neutral 2,000, so 6,400 away: 128, two fewer after Exploring the Alliance). The level 52-59 quests above take 12 turn-ins off; each {zone:1426} hub you did takes 10 to 26 more off. More hubs pay {faction:47}, in full while they are no more than 5 levels below you: {area:144} in {zone:1432} (about 3,500 in all) and {area:150} in the {zone:1437} (about 2,500). From level 51 {zone:1459}'s one-time quests add about 1,900. Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your {item:14047} at once."] = "{quest:7806}：20塊{item:14047}換50點聲望，可重複。前四次捐贈之後，人類、夜精靈或地精處在友善 700/6,000，離崇敬還差5,300：106次交付，2,120塊{item:14047}（矮人起點高900：88次；空裔從中立 2,000 開始，差6,400：128次，做了“探索聯盟”後再少兩次）。上面52-59級的任務能減掉12次；你每做過一個{zone:1426}任務點再減10到26次。還有更多工點給{faction:47}，只要等級差不低於5級就足額：{zone:1432}的{area:144}（共約3,500）和{zone:1437}的{area:150}（約2,500）。51級起{zone:1459}的一次性任務再加約1,900。每次城市聲望收益還會給另外三個聯盟城市四分之一（此處不計）。把所有{item:14047}一次交清。",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/kirin-tor"] = (function() return {
		["Alliance Skyborne start Friendly with the {faction:2740}, and their arrival quests The Magical City of Dalaran and Exploring the Alliance pay 100 more each, so {npc:32287} sells you the Azure recipes at once (10g each, they need skill 175). He stands upstairs in the building with the {faction:2740} banners in {area:279}, past the Sky Enclave. Buy the ones for your profession."] = "聯盟天裔與{faction:2740}初始為友善，他們的到來任務“魔法之城達拉然”和“探索聯盟”各多給100點，所以{npc:32287}會立刻向你出售碧藍配方（每個10金，需要技能175）。他站在{area:279}裡掛有{faction:2740}旗幟的建築樓上，過了天空營地就是。買你專業對應的那些。",
		["Back to Modera's image"] = "返回茉德拉的影像",
		["Back to {npc:264265}"] = "返回{npc:264265}",
		["City of Dalaran runs to Exalted"] = "刷“達拉然城”到崇拜",
		["City of Dalaran runs to Friendly"] = "刷“達拉然城”到友善",
		["Eight Azure helm and shoulder recipes at Friendly ({skill:164}, {skill:165}, {skill:197})"] = "友善時可購八種蔚藍頭盔和護肩配方（{skill:164}、{skill:165}、{skill:197}）",
		["Kirin Tor Reputation"] = "肯瑞託聲望",
		["New in Forever: {area:279}'s mages sell Azure armour recipes at Friendly and their tabard at Exalted."] = "Forever 新增：{area:279}的法師在友善時出售碧藍護甲配方，崇拜時出售他們的戰袍。",
		["Nothing is sold at Honored or Revered in the game's data. Friendly to Exalted is 39,000 reputation, all from City of Dalaran kills. In Classic most dungeon kills stop paying at Honored or Revered; whether these do is not known yet."] = "遊戲資料裡，尊敬或崇敬時沒有出售任何東西。友善到崇拜是39,000點聲望，全部來自“達拉然城”的擊殺。經典舊世裡大多數地城擊殺在尊敬或崇敬時就停止給聲望；這些是否會停尚不清楚。",
		["Skyborne: the recipes now"] = "天裔：立刻買配方",
		["The City of Dalaran"] = "達拉然城",
		["The City of Dalaran is a dungeon for levels 28 to 33: go in through the sewers with the key Modera gave you. The arcane elementals throughout the city count for {quest:92457}. The {npc:246020}, the last boss, waits in the Purple Parlor above the Violet Citadel (a portal by {npc:246748} in the Citadel takes you up) and drops the {item:251961}. Beta players saw every kill in the dungeon pay {faction:2740} reputation, the bosses the most. Group of five advised below level 35."] = "“達拉然城”是28到33級的地城：用茉德拉給你的鑰匙從下水道進入。城中各處的奧術元素都計入{quest:92457}。最後的首領{npc:246020}在紫羅蘭城堡上方的紫色會客廳等待（城堡裡{npc:246748}旁有傳送門送你上去），並掉落{item:251961}。測試服玩家看到地城裡每次擊殺都給{faction:2740}聲望，首領給得最多。35級以下建議五人隊。",
		["The quests leave a non-Skyborne at about 320 of the 3,000 Friendly needs. The rest comes from kills in the City of Dalaran dungeon: run it until Friendly. How much each kill pays is not in the game's data; the bosses pay the most. At 60 you clear it alone."] = "這些任務只能讓非天裔角色達到友善所需3,000點中的約320點。其餘來自“達拉然城”地城的擊殺：一直刷到友善。每次擊殺給多少不在遊戲資料裡；首領給得最多。60級時你可以單刷。",
		["The {area:796} stands in the north-east of {zone:1420}; Doan waits at the end of the Library wing. Group of five advised below level 40."] = "{area:796}位於{zone:1420}東北部；杜安在圖書館側翼盡頭等待。40級以下建議五人隊。",
		["The {item:285327}"] = "{item:285327}（肯瑞託戰袍）",
		["you get the {item:277507} with it"] = "同時獲得{item:277507}",
		["{item:251961}, from the {npc:246020}"] = "{item:251961}，來自{npc:246020}",
		["{item:273169}, from {npc:6487}"] = "{item:273169}，來自{npc:6487}",
		["{npc:246748}'s image"] = "{npc:246748}的影像",
		["{npc:247264} of the {faction:2740} waits in {area:271}. He sends you to {npc:246748}'s image by the shore of {area:1338}, outside {area:279}'s walls. The {faction:2740} quests start at level 24 to 30 and pay full reputation at any level in Forever."] = "{faction:2740}的{npc:247264}在{area:271}等著。他把你派去{area:1338}岸邊、{area:279}城牆外的{npc:246748}影像處。{faction:2740}的任務24到30級可接，Forever 裡任何等級都足額給聲望。",
		["{npc:252085} waits in the Violet Citadel in {area:279}."] = "{npc:252085}在{area:279}的紫羅蘭城堡裡等待。",
		["{npc:264265} in {area:279} wants a book back from {npc:6487}, the last boss of the {area:796}'s Library (levels 33 to 41), in {zone:1420}."] = "{area:279}的{npc:264265}想從{zone:1420}的{area:796}圖書館（33到41級）最後首領{npc:6487}那裡拿回一本書。",
		["{npc:32287} and {npc:28776}, the tabard vendor in {area:279}, sell the {item:285327} at Exalted for 25g."] = "{npc:32287}和{area:279}的戰袍商人{npc:28776}在崇拜時以25金出售{item:285327}。",
		["{npc:32287} sells the Azure helm and shoulder recipes at Friendly, 10g each (skill 175). He stands upstairs in the building with the {faction:2740} banners in {area:279}. Buy the ones for your profession."] = "{npc:32287}在友善時出售碧藍頭盔和護肩配方，每個10金（技能175）。他站在{area:279}裡掛有{faction:2740}旗幟的建築樓上。買你專業對應的那些。",
		["{npc:32287}: the Azure recipes"] = "{npc:32287}：碧藍配方",
} end)()
t.guides["forever/reputation/merchants-favor"] = (function() return {
		["A {item:7371} for the writ"] = "用{item:7371}交一份令狀",
		["A {item:7371} for the writ again"] = "再用{item:7371}交一份令狀",
		["After the {quest:98247}, Friendly is 1000 more: 14 Journeyman writs, 8 Expert or 5 Artisan. Expert and Artisan customers are mostly not in Polestar's data yet: follow the mark the quest puts on your map. Journeyman envelopes drop from mobs of about level 11 to 31; Expert and Artisan ones from higher mobs."] = "完成{quest:98247}後，到友善還需1000點：14份中級令狀、8份高階令狀或5份大師級令狀。高階和大師級顧客大多還不在 Polestar 的資料中：跟著任務在地圖上留下的標記走。中級信封由約11-31級的怪物掉落；高階和大師級信封來自更高階的怪物。",
		["All five stand at the {area:2240} on the {area:439}, south-east of {area:484}: {npc:4720}, the chicken \"Plucky\" Johnson, {npc:4706}, the {npc:4496} and {npc:6548}. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "五人都在{area:484}東南、{area:439}上的{area:2240}：{npc:4720}、名叫“普拉基”約翰遜的雞、{npc:4706}、{npc:4496}和{npc:6548}。顧客不顯示任務標記：照樣右鍵點選他們。",
		["All four stand around {area:431}: {npc:257315} about 850 yards south-west of it, {npc:257322} to the south, the {npc:257316} about 350 yards south-east and {npc:257317} about 650 yards north-east. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "四人都在{area:431}附近：{npc:257315}在其西南約850碼，{npc:257322}在南邊，{npc:257316}在東南約350碼，{npc:257317}在東北約650碼。顧客不顯示任務標記：照樣右鍵點選他們。",
		["Craftsman's Writs are the camp's reputation: 75 for a Journeyman writ, 125 for an Expert, 200 for an Artisan. Each asks for one crafted item, the one its title names. Make it or buy it on the Auction House; you need not know the profession. Each writ can be done once a day, and any number of different ones. Take the quest only of writs whose item you have or will buy on the way (right-click the writ), keep the writ in your bags, then tick this: the next steps lead to each customer you hold a writ for."] = "工匠契書就是這裡的聲望：學徒契書75點，專家125點，大師200點。每張都要一件製作物品，就是它標題裡寫的那件。自己做或者去拍賣行買；不需要會這個專業。每張契書每天可做一次，不同種類不限數量。只接你手上已有、或者路上會去買的那些物品的契書任務（右鍵點契書），把契書留在包裡，然後勾選這一步：接下來的步驟會帶你去找每一個你持有契書的客戶。",
		["Exalted"] = "崇拜",
		["Exalted opens the camp's tabard (200 Favor) at {npc:256389} or {npc:256384}, and the {item:262766} (6,000 Favor; the mount needs level 60 and Journeyman mount training) at {npc:256736} in {area:1002} or Okamache at the Crossroads camp. The {npc:10636} guide under Collectibles leads you there."] = "崇拜後可在{npc:256389}或{npc:256384}處購買營地戰袍（200點恩惠），並可在{area:1002}的{npc:256736}或十字路口營地的奧卡馬奇處購買{item:262766}（6,000點恩惠；坐騎需要60級和中級騎術）。收藏品分類下的{npc:10636}指南會帶你去那裡。",
		["Forever's trade camps: their best recipes, the Minimule and the {npc:10636} need standing, not only Merchant's Favor."] = "Forever的貿易營地：最好的配方、迷你騾子和{npc:10636}需要聲望等級，而不僅僅是Merchant's Favor。",
		["Friendly opens the first gated recipes at the camp's profession vendors ({skill:197} 25, {skill:165} 17, {skill:333} 13, {skill:164} 10, {skill:202} 10, {skill:171} 5, {skill:185} 2) and the Uncertified Scribe: {npc:256742} at {area:1002}, {npc:256672} at the south end of the Crossroads camp. The scribe's {item:262902} (15 Merchant's Favor) turns an empty {item:248549} into a {item:262917}; hand it to {npc:256390} or {npc:256386} for 50 reputation ({quest:93862}). Any crate works, so buy the cheapest one the Auction House has. Honored is 6000 more: 80 Journeyman writs, 48 Expert, 30 Artisan, or 120 crate returns (1,800 Favor and 120 crates). Mix both: every writ you can fill, returns with spare Favor. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "友善解鎖營地專業供應商處的第一批門檻配方（{skill:197}25、{skill:165}17、{skill:333}13、{skill:164}10、{skill:202}10、{skill:171}5、{skill:185}2），以及無證抄寫員：{area:1002}的{npc:256742}、十字路口營地南端的{npc:256672}。抄寫員的{item:262902}（15點商人的恩惠）能把一個空的{item:248549}變成{item:262917}；把它交給{npc:256390}或{npc:256386}可得50點聲望（{quest:93862}）。任何板條箱都行，所以買拍賣行裡最便宜的那個。到尊敬還需6000點：80份中級令狀、48份高階令狀、30份大師級令狀，或交還120個板條箱（1800點恩惠和120個箱子）。兩者混合：能填的令狀都做，剩餘的恩惠用交箱補。傳承特長“外交家”可使每次獲取量最多提高10%。",
		["Friendly to Honored"] = "友善到尊敬",
		["From level 10, mobs anywhere drop Waylaid Crates and sealed writs (Journeyman's, Expert's and Artisan's). Fill a crate with one of the bundles it lists (right-click it), or open a sealed writ: by beta reports, the first time you do either you also get a {quest:98247}. Right-click the label to start its quest. Crates and writs can be traded, so the Auction House sells them too."] = "從10級起，任何地方的怪物都會掉落被劫的板條箱和密封令狀（中級、高階和大師級）。用它所列出的任意一種包裹（右鍵點選箱子）裝滿箱子，或開啟一份密封令狀：據測試服報告，第一次做其中任一件事時還會得到{quest:98247}。右鍵點選標籤即可接取它的任務。板條箱和令狀都能交易，所以拍賣行也有出售。",
		["Gather your writs"] = "收集令狀",
		["Gather your writs again"] = "再次收集令狀",
		["Honored opens the rest of the gated recipes ({skill:165} 28, {skill:164} 21, {skill:333} 16, {skill:171} 15, {skill:202} 9, {skill:197} 6, {skill:185} 1), the {item:270887} (1,200 Favor from {npc:256389} or {npc:256384}: it starts the quest for a Tradeskill Sign toy) and the scribe's {item:262896} (15 Favor), which swaps a writ you cannot fill for a random one of the same rank. Revered is 12000 more: 160 Journeyman writs, 96 Expert, 60 Artisan, or 240 crate returns (3,600 Favor). Forever's quest data sets no standing limit on Journeyman writs: their customers are the ones in the zone steps above."] = "尊敬解鎖其餘的門檻配方（{skill:165}28、{skill:164}21、{skill:333}16、{skill:171}15、{skill:202}9、{skill:197}6、{skill:185}1）、{item:270887}（在{npc:256389}或{npc:256384}處以1200點恩惠購買：它會開啟專業技能招牌玩具的任務），以及抄寫員的{item:262896}（15點恩惠），可把你無法完成的令狀換成一份同等級的隨機令狀。到崇敬還需12000點：160份中級令狀、96份高階令狀、60份大師級令狀，或交還240個板條箱（3600點恩惠）。Forever 的任務資料對中級令狀沒有聲望限制：它們的顧客就是上面各區域步驟中的那些。",
		["Honored to Revered"] = "尊敬到崇敬",
		["Leatherworkers make the {item:7371}; the bow and gun vendors of {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and the {zone:1458} sell it. Otherwise buy one at the Auction House."] = "{item:7371}由制皮製作；{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和{zone:1458}的弓與槍供應商有售。否則就在拍賣行買一個。",
		["Neutral to Friendly"] = "中立到友善",
		["Profession recipes at Friendly and Honored"] = "友善和尊敬時的專業配方",
		["Revered opens the {item:284664}, the Minimule pet (1,500 Favor from {npc:256389} or {npc:256384}). Exalted is 21000 more: 280 Journeyman writs, 168 Expert, 105 Artisan, or 420 crate returns (6,300 Favor). Keep 6,000 Favor for the {npc:10636} if you want it."] = "崇敬解鎖{item:284664}，即迷你騾寵物（在{npc:256389}或{npc:256384}處以1500點恩惠購買）。到崇拜還需21000點：280份中級令狀、168份高階令狀、105份大師級令狀，或交還420個板條箱（6300點恩惠）。如果想要{npc:10636}，請留出6000點恩惠。",
		["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
		["Supply Factions Reputation"] = "補給陣營聲望",
		["Take the quests of the writs you can fill"] = "接取你能完成的令狀任務",
		["The {faction:2586} camp is at {area:1002}, where the roads from {zone:1429}, {zone:1431} and {area:69} meet in western Redridge. The label pays 2000 reputation once (and, by beta reports, 50 Merchant's Favor): two thirds of the way to Friendly. Filled crates go to {npc:256390} too, but they pay only Merchant's Favor and silver, never reputation."] = "{faction:2586}的營地在{area:1002}，即赤脊山西部{zone:1429}、{zone:1431}和{area:69}的道路交匯處。該標籤一次性給2000點聲望（據測試服報告，還有50點商人的恩惠）：相當於到友善的三分之二。裝滿的板條箱也交給{npc:256390}，但只給商人的恩惠和銀幣，從不給聲望。",
		["The {faction:2587} camp stands just outside the west gate of the Crossroads. The label pays 2000 reputation once (and, by beta reports, 50 Merchant's Favor): two thirds of the way to Friendly. Filled crates go to {npc:256386} too, but they pay only Merchant's Favor and silver, never reputation."] = "{faction:2587}的營地就在十字路口西門外。該標籤一次性給2000點聲望（據測試服報告，還有50點商人的恩惠）：相當於到友善的三分之二。裝滿的板條箱也交給{npc:256386}，但只給商人的恩惠和銀幣，從不給聲望。",
		["Your first {item:248549} or writ"] = "你的第一個{item:248549}或令狀",
		["bring it: craft it or buy it at the Auction House"] = "帶上它：自己製作或在拍賣行購買",
		["bring it: engineers make it; {npc:789} in {area:69} lists it (not yet seen in her window up to level 30), or the Auction House"] = "帶上它：工程學能做；{area:69}的{npc:789}有賣（30級前沒在她的列表裡見過），或者去拍賣行",
		["bring it: leatherworkers make it, or buy it at the Auction House"] = "帶上它：制皮能做，或者去拍賣行買",
		["{area:1002}: the {quest:98247}"] = "{area:1002}：{quest:98247}",
		["{area:35} holds three customers: \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley (on the inn's top floor), {npc:7853} at the zeppelin-style transporter pad and {npc:2663}. {npc:14508} stands about 800 yards south of {object:3202}, by the {area:1741}; {npc:261961} is in northern Stranglethorn. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{area:35}有三位顧客：旅店頂樓的“海狼”麥金利、飛艇式傳送平臺旁的{npc:7853}，以及{npc:2663}。{npc:14508}站在{object:3202}以南約800碼的{area:1741}旁；{npc:261961}在荊棘谷北部。顧客不顯示任務標記：照樣右鍵點選他們。",
		["{area:35} holds three customers: \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley (on the inn's top floor), {npc:7853}, the goblin transporter's engineer, and {npc:2663}. {npc:14508} stands at the {area:1741}, about 800 yards south of {object:3202}; {npc:261961} is in northern Stranglethorn. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{area:35}有三位顧客：旅店頂樓的“海狼”麥金利、哥布林傳送器的工程師{npc:7853}，以及{npc:2663}。{npc:14508}站在{area:1741}，位於{object:3202}以南約800碼；{npc:261961}在荊棘谷北部。顧客不顯示任務標記：照樣右鍵點選他們。",
		["{area:380} camp: the {quest:98248}"] = "{area:380}營地：{quest:98248}",
